(159197, 8662, 3080, '<td valign="top">I guess I just don''t get it, but that doesn''t mean it''s not a good PJ shot.  I''m trying to figure out what looks like ice in the forground, and the really large looking birds.    Nothing really looks ''dead'' in the shot...but oh well...I''m sure the story that went along with the shot would clear it up, and make for some funny reading, looks like.</td>', 'I guess I just don''t get it, but that doesn''t mean it''s not a good PJ shot.  I''m trying to figure out what looks like ice in the forground, and the really large looking birds.    Nothing really looks ''dead'' in the shot...but oh well...I''m sure the story that went along with the shot would clear it up, and make for some funny reading, looks like.', '2002-11-30 12:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
