(159220, 8665, 5158, '<td valign="top">Thanx everybody for the kind comments!<br/>The picture was also intended as a personal introduction to DPC.<br/>I knew that it wasn''t exposed too well, but after a long time of fiddling around with the frame, I didn''t have the time to set up the appropriate light.<br/>So for me, it turned out well.<br/></td>', 'Thanx everybody for the kind comments!The picture was also intended as a personal introduction to DPC.I knew that it wasn''t exposed too well, but after a long time of fiddling around with the frame, I didn''t have the time to set up the appropriate light.So for me, it turned out well.', '2002-12-02 04:09:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(159221, 8666, 4267, '<td valign="top">nice shot... how''d ya keep it so clear of noise?<br/>~anachronite</td>', 'nice shot... how''d ya keep it so clear of noise?~anachronite', '2002-11-25 00:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159222, 8666, 3936, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture.  Not sure about front page, but certainly one of the sections in the Sunday edtition. 9</td>', 'Beautiful picture.  Not sure about front page, but certainly one of the sections in the Sunday edtition. 9', '2002-11-25 01:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159223, 8666, 51167, '<td valign="top">Great shot of the meteors.  That was my first time trying to take some night shots and I had over 80 shots and only like 3 had anything in them and then it wasn''t as bright as this one.  The moon sucked that night didn''t it.  10 for the difficulty and the great shot.  Jubei</td>', 'Great shot of the meteors.  That was my first time trying to take some night shots and I had over 80 shots and only like 3 had anything in them and then it wasn''t as bright as this one.  The moon sucked that night didn''t it.  10 for the difficulty and the great shot.  Jubei', '2002-11-25 02:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159224, 8666, 4648, '<td valign="top">Great shot, even without a title.  I would have cropped at bottom of mountains and gotten rid of what''s out of focus.  Maybe left it in for size?  Doesn''t keep it from being a 1st place photo anyway.  PTL 10</td>', 'Great shot, even without a title.  I would have cropped at bottom of mountains and gotten rid of what''s out of focus.  Maybe left it in for size?  Doesn''t keep it from being a 1st place photo anyway.  PTL 10', '2002-11-25 09:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159225, 8666, 714, '<td valign="top">I love how you captured the landscape and all of the sky Very good work.  Vote 10 Sonifo</td>', 'I love how you captured the landscape and all of the sky Very good work.  Vote 10 Sonifo', '2002-11-25 11:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159226, 8666, 4821, '<td valign="top">nice image.  He color is great.</td>', 'nice image.  He color is great.', '2002-11-25 13:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159227, 8666, 2337, '<td valign="top">Composition ~ Wonderful!!! Just enough ground to give perspective and wonderful ground at that!  Exposure ~ Again, excellent!!! There is no rotation tails on the stars and you have beutiful detail in the ground!!! If I hadn''t known you had a full moon working as your lighting crew, I''d have suspected something illegal :)  Focus ~  Fantastic!  I haven''t seen all the shots this week, but if this doesn''t place in the top 3, I''ll be very surprised.  ~ Myqyl ~</td>', 'Composition ~ Wonderful!!! Just enough ground to give perspective and wonderful ground at that!  Exposure ~ Again, excellent!!! There is no rotation tails on the stars and you have beutiful detail in the ground!!! If I hadn''t known you had a full moon working as your lighting crew, I''d have suspected something illegal :)  Focus ~  Fantastic!  I haven''t seen all the shots this week, but if this doesn''t place in the top 3, I''ll be very surprised.  ~ Myqyl ~', '2002-11-25 15:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159228, 8666, 4411, '<td valign="top">A gorgeous photo. Glad to see you had clear skies for the show.</td>', 'A gorgeous photo. Glad to see you had clear skies for the show.', '2002-11-25 15:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
