(159249, 8666, 472, '<td valign="top">excellent capture.  the title is humorous, but i dont think it needs that or even benefits from it. the picture and the event is great enough to stand on its own. to exagerrate a bit, it would be like titling a pic of the dismantling of the Berlin Wall something like ''crazy germans mad at bricks!'' . know what i mean? beautiful pic. mag99</td>', 'excellent capture.  the title is humorous, but i dont think it needs that or even benefits from it. the picture and the event is great enough to stand on its own. to exagerrate a bit, it would be like titling a pic of the dismantling of the Berlin Wall something like ''crazy germans mad at bricks!'' . know what i mean? beautiful pic. mag99', '2002-11-28 11:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159250, 8666, 2716, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I wish our skies would have been clear.   Jacko 9</td>', 'Nice shot.  I wish our skies would have been clear.   Jacko 9', '2002-11-28 21:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
