(159259, 8666, 4186, '<td valign="top">beautiful photo, but not a headline sort of title. 9.</td>', 'beautiful photo, but not a headline sort of title. 9.', '2002-12-01 20:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159260, 8666, 2, '<td valign="top">The lighting on this shot is unreal -- great job.</td>', 'The lighting on this shot is unreal -- great job.', '2002-12-01 23:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159261, 8666, 3506, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all of the positive and constructive comments guys!  I''ve been out of town for the past week for Thanksgiving and was welcomed home by a 6th place finish!  Wow!  What a surprise!  Thanks everyone.<br/><br/>I spent about 1.5 hours and 80-100 attempts before giving up and accepting only three shots with a meteor in them.  This was the best of the three.<br/><br/>Shawn</td>', 'Thanks for all of the positive and constructive comments guys!  I''ve been out of town for the past week for Thanksgiving and was welcomed home by a 6th place finish!  Wow!  What a surprise!  Thanks everyone.I spent about 1.5 hours and 80-100 attempts before giving up and accepting only three shots with a meteor in them.  This was the best of the three.Shawn', '2002-12-02 21:31:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(159262, 8666, 527, '<td valign="top">I''m still trying to determine how I feel about this photo in regards to the photojournalism topic. I think I am leaning more towards it successfully meeting the challenge. I feel it is a strong photo with some very nice subtleties to it with the detail in the hills, the stars, and of course, the meteor. Even the stars form a nice shape. what bothers me a little bit is the blurred bush in the foerground clearly due to the long exposure and I''m sure, unavoidable. I may have cropped the photo at the base of the mountains but I''m not sure. The colors are true and I''m glad you didn''t try to oversaturate them. The beauty of this photo lies in it''s simplicity. It does not overpower you yet it drws you in to explore the details. Nice job.<br/><br/>Tim Jensen</td>', 'I''m still trying to determine how I feel about this photo in regards to the photojournalism topic. I think I am leaning more towards it successfully meeting the challenge. I feel it is a strong photo with some very nice subtleties to it with the detail in the hills, the stars, and of course, the meteor. Even the stars form a nice shape. what bothers me a little bit is the blurred bush in the foerground clearly due to the long exposure and I''m sure, unavoidable. I may have cropped the photo at the base of the mountains but I''m not sure. The colors are true and I''m glad you didn''t try to oversaturate them. The beauty of this photo lies in it''s simplicity. It does not overpower you yet it drws you in to explore the details. Nice job.Tim Jensen', '2002-12-02 22:40:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(159263, 8668, 4177, '<td valign="top">I would have gotten in a bit tighter for this shot. Closer, more detail would make for a better picture.</td>', 'I would have gotten in a bit tighter for this shot. Closer, more detail would make for a better picture.', '2002-11-25 01:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159264, 8668, 3032, '<td valign="top">Nice how the police line and fallen tree lead the way trough the picture. It looks a slight bit underexposed and it lacks sharpness.<br/>Also, save your pic at the highest allowed quality (150kb),  the compression destroys the detail and that is probably why this image lacks detail sharpness. It would be better for the asphalt too.<br/>Have you tried a lower angle?</td>', 'Nice how the police line and fallen tree lead the way trough the picture. It looks a slight bit underexposed and it lacks sharpness.Also, save your pic at the highest allowed quality (150kb),  the compression destroys the detail and that is probably why this image lacks detail sharpness. It would be better for the asphalt too.Have you tried a lower angle?', '2002-11-25 05:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159265, 8668, 3859, '<td valign="top">I like the shot. It needs to be brightened just a bit, IMO.</td>', 'I like the shot. It needs to be brightened just a bit, IMO.', '2002-11-25 11:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159266, 8668, 4821, '<td valign="top">Yikes.  This image would be better with better exposure and a closer angle.</td>', 'Yikes.  This image would be better with better exposure and a closer angle.', '2002-11-25 12:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159267, 8668, 327, '<td valign="top">Whoops....poor Z, but the new one''s are even cooler!! LOL This is just a neat shot, perfect for the challenge. Great find. Little bit dark. Justine.</td>', 'Whoops....poor Z, but the new one''s are even cooler!! LOL This is just a neat shot, perfect for the challenge. Great find. Little bit dark. Justine.', '2002-11-25 16:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159268, 8668, 4494, '<td valign="top">Ouch, that''s gotta hurt.</td>', 'Ouch, that''s gotta hurt.', '2002-11-25 16:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159269, 8668, 3669, '<td valign="top">OUCH!!</td>', 'OUCH!!', '2002-11-25 17:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159270, 8668, 4162, '<td valign="top">This is great, you have captured the effects of the storm very well!  How many hours did you drive to find this?! Can imagine this on the front page of a small town paper.   I think you couls have cropped off a little from the right of the shot.  Natasha</td>', 'This is great, you have captured the effects of the storm very well!  How many hours did you drive to find this?! Can imagine this on the front page of a small town paper.   I think you couls have cropped off a little from the right of the shot.  Natasha', '2002-11-25 21:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159271, 8668, 5070, '<td valign="top">Ouch !</td>', 'Ouch !', '2002-11-25 22:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159272, 8668, 4388, '<td valign="top">i don''t think a newspaper would have shown as much of the street as you did.  maybe crop a little more.  great photo.</td>', 'i don''t think a newspaper would have shown as much of the street as you did.  maybe crop a little more.  great photo.', '2002-11-25 22:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159273, 8668, 3280, '<td valign="top">Sombody wasn''t very happy.  Good journalistic shot. DPz</td>', 'Sombody wasn''t very happy.  Good journalistic shot. DPz', '2002-11-25 22:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159274, 8668, 3017, '<td valign="top">Applicable subject matter, but I think a close up of the tree on the damaged car would have been more interesting.  Or shot from low near the end of the tree by the ground.  This angle would have put the car and tree as major subject matter.  As is, this shot seems like a drive by/walk by grab a shot without thinking of a creative approach.  Good luck on the challenge.</td>', 'Applicable subject matter, but I think a close up of the tree on the damaged car would have been more interesting.  Or shot from low near the end of the tree by the ground.  This angle would have put the car and tree as major subject matter.  As is, this shot seems like a drive by/walk by grab a shot without thinking of a creative approach.  Good luck on the challenge.', '2002-11-26 00:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159275, 8668, 4514, '<td valign="top">Closer is better.  Get down on the ground for this shot.</td>', 'Closer is better.  Get down on the ground for this shot.', '2002-11-26 03:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159276, 8668, 3018, '<td valign="top">Ouch!</td>', 'Ouch!', '2002-11-26 18:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159277, 8668, 2337, '<td valign="top">I hope you didn''t knock that tree on that car just to get this shot :)  (yes I''m kidding) ~MyQyl ~</td>', 'I hope you didn''t knock that tree on that car just to get this shot :)  (yes I''m kidding) ~MyQyl ~', '2002-11-26 21:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159278, 8668, 527, '<td valign="top">It probably could not be avoided but I would have preferred the photo without the fire line. It is also a pretty ordinary angle which I think could be improved on. Maybe tighter cropping.<br/><br/>T</td>', 'It probably could not be avoided but I would have preferred the photo without the fire line. It is also a pretty ordinary angle which I think could be improved on. Maybe tighter cropping.T', '2002-11-27 02:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159279, 8668, 3447, '<td valign="top">Now that is a photograph to go with the story on inclement weather.  All you need is an interview with the car owner.             JEM</td>', 'Now that is a photograph to go with the story on inclement weather.  All you need is an interview with the car owner.             JEM', '2002-11-28 20:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159280, 8668, 4648, '<td valign="top">Hope no one was injured in this story.  Great after picture.  Hope they have insurance.  Photo''s only problem I see is the dark red brick of the house cries to be lighteded some for the beauty of the bricks to come through against the beautiful green grass and white car.  This would make a great shot better, the difference between an 8 and 9, maybe a 10 even.  PTL8</td>', 'Hope no one was injured in this story.  Great after picture.  Hope they have insurance.  Photo''s only problem I see is the dark red brick of the house cries to be lighteded some for the beauty of the bricks to come through against the beautiful green grass and white car.  This would make a great shot better, the difference between an 8 and 9, maybe a 10 even.  PTL8', '2002-11-28 21:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159281, 8668, 2488, '<td valign="top">ouch!!</td>', 'ouch!!', '2002-11-29 04:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
