(159338, 8672, 3735, '<td valign="top">I can relate lol  8</td>', 'I can relate lol  8', '2002-11-25 06:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159339, 8672, 2634, '<td valign="top">love the title...lol</td>', 'love the title...lol', '2002-11-25 07:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159340, 8672, 640, '<td valign="top">The title of this news report should be plural!</td>', 'The title of this news report should be plural!', '2002-11-25 09:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159341, 8672, 714, '<td valign="top">oh dear!  What will become of her now?  Very good title.  I am not sure if your intention was to focus on the sign and have the hospital out of focus, I would have liked them both in focus.  Not bad though.  Vote 6   Sonifo</td>', 'oh dear!  What will become of her now?  Very good title.  I am not sure if your intention was to focus on the sign and have the hospital out of focus, I would have liked them both in focus.  Not bad though.  Vote 6   Sonifo', '2002-11-25 10:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159342, 8672, 4482, '<td valign="top">Great humour and the shot has nice composition 6</td>', 'Great humour and the shot has nice composition 6', '2002-11-25 11:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159343, 8672, 4338, '<td valign="top">too too funny.... I like it</td>', 'too too funny.... I like it', '2002-11-25 12:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159344, 8672, 327, '<td valign="top">LOL very cute..............creative idea. Justine.</td>', 'LOL very cute..............creative idea. Justine.', '2002-11-25 16:20:00.000000', NULL, 1);
