(159348, 8672, 737, '<td valign="top">LOL</td>', 'LOL', '2002-11-26 20:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159349, 8672, 4514, '<td valign="top">Cute title.</td>', 'Cute title.', '2002-11-27 05:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159350, 8672, 1826, '<td valign="top">Great title! :) Kaz</td>', 'Great title! :) Kaz', '2002-11-27 06:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159351, 8672, 811, '<td valign="top">Photographically, the picture seems to be a little soft to me.  The colors are good, and I like the framing/composition.  It reminds me of a shot you would see when talking about health care costs or hospital budget cuts.  Nice work. karmat</td>', 'Photographically, the picture seems to be a little soft to me.  The colors are good, and I like the framing/composition.  It reminds me of a shot you would see when talking about health care costs or hospital budget cuts.  Nice work. karmat', '2002-11-27 12:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159352, 8672, 2867, '<td valign="top">HAHAHA!  How true!  great job!</td>', 'HAHAHA!  How true!  great job!', '2002-11-27 15:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159353, 8672, 4648, '<td valign="top">The building need to be more in focus, not just the sign.  Would make it a beautiful picture , advertisement worthy even.  I love your idea.  It''s so cute.  Still a good photo.  Just sharpen it up some.  PTL7</td>', 'The building need to be more in focus, not just the sign.  Would make it a beautiful picture , advertisement worthy even.  I love your idea.  It''s so cute.  Still a good photo.  Just sharpen it up some.  PTL7', '2002-11-28 21:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159354, 8672, 3317, '<td valign="top">the word emergency is the only thing that says hospital, bet then again being an ambulance chaser is kinda tacky. hahahaha imagine waiting for a guy in a wheelchair, explaining how you needed him in the frame so that your rectangle just screams hospital.</td>', 'the word emergency is the only thing that says hospital, bet then again being an ambulance chaser is kinda tacky. hahahaha imagine waiting for a guy in a wheelchair, explaining how you needed him in the frame so that your rectangle just screams hospital.', '2002-11-28 22:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
