(159360, 8673, 4648, '<td valign="top">Great old church and cemetary.  Good subject, compotiton, execution, nice focus, good crop.  I prefer color, but this will work.  Nice job.  PTL8  Color would have been a 10 but it really does deserve a 9 as it is.</td>', 'Great old church and cemetary.  Good subject, compotiton, execution, nice focus, good crop.  I prefer color, but this will work.  Nice job.  PTL8  Color would have been a 10 but it really does deserve a 9 as it is.', '2002-11-25 22:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159361, 8673, 3280, '<td valign="top">It seems a little soft on focus and everything seems to be leaning to the right.  DPz</td>', 'It seems a little soft on focus and everything seems to be leaning to the right.  DPz', '2002-11-25 22:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159362, 8673, 3859, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but leans a bit much to the right. It is also a little dark.</td>', 'Interesting, but leans a bit much to the right. It is also a little dark.', '2002-11-26 09:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159363, 8673, 5120, '<td valign="top">I bet it is an interesting story.  I only wish the shot was a little bit brighter.<br/><br/>Greg<br/></td>', 'I bet it is an interesting story.  I only wish the shot was a little bit brighter.Greg', '2002-11-26 12:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159364, 8673, 4411, '<td valign="top">I was considering taking a shot of a church and calling it ''Parish Weekly News'' or something (the church I attended as a kid has been using the same photo on the front cover for 20 years!).<br/>I would have liked to have seen this in colour, there''s obviously some good sunlight so the greens/browns/greys would have been nice I hope.<br/>Unfortunately everything appears to be leaning to the right, although I can see from the gravestones that this isn''t entirely your fault.<br/>I would also have liked to have seen a door - I think it would make the building look more ''inviting''.<br/>Still, not a bad shot, meets the challenge, and worthy of a decent score.</td>', 'I was considering taking a shot of a church and calling it ''Parish Weekly News'' or something (the church I attended as a kid has been using the same photo on the front cover for 20 years!).I would have liked to have seen this in colour, there''s obviously some good sunlight so the greens/browns/greys would have been nice I hope.Unfortunately everything appears to be leaning to the right, although I can see from the gravestones that this isn''t entirely your fault.I would also have liked to have seen a door - I think it would make the building look more ''inviting''.Still, not a bad shot, meets the challenge, and worthy of a decent score.', '2002-11-26 18:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159365, 8673, 4514, '<td valign="top">This does not rub me the right way.  Why is the Church angled.???</td>', 'This does not rub me the right way.  Why is the Church angled.???', '2002-11-27 01:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159366, 8673, 2490, '<td valign="top">Aw, and then those dang power lines showed up :-)  I like the fact that you tell a story, but it''s a sad story that says this... "This church has been here a long time and has gradually died off.  The shadows are long at the end of its day, and the skies are cloudy because it sees no hope of tomorrow."  Is that the right story? :-)<br/>7 nards656</td>', 'Aw, and then those dang power lines showed up :-)  I like the fact that you tell a story, but it''s a sad story that says this... "This church has been here a long time and has gradually died off.  The shadows are long at the end of its day, and the skies are cloudy because it sees no hope of tomorrow."  Is that the right story? :-)7 nards656', '2002-11-27 12:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159367, 8673, 3401, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot. I like the old graves.</td>', 'Really nice shot. I like the old graves.', '2002-11-27 14:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159368, 8673, 3317, '<td valign="top">great long shadows. appropriate black and white.  like that the focus is good enough for the stones in front, the crosshatching in the window, the lines between the bricks. wonder where you pointed the camera to get it to do that automatically, or if you have a manual camera you did a real nice job. eight, even though it''s not really action-adventure like some of the best in this challenge are.</td>', 'great long shadows. appropriate black and white.  like that the focus is good enough for the stones in front, the crosshatching in the window, the lines between the bricks. wonder where you pointed the camera to get it to do that automatically, or if you have a manual camera you did a real nice job. eight, even though it''s not really action-adventure like some of the best in this challenge are.', '2002-11-27 21:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159369, 8673, 4005, '<td valign="top">it''s so peaceful... wow! Great in b&amp;w. 7 - KAOS</td>', 'it''s so peaceful... wow! Great in b&w. 7 - KAOS', '2002-11-30 11:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
