(159382, 8674, 2170, '<td valign="top">Great colors in this photo.  Without the title it could be a lot of things...a flood, a duck pond (or muck pond!  ha ha).  I  wish there was something in the photo that anchored it -- like some wildlife or a boat -- nothing big, but just somewhere for the viewer''s eye to zip to.  muckpond</td>', 'Great colors in this photo.  Without the title it could be a lot of things...a flood, a duck pond (or muck pond!  ha ha).  I  wish there was something in the photo that anchored it -- like some wildlife or a boat -- nothing big, but just somewhere for the viewer''s eye to zip to.  muckpond', '2002-11-27 09:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159383, 8674, 3447, '<td valign="top">Too late.  The water is draining off the right hand side of your photo.</td>', 'Too late.  The water is draining off the right hand side of your photo.', '2002-11-27 11:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159384, 8674, 2490, '<td valign="top">Some animal life would have really helped this, even though it might have required tremendous patience.  Maybe a heron.  Maybe even some hunters or something.  5 nards656</td>', 'Some animal life would have really helped this, even though it might have required tremendous patience.  Maybe a heron.  Maybe even some hunters or something.  5 nards656', '2002-11-27 12:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159385, 8674, 811, '<td valign="top">I think a tighter crop would have helped eliminate the white sky, which isn''t detracting, but really doesn''t add anything to the picture, either, in my opinion.  Also, it seems to be tilted some, but I know that can happen with water/landscapes because of the direction of the opposing shore line.  The exposure/lighting and colors are good.  Looks like a good place to go bass fishing! karmat</td>', 'I think a tighter crop would have helped eliminate the white sky, which isn''t detracting, but really doesn''t add anything to the picture, either, in my opinion.  Also, it seems to be tilted some, but I know that can happen with water/landscapes because of the direction of the opposing shore line.  The exposure/lighting and colors are good.  Looks like a good place to go bass fishing! karmat', '2002-11-27 12:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159386, 8674, 4776, '<td valign="top">The title adds a lot. Beautiful setting, nice shot. 8</td>', 'The title adds a lot. Beautiful setting, nice shot. 8', '2002-11-27 14:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159387, 8674, 4648, '<td valign="top">3 cheers for the voters.  I must read this article to see where this reserve is and go visit it.  I''t a beautiful place.  I can tell from the photo.  Good picture - makes me want to read the article.  Great job.  PTL9</td>', '3 cheers for the voters.  I must read this article to see where this reserve is and go visit it.  I''t a beautiful place.  I can tell from the photo.  Good picture - makes me want to read the article.  Great job.  PTL9', '2002-11-28 20:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159388, 8674, 4596, '<td valign="top">Nature shot. Not much to focus on.</td>', 'Nature shot. Not much to focus on.', '2002-11-30 17:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159389, 8674, 3247, '<td valign="top">Please rotate the pond - water - so it doesn''t wash away.</td>', 'Please rotate the pond - water - so it doesn''t wash away.', '2002-11-30 18:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159390, 8674, 5455, '<td valign="top">a crooked snapshot is not photojournalism</td>', 'a crooked snapshot is not photojournalism', '2002-12-01 18:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
