(159392, 8674, 737, '<td valign="top">For those that said this was tilted, you were correct. A tilt of about 2 deg brings it back. I just missed it during editing.</td>', 'For those that said this was tilted, you were correct. A tilt of about 2 deg brings it back. I just missed it during editing.', '2002-12-02 01:21:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(159393, 8674, 1019, '<td valign="top">The great problem with this photo is the lack of a focal point for the viewer to focus on. Ones eyes seem to just slide off the photo. I dont know the area but if one of those trees at such interesting angles were used as a focal pointif you had managed to get closer to them and used them in your composition as a prominent feature this photo might have worked better or perhaps the photo taken from low down in the grass on the opposite bank.<br/><br/>Your picture is well exposed with good focus and DOF for a scenic shot. Nice reflections on the water. As you have explained you had a problem with the horizon it does distract from your shot. Your processing is good and your camera shows good detail .<br/><br/>The title sparks the imaginationand this looks like a great conservation area<br/><br/>Andrewm<br/><br/>Critique Club<br/></td>', 'The great problem with this photo is the lack of a focal point for the viewer to focus on. Ones eyes seem to just slide off the photo. I dont know the area but if one of those trees at such interesting angles were used as a focal pointif you had managed to get closer to them and used them in your composition as a prominent feature this photo might have worked better or perhaps the photo taken from low down in the grass on the opposite bank.Your picture is well exposed with good focus and DOF for a scenic shot. Nice reflections on the water. As you have explained you had a problem with the horizon it does distract from your shot. Your processing is good and your camera shows good detail .The title sparks the imaginationand this looks like a great conservation areaAndrewmCritique Club', '2002-12-02 14:18:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(159394, 8675, 3380, '<td valign="top">Very touching...any truth behind the image? Composition is very strong, but perhaps more tonal adjustment (e.i. more shadowing) would have yeilded a strong emotional impact.</td>', 'Very touching...any truth behind the image? Composition is very strong, but perhaps more tonal adjustment (e.i. more shadowing) would have yeilded a strong emotional impact.', '2002-11-25 01:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159395, 8675, 4615, '<td valign="top">We all want to know the story that goes with this.</td>', 'We all want to know the story that goes with this.', '2002-11-25 09:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159396, 8675, 4648, '<td valign="top">love the 2 little flowers .  Great B&amp;W.  Nice composition.  Good execution.  Good focus.  Execellent crop - adds to.  PTL8  The emotion emitted by this deserves a 9</td>', 'love the 2 little flowers .  Great B&W.  Nice composition.  Good execution.  Good focus.  Execellent crop - adds to.  PTL8  The emotion emitted by this deserves a 9', '2002-11-25 09:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
