(159413, 8676, 327, '<td valign="top">Okay this is a good idea but it just doesn''t make a homerun. The shot is tilted, color is off, too much grain, the airplane is hard to see because it''s dark, the roof of the car needs to be cropped out. Other then that...and really I''m not slamming your shot all to heck......it just needs a few improvements. The idea is creative and right on target for the challenge. 6 Justine</td>', 'Okay this is a good idea but it just doesn''t make a homerun. The shot is tilted, color is off, too much grain, the airplane is hard to see because it''s dark, the roof of the car needs to be cropped out. Other then that...and really I''m not slamming your shot all to heck......it just needs a few improvements. The idea is creative and right on target for the challenge. 6 Justine', '2002-11-25 14:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159414, 8676, 3102, '<td valign="top">I don''t know whether the bluish tint was intentional, but it is quite distracting.  I''m afraid that the composition leaves a bit to be desired, too, with too many distractions in the shot, like the traffic light, top of a vehicle, light pole, etc., etc...</td>', 'I don''t know whether the bluish tint was intentional, but it is quite distracting.  I''m afraid that the composition leaves a bit to be desired, too, with too many distractions in the shot, like the traffic light, top of a vehicle, light pole, etc., etc...', '2002-11-25 21:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
