(159416, 8676, 811, '<td valign="top">I think a horizontal crop that eliminated some of the "open" sky would be more effective than the vertical.  Also, was the greenish-blue cast intentional?  If not, maybe some white balance correction would help.  If it was, I would love to know why you chose to do that! karmat</td>', 'I think a horizontal crop that eliminated some of the "open" sky would be more effective than the vertical.  Also, was the greenish-blue cast intentional?  If not, maybe some white balance correction would help.  If it was, I would love to know why you chose to do that! karmat', '2002-11-26 14:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159417, 8676, 472, '<td valign="top">cute! : )</td>', 'cute! : )', '2002-11-26 17:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159418, 8676, 4099, '<td valign="top">too much noise in this image</td>', 'too much noise in this image', '2002-11-26 19:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159419, 8676, 4648, '<td valign="top">Cute idea.  I like the story but don''t like the photo.  Bad colorization, in my opinion.  Ruins the picture.  PTL2</td>', 'Cute idea.  I like the story but don''t like the photo.  Bad colorization, in my opinion.  Ruins the picture.  PTL2', '2002-11-26 20:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159420, 8676, 737, '<td valign="top">Coloration here is not really appropriate. You also should have waited for bus/truck to have cleader, or cropped it out. But picture looks forced in lighting and magnification to me.<br/><br/>Jim msp</td>', 'Coloration here is not really appropriate. You also should have waited for bus/truck to have cleader, or cropped it out. But picture looks forced in lighting and magnification to me.Jim msp', '2002-11-26 22:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159421, 8676, 4267, '<td valign="top">not very clear, and doesn''t really look like a plane landed on a theatre. looks like a decoration on a building....... a wider shot might and angle making the wheels look like they are on the roof might work better<br/>~anachronite</td>', 'not very clear, and doesn''t really look like a plane landed on a theatre. looks like a decoration on a building....... a wider shot might and angle making the wheels look like they are on the roof might work better~anachronite', '2002-11-27 00:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159422, 8676, 4514, '<td valign="top">Very Cute title.</td>', 'Very Cute title.', '2002-11-27 06:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159423, 8676, 2829, '<td valign="top">First thing that jumps out at me is the green color of the photo. Is your white balance off or is this the normal way your camera takes photos. Then that looks like an ordinary image with poor composition. There are traffic lights, top of the bus and a lamp post that  all take away from the photo. Too much emphasis on the title to save the image.</td>', 'First thing that jumps out at me is the green color of the photo. Is your white balance off or is this the normal way your camera takes photos. Then that looks like an ordinary image with poor composition. There are traffic lights, top of the bus and a lamp post that  all take away from the photo. Too much emphasis on the title to save the image.', '2002-11-29 16:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159424, 8676, 3585, '<td valign="top">Or flying cookie box captured with magnetic pole</td>', 'Or flying cookie box captured with magnetic pole', '2002-11-30 05:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159425, 8676, 3080, '<td valign="top">I am sure you have your reasons for doing it this way, but I am not real fond of the aqua tint to the shot.  otherwise, I wish there were a bit more light on the plane to bring out some more detail.  Definately news worthy.  Good luck in the challenge. ~Heather~</td>', 'I am sure you have your reasons for doing it this way, but I am not real fond of the aqua tint to the shot.  otherwise, I wish there were a bit more light on the plane to bring out some more detail.  Definately news worthy.  Good luck in the challenge. ~Heather~', '2002-11-30 13:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
