(159486, 8683, 5120, '<td valign="top">Im not exactly sure what this would make the front page of, but it is a really good sunset photo.  I like the colors and the highlights dont look blown out on my screen.  I think you did a good job on this one.  This is the 3rd sunset picture I have seen in a row and this is definitely the best of the 3.<br/><br/>Greg<br/></td>', 'Im not exactly sure what this would make the front page of, but it is a really good sunset photo.  I like the colors and the highlights dont look blown out on my screen.  I think you did a good job on this one.  This is the 3rd sunset picture I have seen in a row and this is definitely the best of the 3.Greg', '2002-11-26 12:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
