(159498, 8684, 4615, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but too abstract for this challenge..   We can''t distinquish the protestors from the workers in the photo, and newspaper photo needs to portray its subject clearly.</td>', 'Interesting, but too abstract for this challenge..   We can''t distinquish the protestors from the workers in the photo, and newspaper photo needs to portray its subject clearly.', '2002-11-25 08:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
