(159501, 8684, 3532, '<td valign="top">Good idea and composition.  I think the face in the mirror needs to be a lot brighter, higher contrast to draw your attention and really make this shot work.</td>', 'Good idea and composition.  I think the face in the mirror needs to be a lot brighter, higher contrast to draw your attention and really make this shot work.', '2002-11-26 17:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159502, 8684, 4648, '<td valign="top">Too much out of focus for me.  And I do see the man in the mirror.  Still needs focus and not so close up.  Can''t tell they are protester or that he is a worker.  Sorry.  Needs a lot better execution.  PTL.3</td>', 'Too much out of focus for me.  And I do see the man in the mirror.  Still needs focus and not so close up.  Can''t tell they are protester or that he is a worker.  Sorry.  Needs a lot better execution.  PTL.3', '2002-11-26 20:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159503, 8684, 737, '<td valign="top">Center is too dark for me. Everything else is slightly blurred with the shallow DOF.<br/><br/>Jim msp</td>', 'Center is too dark for me. Everything else is slightly blurred with the shallow DOF.Jim msp', '2002-11-26 22:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159504, 8684, 4514, '<td valign="top">Ok this does not make sense.</td>', 'Ok this does not make sense.', '2002-11-27 01:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159505, 8684, 811, '<td valign="top">At first glance, it looks like the face in the mirrow is on the body of the person just beyond!  I think the picture is a touch too dark because some of the details are missing, and it is difficult to discern exactly what you were trying to portray. karmat</td>', 'At first glance, it looks like the face in the mirrow is on the body of the person just beyond!  I think the picture is a touch too dark because some of the details are missing, and it is difficult to discern exactly what you were trying to portray. karmat', '2002-11-27 13:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159506, 8684, 3459, '<td valign="top">I believe, you have taken one of those historic photographs, that should be hanging in a museum.  The composition is priceless, the expression on the man''s face shows that you have captured that perfect moment, that makes or brakes the image.  The quiet, for the most part, tones make this photograph even more relavant.  An excellent, excellent, excellent, image.   Congratulations!!!</td>', 'I believe, you have taken one of those historic photographs, that should be hanging in a museum.  The composition is priceless, the expression on the man''s face shows that you have captured that perfect moment, that makes or brakes the image.  The quiet, for the most part, tones make this photograph even more relavant.  An excellent, excellent, excellent, image.   Congratulations!!!', '2002-11-27 13:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159507, 8684, 4411, '<td valign="top">The face in the mirror is too dark, at first glance it just looks like a big dark square in the middle of the photo. A nice idea though, and I really like the out of focus crowd in the background.</td>', 'The face in the mirror is too dark, at first glance it just looks like a big dark square in the middle of the photo. A nice idea though, and I really like the out of focus crowd in the background.', '2002-11-27 18:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159508, 8684, 5070, '<td valign="top">Good idea but I find details are too dark</td>', 'Good idea but I find details are too dark', '2002-11-28 02:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159509, 8684, 472, '<td valign="top">excellent juxtaposition of the mirror face over the blurred crowd.  i like it alot. :)  now if only the crowd were rioting or something :)</td>', 'excellent juxtaposition of the mirror face over the blurred crowd.  i like it alot. :)  now if only the crowd were rioting or something :)', '2002-11-28 11:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159510, 8684, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background5,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing5,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 5,<br/>Total Averaged Rating5.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background5,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing5,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 5,Total Averaged Rating5.   Autool', '2002-11-30 09:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
