(159570, 8692, 1280, '<td valign="top">This is very good.  Looks natural and unposed, and the yellow adds wonderful color.  I can see this in the papers or a magazine.  That tongue sticking out was perfect timing!  Great!   Focus is very good, exposure is too.  Though there are shadows, they are soft enough to still see plenty of detail,  and none of the highlights are blown out.  You really handled the lighting well.  Best of luck in the challenge. Please remember to keep an open mind when voting. Grayce aka Gracious</td>', 'This is very good.  Looks natural and unposed, and the yellow adds wonderful color.  I can see this in the papers or a magazine.  That tongue sticking out was perfect timing!  Great!   Focus is very good, exposure is too.  Though there are shadows, they are soft enough to still see plenty of detail,  and none of the highlights are blown out.  You really handled the lighting well.  Best of luck in the challenge. Please remember to keep an open mind when voting. Grayce aka Gracious', '2002-11-25 18:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
