(159591, 8694, 5120, '<td valign="top">I think this shot would be a lot better if that background was cut out.  Maybe if you took it from a higher angle it would eliminate this.  Maybe if you opened the aperture a little more so you could blur it out.  Also it might look a little sharper in the foreground if you upped the contrast some.<br/><br/>Greg<br/></td>', 'I think this shot would be a lot better if that background was cut out.  Maybe if you took it from a higher angle it would eliminate this.  Maybe if you opened the aperture a little more so you could blur it out.  Also it might look a little sharper in the foreground if you upped the contrast some.Greg', '2002-11-25 19:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
