(159658, 8701, 811, '<td valign="top">The composition and colors of this look like it would make a very interesting picture, but the lack of focus (whether deliberate or not) really detract from the overall effectiveness I think.  I like the bright light in the middle, and the relative darkness elsewhere.  Also, there seems to be a lot of noise and it looks like you shot it through a screen.  Maybe oversharpened? karmat</td>', 'The composition and colors of this look like it would make a very interesting picture, but the lack of focus (whether deliberate or not) really detract from the overall effectiveness I think.  I like the bright light in the middle, and the relative darkness elsewhere.  Also, there seems to be a lot of noise and it looks like you shot it through a screen.  Maybe oversharpened? karmat', '2002-11-26 11:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159659, 8701, 2337, '<td valign="top">Composition ~ I can''t find a subject to this shot...  Exposure ~ Lower right lost in underexposure, upper middle lost in overexposure...  Focus ~ N/A... Challenge ~ I can''t find any relevence... Opinion ~ I''d be interested in knowing what you were trying to shoot here... It just looks like out of focus glass rocks with a too bright light behind them. ~ Myqyl ~</td>', 'Composition ~ I can''t find a subject to this shot...  Exposure ~ Lower right lost in underexposure, upper middle lost in overexposure...  Focus ~ N/A... Challenge ~ I can''t find any relevence... Opinion ~ I''d be interested in knowing what you were trying to shoot here... It just looks like out of focus glass rocks with a too bright light behind them. ~ Myqyl ~', '2002-11-26 12:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
