(159666, 8701, 2829, '<td valign="top">I fail to see how this meets the challenge. I don''t think I would ever see something like that in a newspaper or magazine or any kind of publication. The orange section shows a lot of pixelation and there are a number of overexposed spots as well as very narrow depth of field resulting in mostly blurred foreground.</td>', 'I fail to see how this meets the challenge. I don''t think I would ever see something like that in a newspaper or magazine or any kind of publication. The orange section shows a lot of pixelation and there are a number of overexposed spots as well as very narrow depth of field resulting in mostly blurred foreground.', '2002-11-29 15:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159667, 8701, 4648, '<td valign="top">No focus.  Too busy.  No real distinguishable subject.  Doesn''t tell me where it''s going.  Doesn''t make me want to read about it.  Sorry PTL.3 But that''s just my opinion.</td>', 'No focus.  Too busy.  No real distinguishable subject.  Doesn''t tell me where it''s going.  Doesn''t make me want to read about it.  Sorry PTL.3 But that''s just my opinion.', '2002-11-29 23:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
