(159689, 8704, 2829, '<td valign="top">The photo does not tell me very much on it''s own and the title is a poor attempt at saving the photo. Also, just about every area is overexposed leaving nothing but a big brown blob of a cow in the photo. This could definitely be improved using better composition and exposure.</td>', 'The photo does not tell me very much on it''s own and the title is a poor attempt at saving the photo. Also, just about every area is overexposed leaving nothing but a big brown blob of a cow in the photo. This could definitely be improved using better composition and exposure.', '2002-11-29 15:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159690, 8704, 4210, '<td valign="top">The overexposure is what makes this photo interesting. Otherwise it would be a slightly boring photo of a cow.</td>', 'The overexposure is what makes this photo interesting. Otherwise it would be a slightly boring photo of a cow.', '2002-12-01 00:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159691, 8704, 3280, '<td valign="top">Just too burned out.  Great look from the cow though!  DPz</td>', 'Just too burned out.  Great look from the cow though!  DPz', '2002-12-01 06:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159692, 8704, 4186, '<td valign="top">i''ll bet it is. you isolated the cow very effectively. i''d be curious to know how you did this, exactly. anyhow. it works for the shot, and the subject is well placed in the frame.</td>', 'i''ll bet it is. you isolated the cow very effectively. i''d be curious to know how you did this, exactly. anyhow. it works for the shot, and the subject is well placed in the frame.', '2002-12-01 10:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
