(159704, 8705, 3080, '<td valign="top">Was this taken in Michigan? lol.  Our roads are ALWAYS like this.  It''s horrible.  I like the angle and framing/cropping that you chose here.  Looks like color on black and white.  Interesting.  The focus is ok, kind of grainy though for my tastes.  Overall a worthy journalism shot. ~Heather~</td>', 'Was this taken in Michigan? lol.  Our roads are ALWAYS like this.  It''s horrible.  I like the angle and framing/cropping that you chose here.  Looks like color on black and white.  Interesting.  The focus is ok, kind of grainy though for my tastes.  Overall a worthy journalism shot. ~Heather~', '2002-11-26 14:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159705, 8705, 2337, '<td valign="top">Nicely done... The diagonal lines are exceptionally strong... One small nitpick, I feel there''s a tad too much of the sky here...  But that''s just me :)  ~ MyQyl ~</td>', 'Nicely done... The diagonal lines are exceptionally strong... One small nitpick, I feel there''s a tad too much of the sky here...  But that''s just me :)  ~ MyQyl ~', '2002-11-26 21:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159706, 8705, 811, '<td valign="top">The picture is grainy to me (maybe cropped from a larger one?), and for some reason, it seems off-balance.  Maybe if the blue sign was pointing into the frame somehow.  I like the pattern that the pylons set up.  The orange white is very attention grabbing. karmat</td>', 'The picture is grainy to me (maybe cropped from a larger one?), and for some reason, it seems off-balance.  Maybe if the blue sign was pointing into the frame somehow.  I like the pattern that the pylons set up.  The orange white is very attention grabbing. karmat', '2002-11-27 13:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159707, 8705, 3317, '<td valign="top">nice. way to not have cars half in half off the rectangle. looks to me like the sharpest part are the roadway doodads in the lower left, when i think the cones want to be the sharpest objects involved. eight for you.</td>', 'nice. way to not have cars half in half off the rectangle. looks to me like the sharpest part are the roadway doodads in the lower left, when i think the cones want to be the sharpest objects involved. eight for you.', '2002-11-27 20:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159708, 8705, 5347, '<td valign="top">Construction on the main freeway.... No news here :)<br/></td>', 'Construction on the main freeway.... No news here :)', '2002-11-27 23:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159709, 8705, 4648, '<td valign="top">There''s something strange about the coloring.  Photo needs focus - maybe zoom out a little.  Looks like rush hour gridlock.  PTL5</td>', 'There''s something strange about the coloring.  Photo needs focus - maybe zoom out a little.  Looks like rush hour gridlock.  PTL5', '2002-11-28 21:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159710, 8705, 4596, '<td valign="top">Probably snagged while in the car, on the move. Good job. Graininess adds here.</td>', 'Probably snagged while in the car, on the move. Good job. Graininess adds here.', '2002-11-30 12:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159711, 8705, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice point of view, it looks like a news shot.  It seems really grainy though.  DPz</td>', 'Nice point of view, it looks like a news shot.  It seems really grainy though.  DPz', '2002-12-01 06:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159712, 8705, 2221, '<td valign="top">Nice photo! I like the composition and the colouring. I guess you desaturated some colours and only left blue and red? I like that. It makes the foreground your subject and the cars a nice and noon-distracting background. Maybe a bit too much grain but I think that doesn''t matter for photos in newspapers ;-) -stephan</td>', 'Nice photo! I like the composition and the colouring. I guess you desaturated some colours and only left blue and red? I like that. It makes the foreground your subject and the cars a nice and noon-distracting background. Maybe a bit too much grain but I think that doesn''t matter for photos in newspapers ;-) -stephan', '2002-12-01 19:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159713, 8706, 4493, '<td valign="top">Good capture of action. The white balance may be off a tad as the frisbee is washed out. Also a faster shutter speed may have prevented the blur.</td>', 'Good capture of action. The white balance may be off a tad as the frisbee is washed out. Also a faster shutter speed may have prevented the blur.', '2002-11-25 09:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159714, 8706, 3859, '<td valign="top">Would like to see it a bit sharper. Cool shot, however!</td>', 'Would like to see it a bit sharper. Cool shot, however!', '2002-11-25 11:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159715, 8706, 2553, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of the frisbee dog!  This photo could definitely have a shot at the front page in the town I live in!! lhall</td>', 'Nice shot of the frisbee dog!  This photo could definitely have a shot at the front page in the town I live in!! lhall', '2002-11-25 19:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159716, 8706, 4388, '<td valign="top">nice stop action and framing. good expsure too.  the whole picture seems a little out of focus and slightly grainy.</td>', 'nice stop action and framing. good expsure too.  the whole picture seems a little out of focus and slightly grainy.', '2002-11-25 21:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159717, 8706, 3080, '<td valign="top">The lighting on the dogs back is a bit bright, and the focus is too soft for my taste.  I like the angle and framing/cropping that you have chosen though, and It does make for a nice story.  ~Heather~</td>', 'The lighting on the dogs back is a bit bright, and the focus is too soft for my taste.  I like the angle and framing/cropping that you have chosen though, and It does make for a nice story.  ~Heather~', '2002-11-26 14:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159718, 8706, 3018, '<td valign="top">Needs a little more focus. Good capture.</td>', 'Needs a little more focus. Good capture.', '2002-11-26 18:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159719, 8706, 737, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but looks a little too blurred, including close leaves, for a front page. Cropping and lighting are good.<br/><br/>Jim msp</td>', 'Good idea, but looks a little too blurred, including close leaves, for a front page. Cropping and lighting are good.Jim msp', '2002-11-26 22:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159720, 8706, 4514, '<td valign="top">There could have been a much better setup.</td>', 'There could have been a much better setup.', '2002-11-27 05:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159721, 8706, 811, '<td valign="top">Great action shot.  the composition and framing are right on in this picture.  The only negative I notice is that the focus is off some.  I think it needs to be a touch sharper to be fully effective. karmat</td>', 'Great action shot.  the composition and framing are right on in this picture.  The only negative I notice is that the focus is off some.  I think it needs to be a touch sharper to be fully effective. karmat', '2002-11-27 13:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159722, 8706, 3317, '<td valign="top">towards the human interest story side of photojournalism. perfect pose.</td>', 'towards the human interest story side of photojournalism. perfect pose.', '2002-11-27 21:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159723, 8706, 3447, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for frisbee dogs. Good action photo.     JEM</td>', 'I''m a sucker for frisbee dogs. Good action photo.     JEM', '2002-11-28 12:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159724, 8706, 518, '<td valign="top">i love frisbie-catching border collies -you get a "10"</td>', 'i love frisbie-catching border collies -you get a "10"', '2002-11-29 22:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159725, 8706, 4648, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t matter what others think - I like "cute pet" photos, especially if they fit the challenge.  This definitely is news worthy to others who have frisbee catching dogs or want to train theirs to catch a frisbee.  I''d want to see more photos and read the article.  Photo needs to be a little sharper focused, but otherwise it is good.  PTL7</td>', 'Doesn''t matter what others think - I like "cute pet" photos, especially if they fit the challenge.  This definitely is news worthy to others who have frisbee catching dogs or want to train theirs to catch a frisbee.  I''d want to see more photos and read the article.  Photo needs to be a little sharper focused, but otherwise it is good.  PTL7', '2002-11-30 20:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159726, 8707, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background7,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing6,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 7,<br/>Total Averaged Rating7.   Autool<br/>IMO the relationship between the title and picture are key elements in this challenge.   You have captured the moment, but where is the sun when you need it?   A little better exposure would have made this picture much stronger for me.<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background7,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing6,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 7,Total Averaged Rating7.   AutoolIMO the relationship between the title and picture are key elements in this challenge.   You have captured the moment, but where is the sun when you need it?   A little better exposure would have made this picture much stronger for me.', '2002-11-25 10:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159727, 8707, 5376, '<td valign="top">Looks like a place where I grew up...like the color contrast...little blurry...maybe someone around ya can give ya a couple of tips</td>', 'Looks like a place where I grew up...like the color contrast...little blurry...maybe someone around ya can give ya a couple of tips', '2002-11-25 17:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159728, 8707, 3532, '<td valign="top">I like the effect of the colored leaves in the foreground and the gray middle and background, but the view of the factory itself doesn''t grab me or interest me much. 5</td>', 'I like the effect of the colored leaves in the foreground and the gray middle and background, but the view of the factory itself doesn''t grab me or interest me much. 5', '2002-11-25 18:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159729, 8707, 3540, '<td valign="top">This picture gives me some mixed feelings.  I like the subjects in distance.  Greyscale is effective here.  The angle makes the clock and the tower on the right the same distance to the center tower.  This bit of colorful leaves, although adding a bit of color, not to mention probably a definite part of the composition is very distracting.  NOTE: If this was not your intention for this photo disregard what is to follow.  I''m seeing this as a little paradox - the beauty and color of nature vs. the greyscaled industrial factions.  If this is the case, I would''ve found it much more effective to put the focus on the foreground leaves vs. the buildings in the background.  Leave those out of focus to let your viewer know that your aim was to focus on the leaves.  This is just my opinion.  If the leaves have nothing to do with the shot in your initial intent, then leave them out as they are completely distracting.  Good Luck - Inspzil</td>', 'This picture gives me some mixed feelings.  I like the subjects in distance.  Greyscale is effective here.  The angle makes the clock and the tower on the right the same distance to the center tower.  This bit of colorful leaves, although adding a bit of color, not to mention probably a definite part of the composition is very distracting.  NOTE: If this was not your intention for this photo disregard what is to follow.  I''m seeing this as a little paradox - the beauty and color of nature vs. the greyscaled industrial factions.  If this is the case, I would''ve found it much more effective to put the focus on the foreground leaves vs. the buildings in the background.  Leave those out of focus to let your viewer know that your aim was to focus on the leaves.  This is just my opinion.  If the leaves have nothing to do with the shot in your initial intent, then leave them out as they are completely distracting.  Good Luck - Inspzil', '2002-11-25 23:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159730, 8707, 1019, '<td valign="top">Very good you have captured a grey and dreary atmosphere well counterpointed by the red of the leaves  andrewm</td>', 'Very good you have captured a grey and dreary atmosphere well counterpointed by the red of the leaves  andrewm', '2002-11-26 12:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159731, 8707, 2170, '<td valign="top">The shots of color are nice, but it doesn''t seem like any one part of this photo is in focus.  Perhaps focusing more on the factory (and blurring the leaves in the foreground even more) would have more oomph to it.  muckpond</td>', 'The shots of color are nice, but it doesn''t seem like any one part of this photo is in focus.  Perhaps focusing more on the factory (and blurring the leaves in the foreground even more) would have more oomph to it.  muckpond', '2002-11-27 10:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159732, 8707, 2983, '<td valign="top">The effect is nice, but I think it needs a contrast adjustment.  The photo is too dark and seems flat.</td>', 'The effect is nice, but I think it needs a contrast adjustment.  The photo is too dark and seems flat.', '2002-11-27 16:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159733, 8707, 4514, '<td valign="top">Where are the mountains?<br/></td>', 'Where are the mountains?', '2002-11-27 21:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159734, 8707, 1143, '<td valign="top">Did you do something to the shot to make it look like this? The trees are really colorful, and the rest is so blah. Really says something about the pollution in the air. It feels a little cut off at the bottom maybe as far as composition goes. I actually like factory shots. I''m wanting to try one at night with a slow shutter to blur the smoke. Soon as a get a big body guard to go with me....   Anyway, fits the challenge. Not as strong as some of the other shots, but not bad.  :o)  ~indi</td>', 'Did you do something to the shot to make it look like this? The trees are really colorful, and the rest is so blah. Really says something about the pollution in the air. It feels a little cut off at the bottom maybe as far as composition goes. I actually like factory shots. I''m wanting to try one at night with a slow shutter to blur the smoke. Soon as a get a big body guard to go with me....   Anyway, fits the challenge. Not as strong as some of the other shots, but not bad.  :o)  ~indi', '2002-11-27 23:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159735, 8707, 3697, '<td valign="top">I really like the way you used the leaves/trees to frame your shot. Makes me think a newspaper photographer was sneaking around this factory in the bushes when he/she captured the shot. Very creative. 8</td>', 'I really like the way you used the leaves/trees to frame your shot. Makes me think a newspaper photographer was sneaking around this factory in the bushes when he/she captured the shot. Very creative. 8', '2002-11-28 16:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159736, 8707, 4648, '<td valign="top">This is my personal opinion but the out of focus leaves on theleft do not add to this one.  I do not loke the colorization in the photo.  Should be natural when in a rural setting such as this.  This doesn''t appeal to me or stir up any interest.  Like I said, that''s my opinion.  PTL3</td>', 'This is my personal opinion but the out of focus leaves on theleft do not add to this one.  I do not loke the colorization in the photo.  Should be natural when in a rural setting such as this.  This doesn''t appeal to me or stir up any interest.  Like I said, that''s my opinion.  PTL3', '2002-11-30 00:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159737, 8707, 2752, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast of the fall folliage and the grey background..feels depressing</td>', 'I like the contrast of the fall folliage and the grey background..feels depressing', '2002-11-30 17:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159738, 8707, 5455, '<td valign="top">how does one get color &amp; greyscale in the smme photo?</td>', 'how does one get color & greyscale in the smme photo?', '2002-12-01 19:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159739, 8708, 714, '<td valign="top">I seen this very same thing in our state too.  Are they looking into it?  lol  This is to funny.  Vote 8 Sonifo</td>', 'I seen this very same thing in our state too.  Are they looking into it?  lol  This is to funny.  Vote 8 Sonifo', '2002-11-25 11:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159740, 8708, 4411, '<td valign="top">Heheh nice try. Would probably have looked better if the ''UFO'' was smaller and in the sky though.</td>', 'Heheh nice try. Would probably have looked better if the ''UFO'' was smaller and in the sky though.', '2002-11-25 13:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159741, 8708, 811, '<td valign="top">I think a different crop, maybe not so tight on the bottom, would help.  Also, there are some bright washed out areas that make it difficult to look at.  I had originally given this a much lower score, but after re-evaluating it, I am bumping it up some because it looks like those ufo shots seen in tabeloids. karmat</td>', 'I think a different crop, maybe not so tight on the bottom, would help.  Also, there are some bright washed out areas that make it difficult to look at.  I had originally given this a much lower score, but after re-evaluating it, I am bumping it up some because it looks like those ufo shots seen in tabeloids. karmat', '2002-11-26 12:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159742, 8708, 2337, '<td valign="top">First let me say this shot made me laugh :)  That in itself is worth something :)<br/>Composition ~ If this image was dome the way I think it was done, you likely didn''t have much control over where in the frame it appeared, but you may have wanted to take a wider shot and crop to spec.  The position of the ''craft'' doesn''t really work well (at least for me)... Exposure ~ There are ''burn spots'' on the craft, but for this kind of shot they belong there... Focus ~ Crisp sharp focus would have ruined this shot.  Well done... Challenge ~ Easily expect to see this shot anytime I go to the supermarket :)  Nice job!  ~ Myqyl ~</td>', 'First let me say this shot made me laugh :)  That in itself is worth something :)Composition ~ If this image was dome the way I think it was done, you likely didn''t have much control over where in the frame it appeared, but you may have wanted to take a wider shot and crop to spec.  The position of the ''craft'' doesn''t really work well (at least for me)... Exposure ~ There are ''burn spots'' on the craft, but for this kind of shot they belong there... Focus ~ Crisp sharp focus would have ruined this shot.  Well done... Challenge ~ Easily expect to see this shot anytime I go to the supermarket :)  Nice job!  ~ Myqyl ~', '2002-11-26 12:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159743, 8708, 772, '<td valign="top">I think the lack of focus adds something interesting to the mystery of this shot... good work :) - setzler</td>', 'I think the lack of focus adds something interesting to the mystery of this shot... good work :) - setzler', '2002-11-26 14:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159744, 8708, 737, '<td valign="top">Flash reflection in center ruins the attemp. I would accept the blur for the goal you want to achieve.<br/>Angle also confuses me. You seem to be looking down, but stars show at top.<br/><br/>Jim msp</td>', 'Flash reflection in center ruins the attemp. I would accept the blur for the goal you want to achieve.Angle also confuses me. You seem to be looking down, but stars show at top.Jim msp', '2002-11-26 22:26:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(159745, 8708, 4267, '<td valign="top">looks really really fake<br/>~anachronite</td>', 'looks really really fake~anachronite', '2002-11-27 00:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159746, 8708, 4648, '<td valign="top">Did anyone come out when they landed.?  Did you get any pictures of them?  Hope your story answers these questons.  This picture makes me want to know more about it.  I like the out of focus.  Makes it look real.  Good execution for what you wanted.  Good job.  PTL6</td>', 'Did anyone come out when they landed.?  Did you get any pictures of them?  Hope your story answers these questons.  This picture makes me want to know more about it.  I like the out of focus.  Makes it look real.  Good execution for what you wanted.  Good job.  PTL6', '2002-11-27 00:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159747, 8708, 4514, '<td valign="top">Is this an out of focus Cervical Diaphram.  Could be a Mushroom. You have my curiosity.<br/></td>', 'Is this an out of focus Cervical Diaphram.  Could be a Mushroom. You have my curiosity.', '2002-11-27 02:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159748, 8708, 2170, '<td valign="top">This might have been a good shot for the Superstitions challenge too!  I''m not sure how effective this is, though.  The photo should tell a story on its own, and this looks like a too-tight macro of a mushroom or something.  Perhaps more focus would help?  Although you were probably going for the out-of-focus effect.  muckpond</td>', 'This might have been a good shot for the Superstitions challenge too!  I''m not sure how effective this is, though.  The photo should tell a story on its own, and this looks like a too-tight macro of a mushroom or something.  Perhaps more focus would help?  Although you were probably going for the out-of-focus effect.  muckpond', '2002-11-27 09:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159749, 8708, 5212, '<td valign="top">What is this??  INteresting photo.</td>', 'What is this??  INteresting photo.', '2002-11-28 02:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159750, 8708, 5455, '<td valign="top">What the hell is that? A condom?</td>', 'What the hell is that? A condom?', '2002-12-01 18:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159751, 8709, 4967, '<td valign="top">In the first place the photo is extremely grainy.  In the second place it doesn''t fit the challenge AT ALL.  Sorry, but I''m giving this a 1.</td>', 'In the first place the photo is extremely grainy.  In the second place it doesn''t fit the challenge AT ALL.  Sorry, but I''m giving this a 1.', '2002-11-25 01:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159752, 8709, 3032, '<td valign="top">Come on! A waste of time!</td>', 'Come on! A waste of time!', '2002-11-25 06:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159753, 8709, 4493, '<td valign="top">To much post processing. Very grainy and the colors are washed out. The framing of the shot is nice.</td>', 'To much post processing. Very grainy and the colors are washed out. The framing of the shot is nice.', '2002-11-25 09:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159754, 8709, 3585, '<td valign="top">Aren''t we humorous. Succh talent and imagination... You are either repetitive or replicating an allready rancid adolescent joke. How about a fire truck for next challenge ?</td>', 'Aren''t we humorous. Succh talent and imagination... You are either repetitive or replicating an allready rancid adolescent joke. How about a fire truck for next challenge ?', '2002-11-25 10:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159755, 8709, 4482, '<td valign="top">OK..... i wonder if this is a joke... a flower pic of EXTEMELY poor quality. If I could give a 0 i would.</td>', 'OK..... i wonder if this is a joke... a flower pic of EXTEMELY poor quality. If I could give a 0 i would.', '2002-11-25 11:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159756, 8709, 714, '<td valign="top">Not sure if this would make the front page, but I do like the way it is,  I like the way I can see all the squares in the pictures.  Vote 4 Sonifo</td>', 'Not sure if this would make the front page, but I do like the way it is,  I like the way I can see all the squares in the pictures.  Vote 4 Sonifo', '2002-11-25 11:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159757, 8709, 772, '<td valign="top">The image quality on this shot is suffering terribly from pixellation... not sure what happened here, but it needs some serious help...  I also do not understand what is ''journalistic'' about this photo.  The photo is not telling me a story... - setzler</td>', 'The image quality on this shot is suffering terribly from pixellation... not sure what happened here, but it needs some serious help...  I also do not understand what is ''journalistic'' about this photo.  The photo is not telling me a story... - setzler', '2002-11-25 12:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159758, 8709, 4821, '<td valign="top">?????????</td>', '?????????', '2002-11-25 13:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159759, 8709, 327, '<td valign="top">//www.irfanview.com/  IrfanView is free software if you can''t get Photoshop or something else along those lines.  What ever you used for compression has trashed your pretty flower. Justine</td>', '//www.irfanview.com/  IrfanView is free software if you can''t get Photoshop or something else along those lines.  What ever you used for compression has trashed your pretty flower. Justine', '2002-11-25 14:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159760, 8709, 4494, '<td valign="top">It looks "pixelated"</td>', 'It looks "pixelated"', '2002-11-25 16:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159761, 8709, 5120, '<td valign="top">I can only guess that you intended for the picture to be this grainy/noisy.  I find myself wondering what front page this one would make.  I wish I could see more detail in the center of the flower.<br/><br/>Greg<br/></td>', 'I can only guess that you intended for the picture to be this grainy/noisy.  I find myself wondering what front page this one would make.  I wish I could see more detail in the center of the flower.Greg', '2002-11-25 19:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159762, 8709, 3102, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid this is rather extremely pixelated, and also a bit weak on the challenge... sorry...</td>', 'I''m afraid this is rather extremely pixelated, and also a bit weak on the challenge... sorry...', '2002-11-25 21:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159763, 8709, 4162, '<td valign="top">Apart from the jpeg noise and compression problem.this is definitely not photojournalism</td>', 'Apart from the jpeg noise and compression problem.this is definitely not photojournalism', '2002-11-25 21:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159764, 8709, 4625, '<td valign="top">Poor picture quality, not related to the challenge enough.</td>', 'Poor picture quality, not related to the challenge enough.', '2002-11-26 01:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159765, 8709, 4514, '<td valign="top">Wow.  You need a new Cam that can take better res pictures.</td>', 'Wow.  You need a new Cam that can take better res pictures.', '2002-11-26 03:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159766, 8709, 1792, '<td valign="top">Nice for a card or print, but photojournalism, I''m not sure.  I wouldn''t rule it out, however, depending on the story it went with or the publication it would go into.</td>', 'Nice for a card or print, but photojournalism, I''m not sure.  I wouldn''t rule it out, however, depending on the story it went with or the publication it would go into.', '2002-11-26 11:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159767, 8709, 811, '<td valign="top">The colors in this are wonderful, and it looks like it would be a really good macro.  However, it seems that it is extremely pixelated.  It looks like you have cropped it out of a larger picture, then enlarged it or something.  Of course, if this is deliberate, that is another story all together, and I would be most interested in hearing why.  karmat</td>', 'The colors in this are wonderful, and it looks like it would be a really good macro.  However, it seems that it is extremely pixelated.  It looks like you have cropped it out of a larger picture, then enlarged it or something.  Of course, if this is deliberate, that is another story all together, and I would be most interested in hearing why.  karmat', '2002-11-26 12:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159768, 8709, 737, '<td valign="top">Looks way out of focus - probably caused by too small a crop. I can see the pixels. Not cover worthy.<br/><br/>Jim msp</td>', 'Looks way out of focus - probably caused by too small a crop. I can see the pixels. Not cover worthy.Jim msp', '2002-11-26 22:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
