(159785, 8709, 4186, '<td valign="top">it''s not exactly photojournalism, unless you work for national geographic. which works. i''m gonna give it a ten because it''s actually really good compositionally, and the artifacts create an interesting texture. and everyone else will hate it. that''s ok, i think you did a wonderful job.</td>', 'it''s not exactly photojournalism, unless you work for national geographic. which works. i''m gonna give it a ten because it''s actually really good compositionally, and the artifacts create an interesting texture. and everyone else will hate it. that''s ok, i think you did a wonderful job.', '2002-12-01 23:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
