(159787, 8710, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background10,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing8,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 9,<br/>Total Averaged Rating9.   Autool<br/>IMO the relationship between the title and picture are key elements in this challenge.   This is a great sports shot, showing action,intent, and subject matter.   Super job.<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background10,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing8,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 9,Total Averaged Rating9.   AutoolIMO the relationship between the title and picture are key elements in this challenge.   This is a great sports shot, showing action,intent, and subject matter.   Super job.', '2002-11-25 09:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
