(159798, 8710, 3102, '<td valign="top">A nicely done shot -- nice &amp; close up!  My only criticism would be that I would have preferred to see something with a little more action, like a goal being scored, etc.  Or perhaps something that would show a players'' expression after scoring, or being scored upon, etc. 8 -- alansfreed</td>', 'A nicely done shot -- nice & close up!  My only criticism would be that I would have preferred to see something with a little more action, like a goal being scored, etc.  Or perhaps something that would show a players'' expression after scoring, or being scored upon, etc. 8 -- alansfreed', '2002-11-26 13:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
