(159807, 8710, 4596, '<td valign="top">Had it not been for the puck, this photo would have failed to capture as much attention. Good snag. Sharp, in focus, carries attention. Very good job.</td>', 'Had it not been for the puck, this photo would have failed to capture as much attention. Good snag. Sharp, in focus, carries attention. Very good job.', '2002-11-30 12:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159808, 8710, 3080, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Definately belongs in the paper.  Angle and framing/cropping are good, and  your focus and clarity are good as well.  Very nice. ~Heather~</td>', 'Great shot.  Definately belongs in the paper.  Angle and framing/cropping are good, and  your focus and clarity are good as well.  Very nice. ~Heather~', '2002-11-30 13:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159809, 8710, 3280, '<td valign="top">Great shot, it looks like you were sitting on the players bench!  Tough with all of that white background too.  One of my favs of the week.  DPz</td>', 'Great shot, it looks like you were sitting on the players bench!  Tough with all of that white background too.  One of my favs of the week.  DPz', '2002-12-01 06:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
