(159832, 8711, 2221, '<td valign="top">Very candid! I like it a lot. But somehow it looks unbalanced and as if the guard falls out of the frame in the next second. I know it may sound silly, but that''s my impression when I look at it. It''s probably because of the angle. -stephan</td>', 'Very candid! I like it a lot. But somehow it looks unbalanced and as if the guard falls out of the frame in the next second. I know it may sound silly, but that''s my impression when I look at it. It''s probably because of the angle. -stephan', '2002-12-01 10:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159833, 8711, 327, '<td valign="top">#70<br/>Critique Club Assingment<br/><br/>How fun that I should draw this photo to comment on. I love this one!<br/>Not only do I find this shot fun but it''s really a good shot considering the sun-shadow. I think the photographer and the camera did a good job of compensating. <br/><br/>This shot is about humor. Poor guy trying to get 40 winks and he''s caught on camera! I can imagine all kids of humorous titles for this shot. It''s very good for the challenge.<br/><br/>The composition, crop is good along with good color. I''d of adjusted the levels a bit so we could see more of his face.</td>', '#70Critique Club AssingmentHow fun that I should draw this photo to comment on. I love this one!Not only do I find this shot fun but it''s really a good shot considering the sun-shadow. I think the photographer and the camera did a good job of compensating. This shot is about humor. Poor guy trying to get 40 winks and he''s caught on camera! I can imagine all kids of humorous titles for this shot. It''s very good for the challenge.The composition, crop is good along with good color. I''d of adjusted the levels a bit so we could see more of his face.', '2002-12-02 11:17:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(159834, 8711, 4267, '<td valign="top">I am planning on having this photo printed, then I am going to put these comments and the pic, along with a package of No-Doze into en envelope, and leave it there at his stop for him to find... wish I could get a shot of the look on his face as he sees the envelopes contents!</td>', 'I am planning on having this photo printed, then I am going to put these comments and the pic, along with a package of No-Doze into en envelope, and leave it there at his stop for him to find... wish I could get a shot of the look on his face as he sees the envelopes contents!', '2002-12-03 00:55:00.000000', NULL, 0),
