(159839, 8713, 2337, '<td valign="top">Composition ~ The horizon seems a bit slanted, but in this case it works for me... If I were to nitpick (and I usually do) I''d say there might be a tad bit more sky then you really needed.  Exposure ~ Wonderfully done!  The diagonal flare of the lights add a lot!!!   Focus ~ While everything is not in crystal clear focus, it''s as it should be. Challenge/Impact ~ You nailed it...</td>', 'Composition ~ The horizon seems a bit slanted, but in this case it works for me... If I were to nitpick (and I usually do) I''d say there might be a tad bit more sky then you really needed.  Exposure ~ Wonderfully done!  The diagonal flare of the lights add a lot!!!   Focus ~ While everything is not in crystal clear focus, it''s as it should be. Challenge/Impact ~ You nailed it...', '2002-11-25 15:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159840, 8713, 4517, '<td valign="top">Here in England its called rain and we get it nearly everyday.</td>', 'Here in England its called rain and we get it nearly everyday.', '2002-11-25 15:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159841, 8713, 1280, '<td valign="top">This is good, tells a story. and meets the challenge.  The colors add a bit of interest. The composition works just fine too.  I  really like the way the lights glare like stars.  Best of luck in the challenge. Please remember to keep an open mind when voting. Grayce aka Gracious</td>', 'This is good, tells a story. and meets the challenge.  The colors add a bit of interest. The composition works just fine too.  I  really like the way the lights glare like stars.  Best of luck in the challenge. Please remember to keep an open mind when voting. Grayce aka Gracious', '2002-11-25 17:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159842, 8713, 4388, '<td valign="top">i like the reflections. and i like the idea, but for some reason the photo is not very interesting.  i guess there is not one thing that the eye goes to, no point of interest.</td>', 'i like the reflections. and i like the idea, but for some reason the photo is not very interesting.  i guess there is not one thing that the eye goes to, no point of interest.', '2002-11-25 21:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
