(159845, 8713, 1019, '<td valign="top">nice night scene--I like the red on one side and the white on the other--well done  andrewm</td>', 'nice night scene--I like the red on one side and the white on the other--well done  andrewm', '2002-11-26 13:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159846, 8713, 4648, '<td valign="top">The light all leaning one way make it look like a real bad storm.  I like that.  Looks like the wind is really blowing.  I usually don''t like night traffic shots but this is good.  Would make me want to read how much damage was done.  Great execution.  PTL7</td>', 'The light all leaning one way make it look like a real bad storm.  I like that.  Looks like the wind is really blowing.  I usually don''t like night traffic shots but this is good.  Would make me want to read how much damage was done.  Great execution.  PTL7', '2002-11-26 19:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
