(159848, 8713, 772, '<td valign="top">this is a great photojournalism shot... the blown out lights and the rain really create a nice ''action'' effect in this photo... EXCELLENT work :) - setzler</td>', 'this is a great photojournalism shot... the blown out lights and the rain really create a nice ''action'' effect in this photo... EXCELLENT work :) - setzler', '2002-11-27 11:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159849, 8713, 2490, '<td valign="top">Boy, it''s a paradox, I know.  The lights are too bright and the shadows are too dim.  What''s a poor photog to do?  An upside down gradient filter on the lens might have helped, or just trying to show more taillights and less headlights.  A star filter would have made it "prettier" but might have trashed your effect.  Honestly it doesn''t look like a really planned out shot, just a moment captured, which is very important for PJ.  I''m taking PJ for granted this week and voting primarily on quality.  5 nards656</td>', 'Boy, it''s a paradox, I know.  The lights are too bright and the shadows are too dim.  What''s a poor photog to do?  An upside down gradient filter on the lens might have helped, or just trying to show more taillights and less headlights.  A star filter would have made it "prettier" but might have trashed your effect.  Honestly it doesn''t look like a really planned out shot, just a moment captured, which is very important for PJ.  I''m taking PJ for granted this week and voting primarily on quality.  5 nards656', '2002-11-27 21:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
