(159946, 8715, 4852, '<td valign="top">I think this is a well deserved 1st place. There is obviously a story to tell here about this woman.And I really believe that you are doing excellant quality work , you have a  great talent  and can probably take it far.  ....but<br/> I have to say this,its not a negative comment on your photo at all. Its just that if this woman jumped out from the dark at me , I would probably soil my shorts. And everytime time I open this site I cant help think of that. Maybe I''m the scary one cause every one else see''s it differently.</td>', 'I think this is a well deserved 1st place. There is obviously a story to tell here about this woman.And I really believe that you are doing excellant quality work , you have a  great talent  and can probably take it far.  ....but I have to say this,its not a negative comment on your photo at all. Its just that if this woman jumped out from the dark at me , I would probably soil my shorts. And everytime time I open this site I cant help think of that. Maybe I''m the scary one cause every one else see''s it differently.', '2002-12-03 13:24:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(159947, 8717, 4615, '<td valign="top">Certainly a beautiful photo, I''m not sure how it would translate to newspaper format, you''d lose the rich colors which are its strong point.  You should be pleased with it.</td>', 'Certainly a beautiful photo, I''m not sure how it would translate to newspaper format, you''d lose the rich colors which are its strong point.  You should be pleased with it.', '2002-11-25 09:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
