(159951, 8717, 327, '<td valign="top">I really love this shot. Not the crop on the right. However this is just stunning. I hope you can shoot this again sometime when there is a blue sky. Maybe a tad bit too dark here, anyway fantastic photography place.............Good shooting. Justine</td>', 'I really love this shot. Not the crop on the right. However this is just stunning. I hope you can shoot this again sometime when there is a blue sky. Maybe a tad bit too dark here, anyway fantastic photography place.............Good shooting. Justine', '2002-11-25 15:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
