(159957, 8717, 4648, '<td valign="top">Beautiful old building.  I''d like to see all of it.  At least the door to get in.  As a photo the colors are vibrant and beautiful and the bricks stand out beautifully.  Just not enough of the building.  I''d want to read the article but hope there''s better pictures of the building in the article.  More would made this an 8 or 9 at least.  PTL6</td>', 'Beautiful old building.  I''d like to see all of it.  At least the door to get in.  As a photo the colors are vibrant and beautiful and the bricks stand out beautifully.  Just not enough of the building.  I''d want to read the article but hope there''s better pictures of the building in the article.  More would made this an 8 or 9 at least.  PTL6', '2002-11-28 21:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159958, 8717, 3317, '<td valign="top">it''s pretty, but not an especially informative rectangle, doesn''t tell me museum or ironworks. dig the picture, tough to score it high for this challenge though.</td>', 'it''s pretty, but not an especially informative rectangle, doesn''t tell me museum or ironworks. dig the picture, tough to score it high for this challenge though.', '2002-11-28 22:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
