(159964, 8717, 2221, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject. I like the colours, but I think I would have tried to photograph only the wooden part of the house and try to crop out the stone part. Both things together look a bit strange because of the different textures. Although it''s probably a seldom and interesting thing in achitecture to see wood and stone combined like this :-) -stephan</td>', 'Interesting subject. I like the colours, but I think I would have tried to photograph only the wooden part of the house and try to crop out the stone part. Both things together look a bit strange because of the different textures. Although it''s probably a seldom and interesting thing in achitecture to see wood and stone combined like this :-) -stephan', '2002-12-01 10:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159965, 8717, 5455, '<td valign="top">nice colors, composition</td>', 'nice colors, composition', '2002-12-01 19:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159966, 8717, 2716, '<td valign="top">Not sure how this fits the challenge (yes I read the title) but I''ll give you a 10 because it''s a great shot.  What a great shot for a cloudy day!.  Jacko   10</td>', 'Not sure how this fits the challenge (yes I read the title) but I''ll give you a 10 because it''s a great shot.  What a great shot for a cloudy day!.  Jacko   10', '2002-12-01 19:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159967, 8717, 2170, '<td valign="top">CRITIQUE CLUB!!!<br/><br/>Rich colors and lots of details make this image pop out from the monitor, and that''s a great way to grab anyone''s attention.<br/><br/>The focus and details of this image are excellent.  The strong vertical lines from the planks, the view tilted upward, and the corner of the brick building all give the photo a feeling of height, like it''s towering over something.<br/><br/>The ridged roofline of the brick building has an odd tint -- probably the result of the harsh reflections from the cloudy day.  It almost looks like the photo has been overly sharpened or otherwise manipulated, but I''m sure that''s just a trick of the eye.<br/><br/>Journalistically I''m not sure how well this would fare, as it doesn''t show the entire building, or the portion of the building that will be museum-related.  IMHO, a "photojournalism" picture should either tell a story on its own, or support a story that is being relayed -- this really doesn''t do either, unfortunately.  Without the title, it would be hard to imagine this photo being placed in a publication other than for its photographic qualities.<br/><br/>A lovely photo with great textures and interest to the viewer overall.<br/><br/>Rob 8)</td>', 'CRITIQUE CLUB!!!Rich colors and lots of details make this image pop out from the monitor, and that''s a great way to grab anyone''s attention.The focus and details of this image are excellent.  The strong vertical lines from the planks, the view tilted upward, and the corner of the brick building all give the photo a feeling of height, like it''s towering over something.The ridged roofline of the brick building has an odd tint -- probably the result of the harsh reflections from the cloudy day.  It almost looks like the photo has been overly sharpened or otherwise manipulated, but I''m sure that''s just a trick of the eye.Journalistically I''m not sure how well this would fare, as it doesn''t show the entire building, or the portion of the building that will be museum-related.  IMHO, a "photojournalism" picture should either tell a story on its own, or support a story that is being relayed -- this really doesn''t do either, unfortunately.  Without the title, it would be hard to imagine this photo being placed in a publication other than for its photographic qualities.A lovely photo with great textures and interest to the viewer overall.Rob 8)', '2002-12-02 16:38:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(159968, 8718, 4648, '<td valign="top">I ain''t believing this bike.  Proud look on his face.  Love the dog.  Their "bag-lady"?  Real nice photo.  Good focus.  Great crop - nice background.  It adds to for me.  Good colors.  Great composition and execution.  PTL9</td>', 'I ain''t believing this bike.  Proud look on his face.  Love the dog.  Their "bag-lady"?  Real nice photo.  Good focus.  Great crop - nice background.  It adds to for me.  Good colors.  Great composition and execution.  PTL9', '2002-11-25 09:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159969, 8718, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background8,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing7,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 9,<br/>Total Averaged Rating8.   Autool<br/>IMO the relationship between the title and picture are key elements in this challenge.  Oh, please give me the rest of the story.<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background8,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing7,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 9,Total Averaged Rating8.   AutoolIMO the relationship between the title and picture are key elements in this challenge.  Oh, please give me the rest of the story.', '2002-11-25 10:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
