(159993, 8722, 5120, '<td valign="top">I couldnt tell at first that the trees were all burnt up and didnt get the picture until I read the title and had a second look.  It is a nice picture, I just wish the burnt areas stood out more.<br/><br/>Greg<br/></td>', 'I couldnt tell at first that the trees were all burnt up and didnt get the picture until I read the title and had a second look.  It is a nice picture, I just wish the burnt areas stood out more.Greg', '2002-11-25 19:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
