(159996, 8722, 1792, '<td valign="top">If you were trying to show the greenery coming "out of the ashes" a lower angle might have been more effective.  There''s a neat photo here and it might have been more effective without the log in the foreground.  It sort of breaks up a nice vertical arrangement of lines established by the standing trees.</td>', 'If you were trying to show the greenery coming "out of the ashes" a lower angle might have been more effective.  There''s a neat photo here and it might have been more effective without the log in the foreground.  It sort of breaks up a nice vertical arrangement of lines established by the standing trees.', '2002-11-26 12:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159997, 8722, 4615, '<td valign="top">good photo, but for this challenge it doesn''t fit because photojournalism requires that the photo informs in a very clear way, someone who doesn''t already understand wouldn''t get it.</td>', 'good photo, but for this challenge it doesn''t fit because photojournalism requires that the photo informs in a very clear way, someone who doesn''t already understand wouldn''t get it.', '2002-11-26 21:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
