(160000, 8722, 737, '<td valign="top">Good photo. I like the contrast of green grass &amp; blackened trees.  Brown leaves bother me  a little with your title.  8<br/><br/>Jim msp</td>', 'Good photo. I like the contrast of green grass & blackened trees.  Brown leaves bother me  a little with your title.  8Jim msp', '2002-11-29 20:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160001, 8722, 4648, '<td valign="top">Eventually comes beauty but it is so ugly until then.  I like the fallen tree and think it adds to this shot.  Good centering and crop, maybe just a little more sky but it''s ok as is.  Personally I''d liked a little more sky.  Nice job.  PTL8</td>', 'Eventually comes beauty but it is so ugly until then.  I like the fallen tree and think it adds to this shot.  Good centering and crop, maybe just a little more sky but it''s ok as is.  Personally I''d liked a little more sky.  Nice job.  PTL8', '2002-12-01 14:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160002, 8722, 2716, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Good job on keeping this photo "straight".  I like it.  jacko 7</td>', 'Very nice.  Good job on keeping this photo "straight".  I like it.  jacko 7', '2002-12-01 19:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160003, 8722, 1280, '<td valign="top">I like the strong vertical lines combined with the horizontal foreground tree.  The colors are good, but not enough detail on the trees.  It isn''t immediately evident that there had been a fire, although once reading the title it becomes clearer.  Perhaps with less contrast some more detail could be detected?<br/>Snce the sky is overexposed, it may work better if the sky were just eliminated. It really doesn''t add anything to the image.  With the sky cropped, you''d be able to lighten the whole scene to expose more detail.<br/>I love that green coming up....would like to see it highlighted.  <br/>Overall I like this picture, and the subject is very photojournalistic.<br/>Grayce</td>', 'I like the strong vertical lines combined with the horizontal foreground tree.  The colors are good, but not enough detail on the trees.  It isn''t immediately evident that there had been a fire, although once reading the title it becomes clearer.  Perhaps with less contrast some more detail could be detected?Snce the sky is overexposed, it may work better if the sky were just eliminated. It really doesn''t add anything to the image.  With the sky cropped, you''d be able to lighten the whole scene to expose more detail.I love that green coming up....would like to see it highlighted.  Overall I like this picture, and the subject is very photojournalistic.Grayce', '2002-12-03 23:32:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(160004, 8723, 4967, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful photo, and the title makes it more photojournalistic, however I wish there was a human element, and this probably wouldn''t be front page news.  Good try though, and very creative!</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful photo, and the title makes it more photojournalistic, however I wish there was a human element, and this probably wouldn''t be front page news.  Good try though, and very creative!', '2002-11-25 00:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
