(160017, 8723, 2490, '<td valign="top">Good color, good composition.  Nice yellow, for sure.  Don''t really have any improvements to offer, but I don''t see the story.  I do see it as a magazine shot, or a newspaper LIVING section shot.  Therefore, you get the benefit of the doubt.  9 nards656</td>', 'Good color, good composition.  Nice yellow, for sure.  Don''t really have any improvements to offer, but I don''t see the story.  I do see it as a magazine shot, or a newspaper LIVING section shot.  Therefore, you get the benefit of the doubt.  9 nards656', '2002-11-27 12:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160018, 8723, 3317, '<td valign="top">really really beautiful landscape. i only wish periodicals would report on and print articles and pictures about the finer things in life like this. not really sensationalist enough for photojournalism though, right? only it goes to show photojournalism ain''t the only place to go look for beauty.</td>', 'really really beautiful landscape. i only wish periodicals would report on and print articles and pictures about the finer things in life like this. not really sensationalist enough for photojournalism though, right? only it goes to show photojournalism ain''t the only place to go look for beauty.', '2002-11-27 21:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
