(160021, 8723, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background6,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing7,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 7,<br/>Total Averaged Rating7.   Autool<br/>If it would have been possible I think you should have made it in landscape view with more of the yellow and reds, and less blue sky.</td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background6,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing7,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 7,Total Averaged Rating7.   AutoolIf it would have been possible I think you should have made it in landscape view with more of the yellow and reds, and less blue sky.', '2002-11-30 09:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
