(160042, 8724, 3317, '<td valign="top">this is a lot like the firemen picket line picture that got submitted this week - you got great compositions that include all the signs - at the same time you can tell the woman''s got a real compelling look on her face, and that''s where the real sweet rectangle''s gonna be, when you look at this shot you want to be close enough to really see her.</td>', 'this is a lot like the firemen picket line picture that got submitted this week - you got great compositions that include all the signs - at the same time you can tell the woman''s got a real compelling look on her face, and that''s where the real sweet rectangle''s gonna be, when you look at this shot you want to be close enough to really see her.', '2002-11-28 21:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
