(160045, 8724, 4596, '<td valign="top">Good shot.</td>', 'Good shot.', '2002-11-30 12:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160046, 8724, 4648, '<td valign="top">Good subject.  Photo too sharp and bright with all the white on the signs.  The leaves in th background actually hurt my eyes, as well as the fence.  Good subject but poor execution.  PTL4</td>', 'Good subject.  Photo too sharp and bright with all the white on the signs.  The leaves in th background actually hurt my eyes, as well as the fence.  Good subject but poor execution.  PTL4', '2002-12-01 13:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160047, 8724, 1019, '<td valign="top">Andrewm<br/>Critique Club<br/><br/><br/>I enjoy the composition of your pictureit is unusual but it works. ones eye seems to be led around in a square reading the signs and I find that I go back to the focal point which is the womans face.Having said that I think this works in the context of this challengeit is a very newspaper image-packed with information so that the copywriters dont have to do much work!<br/>In the background the spikey fence fits well into the image of an angry protester.<br/><br/>Your photo seems well exposed although I notice criticisms of overexposurebut I think you may have oversaturated the colour or used levels too much or used a small part of the picture blown up-- because there are chromatic aberrations all over the photo-in the leaves along the sign and these may be exacerbated by the over saturation.<br/><br/>However I think the strength of your subject  the owl like spectacles peering defiantly from a white face enveloped in a black anorak  This is an image that the viewer remembers for a long time.<br/><br/><br/></td>', 'AndrewmCritique ClubI enjoy the composition of your pictureit is unusual but it works. ones eye seems to be led around in a square reading the signs and I find that I go back to the focal point which is the womans face.Having said that I think this works in the context of this challengeit is a very newspaper image-packed with information so that the copywriters dont have to do much work!In the background the spikey fence fits well into the image of an angry protester.Your photo seems well exposed although I notice criticisms of overexposurebut I think you may have oversaturated the colour or used levels too much or used a small part of the picture blown up-- because there are chromatic aberrations all over the photo-in the leaves along the sign and these may be exacerbated by the over saturation.However I think the strength of your subject  the owl like spectacles peering defiantly from a white face enveloped in a black anorak  This is an image that the viewer remembers for a long time.', '2002-12-02 13:18:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(160048, 8726, 4967, '<td valign="top">LOL cute idea...very imaginitive.</td>', 'LOL cute idea...very imaginitive.', '2002-11-25 01:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
