(160089, 8728, 4648, '<td valign="top">Needs focus.  Too much sky in my opinion.  It''s hazy and doesn''t add to the photo.  The gractor with the houses crowding the land out are your subjects.  Come down on them.  Maybe add land in front of the tractor.  Just my personal opinion.  Nice idea and good topic though.  PTL6</td>', 'Needs focus.  Too much sky in my opinion.  It''s hazy and doesn''t add to the photo.  The gractor with the houses crowding the land out are your subjects.  Come down on them.  Maybe add land in front of the tractor.  Just my personal opinion.  Nice idea and good topic though.  PTL6', '2002-11-28 20:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
