(160106, 8732, 1280, '<td valign="top">Good, crisp focus, good color saturation,  interesting subject.  A perspective that would put it off-center would improve it though.  I''d like to see more of the houses on the right included, with their interesting rooflines.   Overall nice, but could use some improvement.  Grayce</td>', 'Good, crisp focus, good color saturation,  interesting subject.  A perspective that would put it off-center would improve it though.  I''d like to see more of the houses on the right included, with their interesting rooflines.   Overall nice, but could use some improvement.  Grayce', '2002-12-01 00:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160107, 8732, 737, '<td valign="top">(1) COMPOSITION (CONTENT) -  I really like the tower. Historic location, and something that probably should not be sold. However, the photo would have a lot more impact if it were not so centered. There are some excellent buildings on the right, and  probably on the left, along with a boat. I think I would like to see more of the buildings on the right, so move the tower to the left center of the photo.<br/>(2) BACKGROUND   Just a great blue sky; beautifully sets off the tower.<br/>(3) CAMERA WORK ,TECHNICAL   Great focus and DOF.<br/>(4) DIGITAL PROCESSING ,TECHNICAL   No recommended changes.<br/>(5) MY OPINION ON THE PHOTO  When I first looked at the photo, I knew it was in the Netherlands, and I liked it; brilliant blue sky sets off the tower. I think a title that indicated what it was sold for ( or to) would have strengthened the entry for the challenge. The viewer is left wondering  will it be knocked down ? turned into a restaurant? <br/><br/>Jim msp<br/>Critique Club<br/></td>', '(1) COMPOSITION (CONTENT) -  I really like the tower. Historic location, and something that probably should not be sold. However, the photo would have a lot more impact if it were not so centered. There are some excellent buildings on the right, and  probably on the left, along with a boat. I think I would like to see more of the buildings on the right, so move the tower to the left center of the photo.(2) BACKGROUND   Just a great blue sky; beautifully sets off the tower.(3) CAMERA WORK ,TECHNICAL   Great focus and DOF.(4) DIGITAL PROCESSING ,TECHNICAL   No recommended changes.(5) MY OPINION ON THE PHOTO  When I first looked at the photo, I knew it was in the Netherlands, and I liked it; brilliant blue sky sets off the tower. I think a title that indicated what it was sold for ( or to) would have strengthened the entry for the challenge. The viewer is left wondering  will it be knocked down ? turned into a restaurant? Jim mspCritique Club', '2002-12-02 21:06:00.000000', NULL, 0),
