(160114, 8739, 4927, '<td valign="top">Stunning picture, the aura of light along the tree line really gives the photo a magical feel. I can easily see how this could be on the front page of ''Astronomy'' or ''Sky and Telescope'' magazine. There is a little noise in the sky, but for a night shot at a high ISO (I''m assuming), very nice.</td>', 'Stunning picture, the aura of light along the tree line really gives the photo a magical feel. I can easily see how this could be on the front page of ''Astronomy'' or ''Sky and Telescope'' magazine. There is a little noise in the sky, but for a night shot at a high ISO (I''m assuming), very nice.', '2002-11-25 19:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
