(160132, 8739, 2170, '<td valign="top">I love the way the trees are framed.  Each individual branch is sharp and clear.  This is a fabulous photograph and a fine entry to the challenge.  A+ color.  muckpond</td>', 'I love the way the trees are framed.  Each individual branch is sharp and clear.  This is a fabulous photograph and a fine entry to the challenge.  A+ color.  muckpond', '2002-11-30 23:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160133, 8739, 5479, '<td valign="top">WOW!</td>', 'WOW!', '2002-12-02 14:49:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(160134, 8739, 2764, '<td valign="top">I gave this picture a 7 originally - now I am back for a second look from the critique club.  <br/><br/>At first glance the photo is bottom heavy.  All that black foreground does not balance well with the lovely sky.  But the sky part is extraordinary.  First for it''s blueness, what a gorgeous blue.  Second for it''s streaks of light and dots of stars.  The way the light shapes match the tree shapes at the left should be emphasized.  What if yu crop a bit from the bottom and take off the far right tree?  That would leave three tree shapes and three light shapes descending from left to right?  Too symetrical?  Okay, maybe.  But it''s a way to get rid of some black and focus on the contrast between the delicate lace of the trees and the smooth smears of the clouds.  That texture contrast is so nice.<br/><br/>I think the cropping is my only complaint here.  Technically it is beautiful, exposure and all that.  I hope it wan''t as cold at your house as it was at mine.  The way you have this shot framed, it doesn''t have a compositional focus or direction.  It could be more dynamic by either emphasizing where the rays of light are coming from. or where they are going to.  try a tighter crop.  It is almost a stunning picture, well it IS a stunning picture but it is almost a winning one.</td>', 'I gave this picture a 7 originally - now I am back for a second look from the critique club.  At first glance the photo is bottom heavy.  All that black foreground does not balance well with the lovely sky.  But the sky part is extraordinary.  First for it''s blueness, what a gorgeous blue.  Second for it''s streaks of light and dots of stars.  The way the light shapes match the tree shapes at the left should be emphasized.  What if yu crop a bit from the bottom and take off the far right tree?  That would leave three tree shapes and three light shapes descending from left to right?  Too symetrical?  Okay, maybe.  But it''s a way to get rid of some black and focus on the contrast between the delicate lace of the trees and the smooth smears of the clouds.  That texture contrast is so nice.I think the cropping is my only complaint here.  Technically it is beautiful, exposure and all that.  I hope it wan''t as cold at your house as it was at mine.  The way you have this shot framed, it doesn''t have a compositional focus or direction.  It could be more dynamic by either emphasizing where the rays of light are coming from. or where they are going to.  try a tighter crop.  It is almost a stunning picture, well it IS a stunning picture but it is almost a winning one.', '2002-12-03 16:59:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(160135, 8741, 4967, '<td valign="top">Not sure what this has to do with photojournalism, and your title doesn''t really explain much.</td>', 'Not sure what this has to do with photojournalism, and your title doesn''t really explain much.', '2002-11-25 00:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160136, 8741, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background6,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing6,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 6,<br/>Total Averaged Rating6.   Autool<br/>IMO the relationship between the title and picture are key elements in this challenge.   I don''t like to be cold, but what about them?   Neither your title or picture get me into a story, sorry.<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background6,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing6,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 6,Total Averaged Rating6.   AutoolIMO the relationship between the title and picture are key elements in this challenge.   I don''t like to be cold, but what about them?   Neither your title or picture get me into a story, sorry.', '2002-11-25 10:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160137, 8741, 327, '<td valign="top">Pretty good shooting, maybe a bit of a shake. Justine</td>', 'Pretty good shooting, maybe a bit of a shake. Justine', '2002-11-25 14:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160138, 8741, 3447, '<td valign="top">Striking photograph.  Must have been difficult to arrange for the little white cloud.   6      JEM</td>', 'Striking photograph.  Must have been difficult to arrange for the little white cloud.   6      JEM', '2002-11-27 12:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160139, 8741, 3317, '<td valign="top">real sweet reflections, hope this is somewhere you go everyday, have easy access to- get the same shots in all sorts of times, string ''em together, would be nice. are these buildings situated in such a way as to sometimes have the full moon between them? that would be the sweetest. then you sell it to the landlords for their promotional propoganda and they pay you a million dollars. seven though cause it doesn''t have any newsworthy mayhem involved.</td>', 'real sweet reflections, hope this is somewhere you go everyday, have easy access to- get the same shots in all sorts of times, string ''em together, would be nice. are these buildings situated in such a way as to sometimes have the full moon between them? that would be the sweetest. then you sell it to the landlords for their promotional propoganda and they pay you a million dollars. seven though cause it doesn''t have any newsworthy mayhem involved.', '2002-11-27 20:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160140, 8741, 4514, '<td valign="top">Intresting but for the challenge there is not really anything here that warrents attention to these two buildings.</td>', 'Intresting but for the challenge there is not really anything here that warrents attention to these two buildings.', '2002-11-27 21:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160141, 8741, 5347, '<td valign="top">Great depth and composition.  Your eyes are really directed up the picture.  Good job.</td>', 'Great depth and composition.  Your eyes are really directed up the picture.  Good job.', '2002-11-27 22:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160142, 8741, 5071, '<td valign="top">Very good photo!  I took one very similar to this on the morning of Sept. 11 from the Hilton Hotel across the street.  It brought back memories of how lucky I was on that day.  Good photo for this challenge. (9)            Lana</td>', 'Very good photo!  I took one very similar to this on the morning of Sept. 11 from the Hilton Hotel across the street.  It brought back memories of how lucky I was on that day.  Good photo for this challenge. (9)            Lana', '2002-11-28 08:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160143, 8741, 244, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, love the view, would have like to see the building on all 4 sides but you work with what you got.  Don''t know what journalisam context it has going but good shot 6 - Corey</td>', 'Nice shot, love the view, would have like to see the building on all 4 sides but you work with what you got.  Don''t know what journalisam context it has going but good shot 6 - Corey', '2002-11-29 21:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160144, 8741, 3247, '<td valign="top">I see 3 towers! Good lines.</td>', 'I see 3 towers! Good lines.', '2002-11-30 17:59:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(160145, 8742, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, the clouds and lighting are great.  DPz</td>', 'Nice shot, the clouds and lighting are great.  DPz', '2002-11-25 00:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160146, 8742, 4482, '<td valign="top">sorry to say but I''ve been looking at it for a while and the statue looks in no need of repair. Nice shot though 6 kosmik</td>', 'sorry to say but I''ve been looking at it for a while and the statue looks in no need of repair. Nice shot though 6 kosmik', '2002-11-25 10:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160147, 8742, 714, '<td valign="top">Very, very nice.  I like how you captured the sky by the angle of the shot.  Good colours and great subject.  Vote 10 Sonifo</td>', 'Very, very nice.  I like how you captured the sky by the angle of the shot.  Good colours and great subject.  Vote 10 Sonifo', '2002-11-25 10:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160148, 8742, 4821, '<td valign="top">Great subject, color, exposure, angle.  Great picture.  I can imagine seeing this on the front page.</td>', 'Great subject, color, exposure, angle.  Great picture.  I can imagine seeing this on the front page.', '2002-11-25 12:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160149, 8742, 327, '<td valign="top">I would of cropped out the bottom cement, but I do like this. The sky and the red berries really make this a good-good shot. Nice job! Justine</td>', 'I would of cropped out the bottom cement, but I do like this. The sky and the red berries really make this a good-good shot. Nice job! Justine', '2002-11-25 15:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160150, 8742, 4648, '<td valign="top">Georgeous picture.  Is that the ocean on the right behind the flowers?  I would have loved to see a little more of that.  Maybe a little higher angle.  The ocean would have added authenticity to it.  Great statue.  Good focus and light.  Nice crop.  Good composition, execution needs a little ocean.  Otherwise great photograph.  PTL8</td>', 'Georgeous picture.  Is that the ocean on the right behind the flowers?  I would have loved to see a little more of that.  Maybe a little higher angle.  The ocean would have added authenticity to it.  Great statue.  Good focus and light.  Nice crop.  Good composition, execution needs a little ocean.  Otherwise great photograph.  PTL8', '2002-11-25 21:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160151, 8742, 4514, '<td valign="top">Good shot.  One of the better ones so far.</td>', 'Good shot.  One of the better ones so far.', '2002-11-26 03:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160152, 8742, 4906, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture - 9</td>', 'Very nice picture - 9', '2002-11-26 09:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160153, 8742, 4851, '<td valign="top">Great colours - whats the account number</td>', 'Great colours - whats the account number', '2002-11-26 11:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160154, 8742, 2490, '<td valign="top">Awesome colors and composition.  I personally disapprove (normally) of shooting other people''s art, but for the purposes of PJ, I''m not counting that off.  8 nards656</td>', 'Awesome colors and composition.  I personally disapprove (normally) of shooting other people''s art, but for the purposes of PJ, I''m not counting that off.  8 nards656', '2002-11-27 12:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160155, 8742, 3317, '<td valign="top">especially sweet clouds. hey if the statue of juno in alabama can get federal funding, why not this guy? seven for you.</td>', 'especially sweet clouds. hey if the statue of juno in alabama can get federal funding, why not this guy? seven for you.', '2002-11-27 21:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160156, 8742, 472, '<td valign="top">i would have liked this cropped so i couldnt see the base or the concrete.  that would have cemented the illusion that this was a person.  great colors tho. might also benefit from a low radius high percentage unsharp mask.  mag99</td>', 'i would have liked this cropped so i couldnt see the base or the concrete.  that would have cemented the illusion that this was a person.  great colors tho. might also benefit from a low radius high percentage unsharp mask.  mag99', '2002-11-28 11:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160157, 8742, 4162, '<td valign="top">That is the most lifelike statue I have ever seen!  Great composition and colours in the sky.</td>', 'That is the most lifelike statue I have ever seen!  Great composition and colours in the sky.', '2002-11-28 22:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160158, 8742, 5044, '<td valign="top">Good use of colours. Nice composition. Sure to be a story behind it. Good choice of angle.</td>', 'Good use of colours. Nice composition. Sure to be a story behind it. Good choice of angle.', '2002-11-29 13:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160159, 8742, 4596, '<td valign="top">Okay shot.</td>', 'Okay shot.', '2002-11-30 17:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160160, 8742, 2, '<td valign="top">The colors in this photograph are really beautiful.  They work very well to create a great composition.  7.</td>', 'The colors in this photograph are really beautiful.  They work very well to create a great composition.  7.', '2002-12-01 23:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160161, 8743, 3032, '<td valign="top">This is so uninteresting.</td>', 'This is so uninteresting.', '2002-11-25 05:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160162, 8743, 3127, '<td valign="top">More ''action'' would have added a lot to this photo (i.e. travelers waiting in line, baggage waiting to be screened). It just needs to feel more alive.</td>', 'More ''action'' would have added a lot to this photo (i.e. travelers waiting in line, baggage waiting to be screened). It just needs to feel more alive.', '2002-11-25 11:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160163, 8743, 4821, '<td valign="top">this a clumsy composition</td>', 'this a clumsy composition', '2002-11-25 13:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160164, 8743, 4514, '<td valign="top">The color is great, but there has to be a better angle.  Hmmmmm.</td>', 'The color is great, but there has to be a better angle.  Hmmmmm.', '2002-11-26 03:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160165, 8743, 4906, '<td valign="top">Surprised they would let you photograph that.</td>', 'Surprised they would let you photograph that.', '2002-11-26 09:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160166, 8743, 811, '<td valign="top">I understand that this may have been teh only angle you were able to get (due ot security), but I am wondering if another angle showing more of the belt coming out, or something would be more effective.  Maybe using a horizontal cropping instead of a vertical one so that the stuff at the top would be eliminated. The yellow does well to capture the viewer''s attention.</td>', 'I understand that this may have been teh only angle you were able to get (due ot security), but I am wondering if another angle showing more of the belt coming out, or something would be more effective.  Maybe using a horizontal cropping instead of a vertical one so that the stuff at the top would be eliminated. The yellow does well to capture the viewer''s attention.', '2002-11-26 14:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160167, 8743, 4648, '<td valign="top">Great photo.  Clean, clear focus.  Good composition with great execution.  Is this the new luggage screening device they have in airports now?  Hope you explain how it works in your article.  I''m going to read to find out, cause it''s a good picture with interest to my safety.  Good one.  PTL7</td>', 'Great photo.  Clean, clear focus.  Good composition with great execution.  Is this the new luggage screening device they have in airports now?  Hope you explain how it works in your article.  I''m going to read to find out, cause it''s a good picture with interest to my safety.  Good one.  PTL7', '2002-11-27 00:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160168, 8743, 3317, '<td valign="top">would be more compelling with a security person, especially if they were particularly ignorant and underqualified looking.</td>', 'would be more compelling with a security person, especially if they were particularly ignorant and underqualified looking.', '2002-11-27 21:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160169, 8743, 5158, '<td valign="top">The title is good, but the image lacks behind it: does not tell the story. A picture of the security screen with some luggage would have been better.</td>', 'The title is good, but the image lacks behind it: does not tell the story. A picture of the security screen with some luggage would have been better.', '2002-11-28 17:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160170, 8744, 3380, '<td valign="top">Compostions seems to be a little average. Perhaps more lighting adjustments or more shadowing.</td>', 'Compostions seems to be a little average. Perhaps more lighting adjustments or more shadowing.', '2002-11-25 01:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160171, 8744, 4493, '<td valign="top">Good clearity and DOF. Slight smudge on the right in the sky, but a good shot overall.</td>', 'Good clearity and DOF. Slight smudge on the right in the sky, but a good shot overall.', '2002-11-25 09:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160172, 8744, 4648, '<td valign="top">The color doesn''t work for me here.  Would have been better in color.  Nice focus and good crop.  Decent execution.  PTL8</td>', 'The color doesn''t work for me here.  Would have been better in color.  Nice focus and good crop.  Decent execution.  PTL8', '2002-11-25 09:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160173, 8744, 3127, '<td valign="top">Good approach to show the enormity of the problem. Can decide if I like the lack of color, but will yield to your judgement.</td>', 'Good approach to show the enormity of the problem. Can decide if I like the lack of color, but will yield to your judgement.', '2002-11-25 10:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160174, 8744, 1019, '<td valign="top">Very good image and to the point--andrewm</td>', 'Very good image and to the point--andrewm', '2002-11-25 12:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160175, 8744, 327, '<td valign="top">Like the tone, but what am I looking at? Is this a mine shaft?</td>', 'Like the tone, but what am I looking at? Is this a mine shaft?', '2002-11-25 16:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160176, 8744, 3859, '<td valign="top">I think maybe this would work better in color.  Every thing is just too much the same shade with the sepia tone.</td>', 'I think maybe this would work better in color.  Every thing is just too much the same shade with the sepia tone.', '2002-11-25 23:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160177, 8744, 1792, '<td valign="top">There, no doubt is a story here.  The sepia tone, however, to me, evokes a more nostalgic feeling.  It''s possible b &amp; w or color would give the image more impact to illustrate the story the title suggests.</td>', 'There, no doubt is a story here.  The sepia tone, however, to me, evokes a more nostalgic feeling.  It''s possible b & w or color would give the image more impact to illustrate the story the title suggests.', '2002-11-26 11:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160178, 8744, 4162, '<td valign="top">I like the sepia toning here, but the colours look a little washed out.  Also I think that a couple of inches cropped off the top would help.</td>', 'I like the sepia toning here, but the colours look a little washed out.  Also I think that a couple of inches cropped off the top would help.', '2002-11-26 20:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160179, 8744, 5023, '<td valign="top">looks like a screen of somekind...i can see excavator teeth marks on the bank</td>', 'looks like a screen of somekind...i can see excavator teeth marks on the bank', '2002-11-26 21:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160180, 8744, 1664, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell exactly what "this Place" is.</td>', 'I can''t tell exactly what "this Place" is.', '2002-11-26 21:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160181, 8744, 4514, '<td valign="top">Ok you managed to loose me on this one.</td>', 'Ok you managed to loose me on this one.', '2002-11-27 01:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160182, 8744, 2490, '<td valign="top">I think BW is appropriate here, but I don''t understand what the mess is about.  I suspect a strip mine or something, but I could be wrong.  6 nards656</td>', 'I think BW is appropriate here, but I don''t understand what the mess is about.  I suspect a strip mine or something, but I could be wrong.  6 nards656', '2002-11-27 12:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160183, 8744, 4293, '<td valign="top">this is so flat and I can''t even tell what mess you are speaking of.</td>', 'this is so flat and I can''t even tell what mess you are speaking of.', '2002-11-27 19:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160184, 8744, 5158, '<td valign="top">Like it! Can imagine immediately the whole story behind it and how it moves a whole city!<br/></td>', 'Like it! Can imagine immediately the whole story behind it and how it moves a whole city!', '2002-11-28 17:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160185, 8744, 2170, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if the sepia tone works very well for this picture.  It''s pretty in-your-face and almost detracts from the picture.  Very clear and sharp, though.  muckpond.</td>', 'I don''t know if the sepia tone works very well for this picture.  It''s pretty in-your-face and almost detracts from the picture.  Very clear and sharp, though.  muckpond.', '2002-11-29 11:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160186, 8744, 4776, '<td valign="top">ugly</td>', 'ugly', '2002-11-29 15:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160187, 8744, 4596, '<td valign="top">Great duotone. Caption makes it.</td>', 'Great duotone. Caption makes it.', '2002-11-30 12:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160188, 8744, 3247, '<td valign="top">Not enough contrast.  If left 25% were cropped out it would have more focus</td>', 'Not enough contrast.  If left 25% were cropped out it would have more focus', '2002-11-30 17:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160189, 8745, 3280, '<td valign="top">Very good feeling of tension.  A bit dark especially at the bottom.  Did you try this in B &amp; W?  Good shot. DPz</td>', 'Very good feeling of tension.  A bit dark especially at the bottom.  Did you try this in B & W?  Good shot. DPz', '2002-11-25 00:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160190, 8745, 4267, '<td valign="top">adding some depth of field with the apature setting so the focus is on the man in the far left that is looking at us would really make this a great shot I think.. just my opinion which means I might be wrong.. but I do like this photo!<br/>~anachronite</td>', 'adding some depth of field with the apature setting so the focus is on the man in the far left that is looking at us would really make this a great shot I think.. just my opinion which means I might be wrong.. but I do like this photo!~anachronite', '2002-11-25 01:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160191, 8745, 3976, '<td valign="top">Big fan of metro pictures.  I wish it was lighter.</td>', 'Big fan of metro pictures.  I wish it was lighter.', '2002-11-25 11:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160192, 8745, 327, '<td valign="top">Pretty shot, on topic! Nice work. Maybe a tiny bit dark. Justine.</td>', 'Pretty shot, on topic! Nice work. Maybe a tiny bit dark. Justine.', '2002-11-25 18:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160193, 8745, 4162, '<td valign="top">Good job gettin this in focus, did you use a flash/? I tried the same thing on the Tokyo subway, didnt use the flash cause I didnt want to attract attention and everything came out very blurry!</td>', 'Good job gettin this in focus, did you use a flash/? I tried the same thing on the Tokyo subway, didnt use the flash cause I didnt want to attract attention and everything came out very blurry!', '2002-11-25 21:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160194, 8745, 1143, '<td valign="top">One of my top 3 in the challenge. It fits the topic better than the vast majority. It''s very clear. I''m telling you that it''s the photographer and not the camera that make a shot! I really like how all the people got together and decided to dress is such similar tones. It''s almost like a black and white which is totally cool. No complaints.  ~indi</td>', 'One of my top 3 in the challenge. It fits the topic better than the vast majority. It''s very clear. I''m telling you that it''s the photographer and not the camera that make a shot! I really like how all the people got together and decided to dress is such similar tones. It''s almost like a black and white which is totally cool. No complaints.  ~indi', '2002-11-25 22:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160195, 8745, 4906, '<td valign="top">A bit dark, but a difficult contrasty scene.</td>', 'A bit dark, but a difficult contrasty scene.', '2002-11-26 11:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160196, 8745, 4411, '<td valign="top">I really like the way only 3 colours dominate the image. <br/>Excellent composition - I like the way the guy on the right fills that side of the frame, seems to balance it out well. Shame you couldn''t get the guy on the left to look away (or even disappear so that we could see the girl!).<br/>Top shot, well done.</td>', 'I really like the way only 3 colours dominate the image. Excellent composition - I like the way the guy on the right fills that side of the frame, seems to balance it out well. Shame you couldn''t get the guy on the left to look away (or even disappear so that we could see the girl!).Top shot, well done.', '2002-11-26 18:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160197, 8745, 5023, '<td valign="top">I really like this one  +7</td>', 'I really like this one  +7', '2002-11-26 21:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160198, 8745, 4514, '<td valign="top">Good shot.  Wondering what could be done to this to make it a great shot.  Will let you know.  How about zooming in on the guys face who is hanging from the bar and try to get some disguist on his face because the train is so packed.</td>', 'Good shot.  Wondering what could be done to this to make it a great shot.  Will let you know.  How about zooming in on the guys face who is hanging from the bar and try to get some disguist on his face because the train is so packed.', '2002-11-27 05:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160199, 8745, 3459, '<td valign="top">An excellent photograph, that perserves the mood of the riders as well as the sence of motion.  I like the post-shot processing, it is done just right.  Make top three on my list.</td>', 'An excellent photograph, that perserves the mood of the riders as well as the sence of motion.  I like the post-shot processing, it is done just right.  Make top three on my list.', '2002-11-27 13:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160200, 8745, 4293, '<td valign="top">nice photo...it really takes me there!</td>', 'nice photo...it really takes me there!', '2002-11-27 19:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160201, 8745, 2490, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot, good PJ.  The only prob I see is the central figure has his back to you, and that distracts me for some reason.  8 nards656</td>', 'Awesome shot, good PJ.  The only prob I see is the central figure has his back to you, and that distracts me for some reason.  8 nards656', '2002-11-27 21:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160202, 8745, 4077, '<td valign="top">Hmm... recognise this one.</td>', 'Hmm... recognise this one.', '2002-11-28 05:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160203, 8745, 5158, '<td valign="top">Fits great to the topic. Maybe not the cover page but for sure the local section.<br/>BTW: I''m lucky not to drive the underground: atmosphere seems pretty odd.<br/></td>', 'Fits great to the topic. Maybe not the cover page but for sure the local section.BTW: I''m lucky not to drive the underground: atmosphere seems pretty odd.', '2002-11-28 17:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160204, 8745, 4648, '<td valign="top">2, maybe 3, wonder what you are doing.  He looks discusseded. At you, or the delay?  Can''t tell for sure.  Nice shot and news worthy.  Good picture.  I like the soft colors here.  Adds to their moods.  Great execution.  Nice finishing touch.    Technically sound photo.  Good job well done.  PTL8</td>', '2, maybe 3, wonder what you are doing.  He looks discusseded. At you, or the delay?  Can''t tell for sure.  Nice shot and news worthy.  Good picture.  I like the soft colors here.  Adds to their moods.  Great execution.  Nice finishing touch.    Technically sound photo.  Good job well done.  PTL8', '2002-11-28 20:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160205, 8745, 3540, '<td valign="top">I think this pic would''ve been better framed with the guy in the right as the predominant subject in this pic.  The lady with her back to us is really making this picture dark as she is wearing black and has black hair.  The guy on the right I think would''ve made a good center of attention since we have a pretty good look at his face.  Also, putting this in greyscale and boosting the brightness might have helped quite a bit. - Inspzil</td>', 'I think this pic would''ve been better framed with the guy in the right as the predominant subject in this pic.  The lady with her back to us is really making this picture dark as she is wearing black and has black hair.  The guy on the right I think would''ve made a good center of attention since we have a pretty good look at his face.  Also, putting this in greyscale and boosting the brightness might have helped quite a bit. - Inspzil', '2002-11-29 04:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160206, 8745, 4596, '<td valign="top">Good shot.</td>', 'Good shot.', '2002-11-30 12:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160207, 8745, 811, '<td valign="top">I love the coloring on this.  You have done well capturing the mood.  I do hope that one guy looking at you didn''t take offense.  I really like the effect the bars have on the mood of the picture.  Kind of a captivating feeling, I think.  Great lighting, and contrasts.  9 -- karmat</td>', 'I love the coloring on this.  You have done well capturing the mood.  I do hope that one guy looking at you didn''t take offense.  I really like the effect the bars have on the mood of the picture.  Kind of a captivating feeling, I think.  Great lighting, and contrasts.  9 -- karmat', '2002-12-01 17:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160208, 8745, 4186, '<td valign="top">very interesting photo. the contrast of the black at the bottom and white and the top really works. the angles are interesting. the overall lack of colors other than yellow and skintones, and the muting of those makes it look cold and mechanical. ...and kinda like penguins. beware the penguins. 10? yeah, 10.</td>', 'very interesting photo. the contrast of the black at the bottom and white and the top really works. the angles are interesting. the overall lack of colors other than yellow and skintones, and the muting of those makes it look cold and mechanical. ...and kinda like penguins. beware the penguins. 10? yeah, 10.', '2002-12-01 20:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160210, 8745, 2170, '<td valign="top">CRITIQUE CLUB!   (bwahahahahaha)<br/><br/>Overall impression:  Great photo that captures a rather routine moment but is easy for the viewer to understand what''s going on.  A good way of framing an everyday event in an interesting manner.<br/><br/>Focus and framing of the shot are great.  I like the disenchanted look on "Harry Potter''s" face, but also the interest on the face of the man on the left.  (He''s like "what the hell are you doing with a camera on the subway?")  The color, unfortunately, is pretty washedout and the lack of contrast makes the lower half of the picture pretty much blend together.  The women in the lower right with the dark hair are almost completely obscured in the midst of all of the black clothing; that''s unfortunate because you lose the "standing vs. sitting" aspect of the train.  The lights at the top are also a bit harsh -- not much you can do about that, though.<br/><br/>I think the thing that is most lacking in this picture is people''s expressions about being on the train.  One man in the foreground is dejected, one man is looking toward you, and everyone else is just...there.  Perhaps a shot of someone looking at someone else, or someone rolling their eyes, or some other image of disgust would illustrate the point of the photograph better.<br/><br/>Who am I to say, really?  It beat the pants off of my submission.  Good work -- a nicely captured moment in time.<br/><br/>Rob 8)<br/></td>', 'CRITIQUE CLUB!   (bwahahahahaha)Overall impression:  Great photo that captures a rather routine moment but is easy for the viewer to understand what''s going on.  A good way of framing an everyday event in an interesting manner.Focus and framing of the shot are great.  I like the disenchanted look on "Harry Potter''s" face, but also the interest on the face of the man on the left.  (He''s like "what the hell are you doing with a camera on the subway?")  The color, unfortunately, is pretty washedout and the lack of contrast makes the lower half of the picture pretty much blend together.  The women in the lower right with the dark hair are almost completely obscured in the midst of all of the black clothing; that''s unfortunate because you lose the "standing vs. sitting" aspect of the train.  The lights at the top are also a bit harsh -- not much you can do about that, though.I think the thing that is most lacking in this picture is people''s expressions about being on the train.  One man in the foreground is dejected, one man is looking toward you, and everyone else is just...there.  Perhaps a shot of someone looking at someone else, or someone rolling their eyes, or some other image of disgust would illustrate the point of the photograph better.Who am I to say, really?  It beat the pants off of my submission.  Good work -- a nicely captured moment in time.Rob 8)', '2002-12-02 16:29:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(160211, 8746, 221, '<td valign="top">Well, if your story is snow then i guess this would work, but it needs people</td>', 'Well, if your story is snow then i guess this would work, but it needs people', '2002-11-25 01:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160212, 8746, 4821, '<td valign="top">I wish this image was less washed out.  And it is sort of divided down the middle which is distracting to me.</td>', 'I wish this image was less washed out.  And it is sort of divided down the middle which is distracting to me.', '2002-11-25 12:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160213, 8746, 327, '<td valign="top">I think your showing me a snow covered road, it all looks like it''s still snowing. Hum, too bad because I''m really just seeing the billboard and the telephone poles. Justine</td>', 'I think your showing me a snow covered road, it all looks like it''s still snowing. Hum, too bad because I''m really just seeing the billboard and the telephone poles. Justine', '2002-11-25 14:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160214, 8746, 4648, '<td valign="top">I realize it is snow, which I love, but it''s too bright.  Not really in focus.  Good idea just needs better execution.  Like the sign on the right - Looks like several layers of signs being changed.  Where do you have this much snow already?  I''m jealous.  Maybe if you went with color instead of B&amp;W it would cut down on the brightness.  Just my opinion.  PTL4  The more i look at it the focus looks worse all the time.</td>', 'I realize it is snow, which I love, but it''s too bright.  Not really in focus.  Good idea just needs better execution.  Like the sign on the right - Looks like several layers of signs being changed.  Where do you have this much snow already?  I''m jealous.  Maybe if you went with color instead of B&W it would cut down on the brightness.  Just my opinion.  PTL4  The more i look at it the focus looks worse all the time.', '2002-11-25 22:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160215, 8746, 2361, '<td valign="top">I cannot imagine that even the Sisseton local paper would print this.  Jak 2</td>', 'I cannot imagine that even the Sisseton local paper would print this.  Jak 2', '2002-11-26 15:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160216, 8746, 4162, '<td valign="top">The low key approach is beautiful here.  I am not sure that it would have a stong enough impact for a newspaper or mag.  But the effect is great.</td>', 'The low key approach is beautiful here.  I am not sure that it would have a stong enough impact for a newspaper or mag.  But the effect is great.', '2002-11-26 20:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160217, 8746, 737, '<td valign="top">Looks over exposed. Background way too hazy. Subject strikes me as so-so.<br/><br/>Jim msp</td>', 'Looks over exposed. Background way too hazy. Subject strikes me as so-so.Jim msp', '2002-11-26 22:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160218, 8746, 4514, '<td valign="top">I am lost.  Is this a town???</td>', 'I am lost.  Is this a town???', '2002-11-27 01:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160219, 8746, 2302, '<td valign="top">I am curious about the choice for b&amp;w here. You seem to lose a lot of the shot in the sky and lower left corner and I wonder if color would have helped there. I am not sure where I should be looking my eyes bounce around too much. Focus could be better. As it is now it is too blured for my taste.</td>', 'I am curious about the choice for b&w here. You seem to lose a lot of the shot in the sky and lower left corner and I wonder if color would have helped there. I am not sure where I should be looking my eyes bounce around too much. Focus could be better. As it is now it is too blured for my taste.', '2002-11-27 14:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160220, 8746, 543, '<td valign="top">Interesting image.  The chaos of the billboard makes a good contrast with the serenity of the snowy scene.  My only nit here is that the power poles divide the image a little too neatly up the center.  I''d have panned just a little more left until the edge of the billboard was up against the R side of the frame.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Interesting image.  The chaos of the billboard makes a good contrast with the serenity of the snowy scene.  My only nit here is that the power poles divide the image a little too neatly up the center.  I''d have panned just a little more left until the edge of the billboard was up against the R side of the frame.  Nicely done.', '2002-11-28 14:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160221, 8746, 5121, '<td valign="top">Good image. The high contrast works well.</td>', 'Good image. The high contrast works well.', '2002-11-30 14:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160222, 8746, 4186, '<td valign="top">alright. this one i have to think about. it is one of the best photos i have ever seen on this site. the composition and your blatant denial of the rule of thirds works beautifully. the contrast settings and empty feel on the left are awesome. and the billboard saying "give up. it works!" torn from a christian message is so wonderfully bleak. that''s either a brilliant subject modification on your part or a really lucky find.<br/><br/>....however. for the life of me, i can''t figure out how it fits the challenge. i''m really trying too. it''s making me feel stupid. lol. so i''m going to give you the benefit of the doubt, and assume you knew what you were doing, and give you a ten.</td>', 'alright. this one i have to think about. it is one of the best photos i have ever seen on this site. the composition and your blatant denial of the rule of thirds works beautifully. the contrast settings and empty feel on the left are awesome. and the billboard saying "give up. it works!" torn from a christian message is so wonderfully bleak. that''s either a brilliant subject modification on your part or a really lucky find.....however. for the life of me, i can''t figure out how it fits the challenge. i''m really trying too. it''s making me feel stupid. lol. so i''m going to give you the benefit of the doubt, and assume you knew what you were doing, and give you a ten.', '2002-12-01 10:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160223, 8747, 4267, '<td valign="top">haha great idea</td>', 'haha great idea', '2002-11-25 01:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
