(160231, 8747, 2553, '<td valign="top">Nice clear shot  with good lighting, and I like the composition.  The shot of the peacock is actually quite nice!!  The shot on the "cover" of the NG is definitely photojournalism, but is THIS shot  photojournalism??   lhall  :)</td>', 'Nice clear shot  with good lighting, and I like the composition.  The shot of the peacock is actually quite nice!!  The shot on the "cover" of the NG is definitely photojournalism, but is THIS shot  photojournalism??   lhall  :)', '2002-11-25 19:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
