(160237, 8747, 3018, '<td valign="top">Congratulations for making the cover! Very cool idea and well executed.  The picture of the peacock is nice, good pose of the bird and good texture of the tree. The piling of the magazines is a nice detail.</td>', 'Congratulations for making the cover! Very cool idea and well executed.  The picture of the peacock is nice, good pose of the bird and good texture of the tree. The piling of the magazines is a nice detail.', '2002-11-26 18:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
