(160245, 8747, 1031, '<td valign="top">A clever idea well done. To me, it straddles the line between fair use and infringement -- as a personal project or parody it should be OK, but I wouldn''t suggest trying to sell any reproductions...if the peacock photo is your''s you''d be better off using a similar name, something like "Natural Cartographic" which would suggest but not copy...</td>', 'A clever idea well done. To me, it straddles the line between fair use and infringement -- as a personal project or parody it should be OK, but I wouldn''t suggest trying to sell any reproductions...if the peacock photo is your''s you''d be better off using a similar name, something like "Natural Cartographic" which would suggest but not copy...', '2002-11-28 20:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160246, 8747, 3087, '<td valign="top">Witty and good photo.<br/>I received my first issue as a subscriber just this week.<br/>Your photo is just the sort of thing I''d be happy to see on the front cover.<br/>8, Kavey</td>', 'Witty and good photo.I received my first issue as a subscriber just this week.Your photo is just the sort of thing I''d be happy to see on the front cover.8, Kavey', '2002-12-01 16:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160247, 8748, 4967, '<td valign="top">I had no idea that during a drug bust they also displayed firearms that were found.  Very interesting.  Good choice of black and white!  Wish you could read what the two white papers said, but interesting shot, though not front page worthy, very newspaper worthy!  - Talya</td>', 'I had no idea that during a drug bust they also displayed firearms that were found.  Very interesting.  Good choice of black and white!  Wish you could read what the two white papers said, but interesting shot, though not front page worthy, very newspaper worthy!  - Talya', '2002-11-25 00:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
