(160275, 8749, 772, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot... I think you did a great job of photographing this parade... I also particularly like the shadow being cast here... including the people on the left edge of the frame makes this image even stronger... very nice work :)  BTW- please help support this site by commenting on photos.  The photographers really appreciate it!  if you already comment on photos, comment on some extra ones :) - setzler</td>', 'Excellent shot... I think you did a great job of photographing this parade... I also particularly like the shadow being cast here... including the people on the left edge of the frame makes this image even stronger... very nice work :)  BTW- please help support this site by commenting on photos.  The photographers really appreciate it!  if you already comment on photos, comment on some extra ones :) - setzler', '2002-11-26 15:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160276, 8749, 4648, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo.  Looks like a very nice little hometown.  Love the old cars.  Would hope the article tells us a little about these vintage vehicles.  This is a town I''d like to visit, just from the photo.  Great job.  PTL10  All the photo technics are right.</td>', 'Beautiful photo.  Looks like a very nice little hometown.  Love the old cars.  Would hope the article tells us a little about these vintage vehicles.  This is a town I''d like to visit, just from the photo.  Great job.  PTL10  All the photo technics are right.', '2002-11-26 20:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
