(160278, 8749, 5070, '<td valign="top">Captures the scene well.</td>', 'Captures the scene well.', '2002-11-30 19:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160279, 8749, 3280, '<td valign="top">Good PJ shot.  Looks like the front page of a small town paper.  It seems just a bit fuzzy though.  DPz</td>', 'Good PJ shot.  Looks like the front page of a small town paper.  It seems just a bit fuzzy though.  DPz', '2002-12-01 06:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160280, 8749, 5121, '<td valign="top">Wow! A potential photographers paradise here!</td>', 'Wow! A potential photographers paradise here!', '2002-12-01 07:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160281, 8749, 2344, '<td valign="top">The first thing I ask myself when I see this picture is "Why is everything red? is it because the town''s "colour" is red? or did it just happen that way?" It works in this case though because it fuirther aids the leading line from the bottom right to the middle left. I see bystanders only on the left side, which is fine. The cars are sharp (from what my monitor shows me). It''s also nice that the cars are at almost the same distance in the picture.. and old cars are so cool to look at!!!<br/>I find the bell shaped object at the top left to be really distracting as well as the traffic lights at the back... Not much you could have done about the lights.. but the bell thing could have been cropped out. Overall the colour and exposure looks good.  Good job!</td>', 'The first thing I ask myself when I see this picture is "Why is everything red? is it because the town''s "colour" is red? or did it just happen that way?" It works in this case though because it fuirther aids the leading line from the bottom right to the middle left. I see bystanders only on the left side, which is fine. The cars are sharp (from what my monitor shows me). It''s also nice that the cars are at almost the same distance in the picture.. and old cars are so cool to look at!!!I find the bell shaped object at the top left to be really distracting as well as the traffic lights at the back... Not much you could have done about the lights.. but the bell thing could have been cropped out. Overall the colour and exposure looks good.  Good job!', '2002-12-02 15:56:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(160282, 8750, 4648, '<td valign="top">Such a cute little boy - he is a 10.  Great shot.  Good subject and execution.  Nice composition.  Nice crop.  Good focus.  I would have prefered color here.  PTL8</td>', 'Such a cute little boy - he is a 10.  Great shot.  Good subject and execution.  Nice composition.  Nice crop.  Good focus.  I would have prefered color here.  PTL8', '2002-11-25 09:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
