(160289, 8750, 1280, '<td valign="top">This is darling, and something you''d see in a newspaper, or a magazine.  The expression on this child really makes the picture. You''ve included just enough detail to fill in the information.  LOVE IT!!!  Best of luck in the challenge. Please remember to keep an open mind when voting. Grayce aka Gracious</td>', 'This is darling, and something you''d see in a newspaper, or a magazine.  The expression on this child really makes the picture. You''ve included just enough detail to fill in the information.  LOVE IT!!!  Best of luck in the challenge. Please remember to keep an open mind when voting. Grayce aka Gracious', '2002-11-25 18:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160290, 8750, 472, '<td valign="top">this is actually really good. i admit i had only looked at the thumbnail before and not seen what the shot truly consists of.  now that i see it''s the salvation army with the bell, i realize that, even tho this may be set up, to the vast majority of people this will appear to be an incredibly lucky catch and they will probably rate it quite highly : ) .. i''m just jealous i dont have such a disarmingly cute model at my disposal! : ) .. and as usual, you have a knack for good exposure.  mag99</td>', 'this is actually really good. i admit i had only looked at the thumbnail before and not seen what the shot truly consists of.  now that i see it''s the salvation army with the bell, i realize that, even tho this may be set up, to the vast majority of people this will appear to be an incredibly lucky catch and they will probably rate it quite highly : ) .. i''m just jealous i dont have such a disarmingly cute model at my disposal! : ) .. and as usual, you have a knack for good exposure.  mag99', '2002-11-25 18:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
