(160297, 8750, 2337, '<td valign="top">It takes courage to submit a picture of a cute child here... I hope the "kid bashers club" see this shot for what it is (an excellent technical effort that is 100% on target for the challenge) and not just write it off as someone posting a cute shot of their kid... btw ~ Cute Kid :)  ~ MyQyl ~</td>', 'It takes courage to submit a picture of a cute child here... I hope the "kid bashers club" see this shot for what it is (an excellent technical effort that is 100% on target for the challenge) and not just write it off as someone posting a cute shot of their kid... btw ~ Cute Kid :)  ~ MyQyl ~', '2002-11-27 13:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
