(160303, 8750, 4162, '<td valign="top">Absolutely gorgeous child!</td>', 'Absolutely gorgeous child!', '2002-11-28 22:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160304, 8750, 2567, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Definate 10</td>', 'Great shot.  Definate 10', '2002-11-29 00:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160305, 8750, 3540, '<td valign="top">Adorable shot of admirable work.  I''m glad he got some recognition on this shot.  I could see this pic in the paper.  It is well framed.  i really like his expression and he''s ''in action''.  The only thing that would make this better is a contributor putting a little money in the bucket.  This is a nice representation of people helping the community, regardless of age or size.  - Inspzil</td>', 'Adorable shot of admirable work.  I''m glad he got some recognition on this shot.  I could see this pic in the paper.  It is well framed.  i really like his expression and he''s ''in action''.  The only thing that would make this better is a contributor putting a little money in the bucket.  This is a nice representation of people helping the community, regardless of age or size.  - Inspzil', '2002-11-29 05:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160306, 8750, 4305, '<td valign="top">sticky bandits rule!</td>', 'sticky bandits rule!', '2002-11-30 02:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160307, 8750, 4596, '<td valign="top">Usually cute kid shots don''t do too well. This one really works. Great that the subject is NOT looking at the camera.</td>', 'Usually cute kid shots don''t do too well. This one really works. Great that the subject is NOT looking at the camera.', '2002-11-30 12:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
