(160339, 8755, 4482, '<td valign="top">Love it! I hope you make the top 10 with this one. It''s a powerful journalistic shot. 9 kosmik</td>', 'Love it! I hope you make the top 10 with this one. It''s a powerful journalistic shot. 9 kosmik', '2002-11-25 11:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
