(160390, 8756, 4186, '<td valign="top">i know everyone else probably left the same comment, but i think the title hurts this picture. it''s a great shot, well composed, and definitally the sort of thing you would see on a front page of a local newspaper. something like "Driver charged with DUI in fatal wreck" would have been a lot better. but i''m not gonna mark off for it, because this is a photography site, and not a "name that picture" site. i think i''ll give it a 9.</td>', 'i know everyone else probably left the same comment, but i think the title hurts this picture. it''s a great shot, well composed, and definitally the sort of thing you would see on a front page of a local newspaper. something like "Driver charged with DUI in fatal wreck" would have been a lot better. but i''m not gonna mark off for it, because this is a photography site, and not a "name that picture" site. i think i''ll give it a 9.', '2002-12-01 10:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
