(160412, 8757, 1031, '<td valign="top">I hope they bought the kid a camera! Interesting use of high-contrast B+W helps focus on the characters/story rather than the advertising, while using the displays to provide context.</td>', 'I hope they bought the kid a camera! Interesting use of high-contrast B+W helps focus on the characters/story rather than the advertising, while using the displays to provide context.', '2002-11-28 20:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
