(160430, 8758, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice clear shot with nice composition.  I don''t think I like the Sepia tones though. DPz</td>', 'Nice clear shot with nice composition.  I don''t think I like the Sepia tones though. DPz', '2002-12-01 06:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160431, 8758, 527, '<td valign="top">What jumps out at me immediately is the sepia tones. I don''t mind sepia but I don''t think it fits with this photo and particularily for the Photojournalism challenge. Photojournalism seems to be about capturing the truth, presenting something the way it really is and not about creating something artsy. I would have chosen black and white if you didn''t want it in color. It is a nice clean shot but I would have preferred to see a little more of the left side of the building or a straight on, dynamic looking shot. The second thing that jumped out at me was the lack of a story or message. This could be done by showing people in the photo. Maybe you would not have felt comfortable shooting this when people are coming or going but I think it would have given the photo some life and a purpose. It''s not a bad shot but I feel it needs something more to make it more striking with something to say.<br/><br/>Tim Jensen</td>', 'What jumps out at me immediately is the sepia tones. I don''t mind sepia but I don''t think it fits with this photo and particularily for the Photojournalism challenge. Photojournalism seems to be about capturing the truth, presenting something the way it really is and not about creating something artsy. I would have chosen black and white if you didn''t want it in color. It is a nice clean shot but I would have preferred to see a little more of the left side of the building or a straight on, dynamic looking shot. The second thing that jumped out at me was the lack of a story or message. This could be done by showing people in the photo. Maybe you would not have felt comfortable shooting this when people are coming or going but I think it would have given the photo some life and a purpose. It''s not a bad shot but I feel it needs something more to make it more striking with something to say.Tim Jensen', '2002-12-02 14:54:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(160432, 8759, 4493, '<td valign="top">It''s a good clean shot, but perhaps pulling back a little so we can see what the bear is attached to would help us understand it a little better.</td>', 'It''s a good clean shot, but perhaps pulling back a little so we can see what the bear is attached to would help us understand it a little better.', '2002-11-25 09:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160433, 8759, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background6,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing8,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 7,<br/>Total Averaged Rating7.   Autool<br/>IMO the relationship between the title and picture are key elements in this challenge.  Are you trying to give us all a guilt complex?   God job.<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background6,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing8,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 7,Total Averaged Rating7.   AutoolIMO the relationship between the title and picture are key elements in this challenge.  Are you trying to give us all a guilt complex?   God job.', '2002-11-25 10:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160434, 8759, 714, '<td valign="top">Very interesting.  Makes me want to read the article.  And for that you get an 9.  Sonifo</td>', 'Very interesting.  Makes me want to read the article.  And for that you get an 9.  Sonifo', '2002-11-25 10:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160435, 8759, 3459, '<td valign="top">An excellent message, and a well done picture.</td>', 'An excellent message, and a well done picture.', '2002-11-25 12:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160436, 8759, 2337, '<td valign="top">This looks like it might be a shrine or memorial to a child, however, the angle/crop doesn''t show that with any certainty.   The flowers and ballon suggest this is a small part of a larger scene and it might have been better to pull back a bit to "see the forest for the trees"  so to speak.  The colors are very nice (especailly the bow). Nice job ~ Myqyl ~</td>', 'This looks like it might be a shrine or memorial to a child, however, the angle/crop doesn''t show that with any certainty.   The flowers and ballon suggest this is a small part of a larger scene and it might have been better to pull back a bit to "see the forest for the trees"  so to speak.  The colors are very nice (especailly the bow). Nice job ~ Myqyl ~', '2002-11-25 14:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160437, 8759, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting photo and I like the angle of the lighting as well.  I''m not sure that I understand the intention though... - setzler</td>', 'This is an interesting photo and I like the angle of the lighting as well.  I''m not sure that I understand the intention though... - setzler', '2002-11-26 14:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160438, 8759, 4514, '<td valign="top">Very strong photo.  I assume this is a memorial.  For the first time I say back away a bit to show more</td>', 'Very strong photo.  I assume this is a memorial.  For the first time I say back away a bit to show more', '2002-11-27 01:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160439, 8759, 2170, '<td valign="top">If this is a photo of an impromptu memorial of some kind, I think the effect is lost.  A wider shot of the entire area would have more of an impact on the viewer.  At first glance, this just looks like a picture of a choking teddy bear.  muckpond</td>', 'If this is a photo of an impromptu memorial of some kind, I think the effect is lost.  A wider shot of the entire area would have more of an impact on the viewer.  At first glance, this just looks like a picture of a choking teddy bear.  muckpond', '2002-11-27 10:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160440, 8759, 4049, '<td valign="top">So if the bear is meant to be a child, that means your kids are stringing ropes around their necks at 11pm... yeah, I think I will be too.</td>', 'So if the bear is meant to be a child, that means your kids are stringing ropes around their necks at 11pm... yeah, I think I will be too.', '2002-11-27 14:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160441, 8759, 3730, '<td valign="top">Here we go with the TeddyBears again...LOL....nice lighting, subject too centered</td>', 'Here we go with the TeddyBears again...LOL....nice lighting, subject too centered', '2002-12-01 09:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160442, 8760, 4615, '<td valign="top">I hope you received some remuneration from the company?  My interpretation of the challenge is photos should be or at least look non staged.  (Journalism)</td>', 'I hope you received some remuneration from the company?  My interpretation of the challenge is photos should be or at least look non staged.  (Journalism)', '2002-11-25 08:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160443, 8760, 327, '<td valign="top">He''s a hotty! He''s also got really small hands....&amp;lt;?&amp;gt; Maybe it just looks that way. I love the concept, the shot is clean, in focus and interesting. Over all it''s pretty nice work. Justine</td>', 'He''s a hotty! He''s also got really small hands....&lt;?&gt; Maybe it just looks that way. I love the concept, the shot is clean, in focus and interesting. Over all it''s pretty nice work. Justine', '2002-11-25 16:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160444, 8760, 3859, '<td valign="top">This would have been a winner in an advertising challenge! Interesting idea and great color. But for photojournalism, well, it just doesn''t do it for me.( I have to ask,<br/>is that a wig or his real hair?}</td>', 'This would have been a winner in an advertising challenge! Interesting idea and great color. But for photojournalism, well, it just doesn''t do it for me.( I have to ask,is that a wig or his real hair?}', '2002-11-25 16:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160445, 8760, 4494, '<td valign="top">The bottle is out of focus.</td>', 'The bottle is out of focus.', '2002-11-25 17:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160446, 8760, 5376, '<td valign="top">be a good ad. maybe you should send it in to A&amp;B.</td>', 'be a good ad. maybe you should send it in to A&B.', '2002-11-25 18:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160447, 8760, 4811, '<td valign="top">I think this misses the theme a bit. Sure there are advertisments in journals, magazines and newspapers but the photo should be representative of what you''d find in the actual articles/cover of the magazine/newspaper.</td>', 'I think this misses the theme a bit. Sure there are advertisments in journals, magazines and newspapers but the photo should be representative of what you''d find in the actual articles/cover of the magazine/newspaper.', '2002-11-25 19:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160448, 8760, 4514, '<td valign="top">An advertisement for beer maybe, but not for this challenge.  Next time instead of flash try a reflector and use the sun to light the face..</td>', 'An advertisement for beer maybe, but not for this challenge.  Next time instead of flash try a reflector and use the sun to light the face..', '2002-11-27 02:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160449, 8760, 811, '<td valign="top">The exposure on this is awsome considering that it is backlight with the sun.  Nice work.  I almost think the pose would seem more natural though if he were holding the bottle with one hand instead of two.    Of course, you may not have wanted natural!  Nice colors as well. karmat</td>', 'The exposure on this is awsome considering that it is backlight with the sun.  Nice work.  I almost think the pose would seem more natural though if he were holding the bottle with one hand instead of two.    Of course, you may not have wanted natural!  Nice colors as well. karmat', '2002-11-27 12:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160450, 8760, 4776, '<td valign="top">Nice job centering the beer under the sun, but how is this journalism? 5</td>', 'Nice job centering the beer under the sun, but how is this journalism? 5', '2002-11-27 14:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
