(160452, 8760, 5347, '<td valign="top">Oh yeah!</td>', 'Oh yeah!', '2002-11-27 23:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160453, 8760, 3746, '<td valign="top">more of an advertising shot than photojournalism, doesn''t really nail the challenge I''m afraid... nice use of fill-in lflash though.  6 marksimms</td>', 'more of an advertising shot than photojournalism, doesn''t really nail the challenge I''m afraid... nice use of fill-in lflash though.  6 marksimms', '2002-11-28 03:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160454, 8760, 4648, '<td valign="top">Advertisement!  I love the shot.  Biggest problem - can''t read which beer is the king of beers.  In advertisement that''s very important.  Maybe zoomed in some and did away with more of the side and we could read the beer brand.  As a photo it is beautiful.  As an advertisement it falls short.  But the photo is A1 in itself.   But I must score it as a total unit.  PTL5</td>', 'Advertisement!  I love the shot.  Biggest problem - can''t read which beer is the king of beers.  In advertisement that''s very important.  Maybe zoomed in some and did away with more of the side and we could read the beer brand.  As a photo it is beautiful.  As an advertisement it falls short.  But the photo is A1 in itself.   But I must score it as a total unit.  PTL5', '2002-11-28 21:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160455, 8760, 3540, '<td valign="top">Looks more like advertising that photojournalism.  Not a bad pic really, The reflection in the sunglasses is not good.  Were he facing the sun more you could get away with it.  Without the glasses would''ve yielded a better pic just because there would be no reflecion of the flash.  - Inspzil</td>', 'Looks more like advertising that photojournalism.  Not a bad pic really, The reflection in the sunglasses is not good.  Were he facing the sun more you could get away with it.  Without the glasses would''ve yielded a better pic just because there would be no reflecion of the flash.  - Inspzil', '2002-11-29 04:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
