(160466, 8761, 4648, '<td valign="top">Interesting to say the least.  Good shot.  Nice focus.  Not too sure about the colorization.  Would have liked it in full color.  Nice title.  PTL8  But this is cool.  I like it.  This is so unique.  With 2 sons in military service I guess I''m drawn to this.  After looking quite a few times it really does deserveanother point, if only for my sons.</td>', 'Interesting to say the least.  Good shot.  Nice focus.  Not too sure about the colorization.  Would have liked it in full color.  Nice title.  PTL8  But this is cool.  I like it.  This is so unique.  With 2 sons in military service I guess I''m drawn to this.  After looking quite a few times it really does deserveanother point, if only for my sons.', '2002-11-25 22:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160467, 8761, 4514, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.  The water looks very unsettled to me.  This shot really needs to be closer.  What is your focal point. The Sub the ship or the Guy.  I am lost<br/></td>', 'Hmmm.  The water looks very unsettled to me.  This shot really needs to be closer.  What is your focal point. The Sub the ship or the Guy.  I am lost', '2002-11-26 03:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160468, 8761, 5158, '<td valign="top">Nothing I like to see in particular but definitely worth a cover-page!</td>', 'Nothing I like to see in particular but definitely worth a cover-page!', '2002-11-26 09:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160469, 8761, 5023, '<td valign="top">Wow thats cool as hell  +8</td>', 'Wow thats cool as hell  +8', '2002-11-26 21:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160470, 8761, 3306, '<td valign="top">Calm before the storm: Now or then? Nice shot. Kind of eery under the circumstances.</td>', 'Calm before the storm: Now or then? Nice shot. Kind of eery under the circumstances.', '2002-11-26 21:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160471, 8761, 2490, '<td valign="top">A very sensitive subject, and very newsworthy.  Obviously you have an inside line that many do not.  Good shot, well composed without showing too much.  Any security violation by posting this on the net? :-)  Don''t let the Homeland Security force catch you! LOL.  8 nards656</td>', 'A very sensitive subject, and very newsworthy.  Obviously you have an inside line that many do not.  Good shot, well composed without showing too much.  Any security violation by posting this on the net? :-)  Don''t let the Homeland Security force catch you! LOL.  8 nards656', '2002-11-27 20:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160472, 8761, 5212, '<td valign="top">Interesting colors, like the composition.</td>', 'Interesting colors, like the composition.', '2002-11-28 01:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160473, 8761, 543, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic, and I think the vignetting from the teleconverter actually adds something here.  A small + gamma adjustment would help to bring out the detail in the... conning tower?... on the sub, but I do like the darkish overall effect.</td>', 'Very dramatic, and I think the vignetting from the teleconverter actually adds something here.  A small + gamma adjustment would help to bring out the detail in the... conning tower?... on the sub, but I do like the darkish overall effect.', '2002-11-28 14:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160474, 8761, 2170, '<td valign="top">The overall grayish cast of this washes out the detail.  This might be better in black and white with some more contrast added in to expose more detail.  muckpond</td>', 'The overall grayish cast of this washes out the detail.  This might be better in black and white with some more contrast added in to expose more detail.  muckpond', '2002-11-30 16:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160475, 8761, 4596, '<td valign="top">I really like the shot. I really dislike the title. Shot is very clear and good composition.</td>', 'I really like the shot. I really dislike the title. Shot is very clear and good composition.', '2002-11-30 17:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160476, 8761, 656, '<td valign="top">You''ve framed this well, though you are quite far away from the subject.  As you were trying to show the US &amp; Japanese working well together, it would have been great if you''d got a clear shot of the two flags flying together. I like how you have framed this with the bouy''s across the bottom of the shot.<br/><br/>Technically, there is some strange discolouration in the upper right and left of the shot which detracts, and unless the sky actually was grey that day, it seems overexposed.   Overall the subject is a bit unclear and confused because of the many potential things in the frame to look at.  Is the point the submarine, or the ships, or the masts ?  I think if you could have gotten closer and simplified the picture a bit it might have been clearer what the subject of your picture was.  Hope that is useful.</td>', 'You''ve framed this well, though you are quite far away from the subject.  As you were trying to show the US & Japanese working well together, it would have been great if you''d got a clear shot of the two flags flying together. I like how you have framed this with the bouy''s across the bottom of the shot.Technically, there is some strange discolouration in the upper right and left of the shot which detracts, and unless the sky actually was grey that day, it seems overexposed.   Overall the subject is a bit unclear and confused because of the many potential things in the frame to look at.  Is the point the submarine, or the ships, or the masts ?  I think if you could have gotten closer and simplified the picture a bit it might have been clearer what the subject of your picture was.  Hope that is useful.', '2002-12-03 15:46:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(160477, 8762, 4267, '<td valign="top">ouch... it looks completely contrived</td>', 'ouch... it looks completely contrived', '2002-11-25 00:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160478, 8762, 4967, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but you just can''t fake a photojournalism picture... the idea was to go out and catch action not create fake action.  sorry, but I can''t give this a very high score.</td>', 'Good idea, but you just can''t fake a photojournalism picture... the idea was to go out and catch action not create fake action.  sorry, but I can''t give this a very high score.', '2002-11-25 00:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160479, 8762, 3900, '<td valign="top">Looks like you got drunk, got burgers, forgot napkins, tried to eat while driving drunk on a bumpy road, realized your peril, pulled over, got out, passed out, and this picture is when you woke up, and you''re staring at the underneath of your car trying to figure out where you are, but afraid to move. ...Score might be higher if that actually looked like a road, and that ketchup on your face actually looked like blood. -7</td>', 'Looks like you got drunk, got burgers, forgot napkins, tried to eat while driving drunk on a bumpy road, realized your peril, pulled over, got out, passed out, and this picture is when you woke up, and you''re staring at the underneath of your car trying to figure out where you are, but afraid to move. ...Score might be higher if that actually looked like a road, and that ketchup on your face actually looked like blood. -7', '2002-11-25 03:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
