(160491, 8762, 3102, '<td valign="top">A little too set up, I''m afraid... plus, even if such a picture would exist, it wouldn''t be "journalistic" so much as "evidence" since no one would ever print such a thing (unless, of course O.J. Simpson had been seen in the area beforehand... :)</td>', 'A little too set up, I''m afraid... plus, even if such a picture would exist, it wouldn''t be "journalistic" so much as "evidence" since no one would ever print such a thing (unless, of course O.J. Simpson had been seen in the area beforehand... :)', '2002-11-25 21:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
