(160495, 8762, 3932, '<td valign="top">Great idea for the shot... Is that ketchup?  The blood itself looks pretty fake.  I think some "real" fake blood (like they sell with Dracula costumes around Halloween?) would have worked really well... and maybe having some splattered on the shirt and stuff....  - 7 -   JB</td>', 'Great idea for the shot... Is that ketchup?  The blood itself looks pretty fake.  I think some "real" fake blood (like they sell with Dracula costumes around Halloween?) would have worked really well... and maybe having some splattered on the shirt and stuff....  - 7 -   JB', '2002-11-25 23:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160496, 8762, 3017, '<td valign="top">Nice effort, but you need to work on your fake blood.  More light on the tire would ''teel your story'' better.  It took me a few seconds to figure out what the silver thing was, then I realized it was a wheel and tire.<br/>Otherwise, technical aspect is good... Great DOF nice lighting on the ''body'' good focus.  Since this is a set up/created shot, it''s a stretch for me to consider it photojournalism.  I don''t blame you, though, tough subject this week!</td>', 'Nice effort, but you need to work on your fake blood.  More light on the tire would ''teel your story'' better.  It took me a few seconds to figure out what the silver thing was, then I realized it was a wheel and tire.Otherwise, technical aspect is good... Great DOF nice lighting on the ''body'' good focus.  Since this is a set up/created shot, it''s a stretch for me to consider it photojournalism.  I don''t blame you, though, tough subject this week!', '2002-11-25 23:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160497, 8762, 2978, '<td valign="top">Hmm is that tomato sauce on his face?</td>', 'Hmm is that tomato sauce on his face?', '2002-11-26 05:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160498, 8762, 772, '<td valign="top">this photo has a good ''journalistic'' quality for sure... I think a little higher angle with a little more light on the bloody face would be good too :) - Please help us enhance this site that we all enjoy by commenting on photos each week.  The photographers really appreciate it :) - setzler</td>', 'this photo has a good ''journalistic'' quality for sure... I think a little higher angle with a little more light on the bloody face would be good too :) - Please help us enhance this site that we all enjoy by commenting on photos each week.  The photographers really appreciate it :) - setzler', '2002-11-26 14:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
