(160504, 8762, 1031, '<td valign="top">If this is a set up shot, I think the ambience would be helped by having several smaller light sources (like flashlights) to give a blotchier look. It seems between too well-lit for a news photo but not well enough lit for coroner''s/evidentiary photos. High marks for topicality and overall composition.</td>', 'If this is a set up shot, I think the ambience would be helped by having several smaller light sources (like flashlights) to give a blotchier look. It seems between too well-lit for a news photo but not well enough lit for coroner''s/evidentiary photos. High marks for topicality and overall composition.', '2002-11-28 20:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160505, 8762, 714, '<td valign="top">He really ought to be careful with that catchup.  It could burn his eye.  Vote 6 Sonifo</td>', 'He really ought to be careful with that catchup.  It could burn his eye.  Vote 6 Sonifo', '2002-11-29 19:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160506, 8762, 4648, '<td valign="top">Looks too staged to be an actual scene.  Nice looking actor and nice looking photo, though.  Just can''t see this going any where in journalism, unless to advertise a play in a local theater.  I wouldn''t be drawn to read anything from this photo, and I think that''s the actual challenge, as I understand it.  I will give a 5 for a technically good photo.  PTL</td>', 'Looks too staged to be an actual scene.  Nice looking actor and nice looking photo, though.  Just can''t see this going any where in journalism, unless to advertise a play in a local theater.  I wouldn''t be drawn to read anything from this photo, and I think that''s the actual challenge, as I understand it.  I will give a 5 for a technically good photo.  PTL', '2002-11-30 00:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
