(160528, 8763, 811, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome idea, and I like how the dog is watching the glider, it seems.  If the rest of the picture had the detail as the bottom of the frame, it would simply rock.  I know in the mountains around here, it is hazy regardless of the weather conditions.  Sometimes a polarizer or neutral density filter will help eliminate some of that. karmat</td>', 'This is an awesome idea, and I like how the dog is watching the glider, it seems.  If the rest of the picture had the detail as the bottom of the frame, it would simply rock.  I know in the mountains around here, it is hazy regardless of the weather conditions.  Sometimes a polarizer or neutral density filter will help eliminate some of that. karmat', '2002-11-27 13:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160529, 8763, 4776, '<td valign="top">Great shot...the dog makes it say so much more. 8</td>', 'Great shot...the dog makes it say so much more. 8', '2002-11-27 14:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160530, 8763, 2490, '<td valign="top">Absolutely hilarious, and good job of grabbing the moment.  Smokejumper?  Hazy day hurt you a little.  Maybe this is the Smoky Mountains, but it looks more western based on the number of pines.  I think I would have bumped up the green saturation a tiny bit.  More contrast might have helped too.  I also think I would have tried a tighter crop.  6 nards656</td>', 'Absolutely hilarious, and good job of grabbing the moment.  Smokejumper?  Hazy day hurt you a little.  Maybe this is the Smoky Mountains, but it looks more western based on the number of pines.  I think I would have bumped up the green saturation a tiny bit.  More contrast might have helped too.  I also think I would have tried a tighter crop.  6 nards656', '2002-11-27 21:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160531, 8763, 3018, '<td valign="top">This is a funny picture.</td>', 'This is a funny picture.', '2002-11-28 11:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160532, 8763, 4764, '<td valign="top">Great photo...i think it might have worked better if you were closer to the dog.</td>', 'Great photo...i think it might have worked better if you were closer to the dog.', '2002-11-28 15:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160533, 8763, 1135, '<td valign="top">This Photo made me laugh and that gets you an 8. Too bad it was hazy but you still captured a great moment. rcrawford</td>', 'This Photo made me laugh and that gets you an 8. Too bad it was hazy but you still captured a great moment. rcrawford', '2002-11-28 16:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160534, 8763, 205, '<td valign="top">should have chosen a different tite.</td>', 'should have chosen a different tite.', '2002-11-28 19:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160535, 8763, 4648, '<td valign="top">Blue Ridge Mountains?  Love the dog at the bottom.  He adds so much.  I see a forest fire.  Hope you reported it too.  The haze is why they''re called the Blue Ridge, whether that''s where this picture was taken or not.  Good shot.  Great composition with good execution.  Well done.  PTL7</td>', 'Blue Ridge Mountains?  Love the dog at the bottom.  He adds so much.  I see a forest fire.  Hope you reported it too.  The haze is why they''re called the Blue Ridge, whether that''s where this picture was taken or not.  Good shot.  Great composition with good execution.  Well done.  PTL7', '2002-11-28 20:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160536, 8763, 5070, '<td valign="top">Marvellous photo.</td>', 'Marvellous photo.', '2002-11-30 20:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160537, 8763, 1280, '<td valign="top">I like this composition but the haze really detracts from the overall image.  The only thing you really could have done is use a polarizing filter. The moment is beautifully captured.  Grayce</td>', 'I like this composition but the haze really detracts from the overall image.  The only thing you really could have done is use a polarizing filter. The moment is beautifully captured.  Grayce', '2002-11-30 23:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160538, 8763, 2716, '<td valign="top">Very original.  I love it.  Jacko.  The dog makes this picture.  Jacko. 9</td>', 'Very original.  I love it.  Jacko.  The dog makes this picture.  Jacko. 9', '2002-12-01 19:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160539, 8763, 2344, '<td valign="top">I like this picture! It honestly would have lost alot of its value had that dog not been there. IMO your composition would have been a little stronger had the paraglider taken up a little bit more of the frame.. been just a little bit bigger.. if you didn''t have that haze there he''d get lost in the commotion in the background. You really want to make the subject pop out from everything else. Having said that if the person was slightly larger the haze would be a real drawback to the picture... but since he/she is so small it helps to separate him/her from the background.<br/>The only real thing that detracts a whole lot from your image is all those jpg artifacts! The sky looks really choppy because of your compression or possibly the quality of your camera.  Good compression habits can help to improve the artifacts even if your camera isn''t of the best quality... and i do believe there is a thread about that somewhere as well. Not a bad finish considering :) Good job</td>', 'I like this picture! It honestly would have lost alot of its value had that dog not been there. IMO your composition would have been a little stronger had the paraglider taken up a little bit more of the frame.. been just a little bit bigger.. if you didn''t have that haze there he''d get lost in the commotion in the background. You really want to make the subject pop out from everything else. Having said that if the person was slightly larger the haze would be a real drawback to the picture... but since he/she is so small it helps to separate him/her from the background.The only real thing that detracts a whole lot from your image is all those jpg artifacts! The sky looks really choppy because of your compression or possibly the quality of your camera.  Good compression habits can help to improve the artifacts even if your camera isn''t of the best quality... and i do believe there is a thread about that somewhere as well. Not a bad finish considering :) Good job', '2002-12-02 16:01:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(160540, 8763, 5114, '<td valign="top">Thanks! Of course I know it would be better if the paraglider were closer, but he didn''t wait for me :) Everything happened in seconds. Oh, and the ground the dog standing on is actually a slope, going down at about 45 degrees - I couldn''t possibly get closer to it.<br/><br/>Photojournalism is scary :)</td>', 'Thanks! Of course I know it would be better if the paraglider were closer, but he didn''t wait for me :) Everything happened in seconds. Oh, and the ground the dog standing on is actually a slope, going down at about 45 degrees - I couldn''t possibly get closer to it.Photojournalism is scary :)', '2002-12-03 00:29:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(160541, 8766, 4967, '<td valign="top">Excellent photojournalistic picture, don''t care for the title... wish you would have zoomed in and gotten rid of the woman on the left.  Good try!</td>', 'Excellent photojournalistic picture, don''t care for the title... wish you would have zoomed in and gotten rid of the woman on the left.  Good try!', '2002-11-25 01:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160542, 8766, 789, '<td valign="top">No.</td>', 'No.', '2002-11-25 08:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160543, 8766, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background8,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing7,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 7,<br/>Total Averaged Rating7.   Autool<br/>IMO the relationship between the title and picture are key elements in this challenge.   We probably cared last week.   Good job.<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background8,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing7,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 7,Total Averaged Rating7.   AutoolIMO the relationship between the title and picture are key elements in this challenge.   We probably cared last week.   Good job.', '2002-11-25 10:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160544, 8766, 4482, '<td valign="top">Wooooooo... I love this one! Only one little thing... I wouldn''t the man sitting in the centre. But your DOF is great ad you respect the theme. 9 kosmik</td>', 'Wooooooo... I love this one! Only one little thing... I wouldn''t the man sitting in the centre. But your DOF is great ad you respect the theme. 9 kosmik', '2002-11-25 10:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160545, 8766, 2344, '<td valign="top">Probably not.</td>', 'Probably not.', '2002-11-25 12:06:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(160546, 8766, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, good eye!! Bravo. Justine</td>', 'Nice capture, good eye!! Bravo. Justine', '2002-11-25 16:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160547, 8766, 4494, '<td valign="top">Did you plan this shot to having the people walking by like that?  Very good if you did.</td>', 'Did you plan this shot to having the people walking by like that?  Very good if you did.', '2002-11-25 17:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160548, 8766, 2553, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a shot.  Carries a lot of emotion.  Definitely meets the challenge.  Is this desaturated? If so, it works very well.  I like your composition, with the older man seeming to look at the guy on the bench and the woman looking like she is getting by him as quickly as possible without having to actually see him.  Very nice work.  lhall</td>', 'Wow, what a shot.  Carries a lot of emotion.  Definitely meets the challenge.  Is this desaturated? If so, it works very well.  I like your composition, with the older man seeming to look at the guy on the bench and the woman looking like she is getting by him as quickly as possible without having to actually see him.  Very nice work.  lhall', '2002-11-25 19:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160549, 8766, 4514, '<td valign="top">I do not think this guy is homeless.</td>', 'I do not think this guy is homeless.', '2002-11-26 04:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160550, 8766, 5158, '<td valign="top">Well captured situation! Like how the motion of passengers is captured!<br/>Thumb up!</td>', 'Well captured situation! Like how the motion of passengers is captured!Thumb up!', '2002-11-26 09:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160551, 8766, 4906, '<td valign="top">Would have preferred this close on the subject or without woman in foreground. Good picture though.</td>', 'Would have preferred this close on the subject or without woman in foreground. Good picture though.', '2002-11-26 09:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160552, 8766, 3102, '<td valign="top">Overall very well done!  I like the way people are ignoring him as they walk by.  Seems like it could use a teeny bit more contrast, though. - 8</td>', 'Overall very well done!  I like the way people are ignoring him as they walk by.  Seems like it could use a teeny bit more contrast, though. - 8', '2002-11-26 15:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160553, 8766, 472, '<td valign="top">yup. a sad commentary. and look - you got archie bunker walking past in the back!</td>', 'yup. a sad commentary. and look - you got archie bunker walking past in the back!', '2002-11-26 17:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160554, 8766, 2337, '<td valign="top">Well told story!  Great shot!  The blur on the woman in the foreground really adds to the story!  She wants to make tracks away from the gentleman on the bench and you showed that exceptionally well... ~ Myqyl ~</td>', 'Well told story!  Great shot!  The blur on the woman in the foreground really adds to the story!  She wants to make tracks away from the gentleman on the bench and you showed that exceptionally well... ~ Myqyl ~', '2002-11-26 21:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160555, 8766, 527, '<td valign="top">Should I be looking at the woman or the guy on the bench? They are competing visually. It is a pretty intersting photo still.<br/><br/>T</td>', 'Should I be looking at the woman or the guy on the bench? They are competing visually. It is a pretty intersting photo still.T', '2002-11-27 02:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160556, 8766, 772, '<td valign="top">veyr nice shot... i like the choice of black and white on this one... - setzler</td>', 'veyr nice shot... i like the choice of black and white on this one... - setzler', '2002-11-27 12:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160557, 8766, 2490, '<td valign="top">Great job, great title, great message.  My first 10 this week.  The people in motion really make this shot happen.  10 nards656</td>', 'Great job, great title, great message.  My first 10 this week.  The people in motion really make this shot happen.  10 nards656', '2002-11-27 12:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160558, 8766, 5347, '<td valign="top">Hey, is that Archie?</td>', 'Hey, is that Archie?', '2002-11-27 23:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160559, 8766, 3273, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  I like the fact that the woman in the foreground is blurred, it conveys her lack of care even more, perhaps it''s a little too tightly cropped to the bottom of her feet.  Nice tones and clarity.</td>', 'Nice composition.  I like the fact that the woman in the foreground is blurred, it conveys her lack of care even more, perhaps it''s a little too tightly cropped to the bottom of her feet.  Nice tones and clarity.', '2002-11-28 03:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160560, 8766, 4049, '<td valign="top">Apparently not.</td>', 'Apparently not.', '2002-11-28 23:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160561, 8766, 5121, '<td valign="top">Todays world!  Good shot.</td>', 'Todays world!  Good shot.', '2002-11-30 14:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160562, 8766, 4596, '<td valign="top">Good subject.</td>', 'Good subject.', '2002-11-30 17:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160563, 8766, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very good concept and execution.  I like that you captured the woman in motion, walking away.  Also the slightly curious man  looking on.  Grayce</td>', 'Very good concept and execution.  I like that you captured the woman in motion, walking away.  Also the slightly curious man  looking on.  Grayce', '2002-12-01 00:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160564, 8766, 5455, '<td valign="top">about what?</td>', 'about what?', '2002-12-01 18:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160565, 8767, 3540, '<td valign="top">Santa needs about a 500W spotlight on him so we can tell it''s Santa.  I don''t think I could figure that out if not for the title.  I wouldn''t put this on the front page anyway.  I think if he found out you did this, you''d be getting coal in your stocking for the rest of your life.  Santa needs to be way more lit up.  A spotlight I think would definitely make it look like he''s in trouble with the law more too.  - Inspzil</td>', 'Santa needs about a 500W spotlight on him so we can tell it''s Santa.  I don''t think I could figure that out if not for the title.  I wouldn''t put this on the front page anyway.  I think if he found out you did this, you''d be getting coal in your stocking for the rest of your life.  Santa needs to be way more lit up.  A spotlight I think would definitely make it look like he''s in trouble with the law more too.  - Inspzil', '2002-11-25 04:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160566, 8767, 4615, '<td valign="top">a bit dark.  not enough conrtast to work in a newspaper.</td>', 'a bit dark.  not enough conrtast to work in a newspaper.', '2002-11-25 08:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160567, 8767, 4821, '<td valign="top">A little dark.</td>', 'A little dark.', '2002-11-25 12:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
