(160574, 8767, 3317, '<td valign="top">how could that bag possibly be big enough to hold my pony? man if santa doesn''t come through this year finally i am really gonna lose it. like that the lighting''s dark so it does look somber and a little criminal, even with the familiar jolly red suit.</td>', 'how could that bag possibly be big enough to hold my pony? man if santa doesn''t come through this year finally i am really gonna lose it. like that the lighting''s dark so it does look somber and a little criminal, even with the familiar jolly red suit.', '2002-11-27 21:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160575, 8767, 543, '<td valign="top">Cute.  Better with the subject less centered and with a slightly longer exposure.</td>', 'Cute.  Better with the subject less centered and with a slightly longer exposure.', '2002-11-28 13:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160576, 8767, 2170, '<td valign="top">This photo is very dark.  The subject blends into the background.  Otherwise, it''s a fun photograph taken from a great angle.  It really makes you wonder what the heck is going on.  However, I don''t know how well that fits into a photojournalism challenge, as those images are supposed to help illustrate what is going on.  muckpond</td>', 'This photo is very dark.  The subject blends into the background.  Otherwise, it''s a fun photograph taken from a great angle.  It really makes you wonder what the heck is going on.  However, I don''t know how well that fits into a photojournalism challenge, as those images are supposed to help illustrate what is going on.  muckpond', '2002-11-30 15:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160577, 8767, 4596, '<td valign="top">Ok... good shot. I hope it wasn''t just staged for this.</td>', 'Ok... good shot. I hope it wasn''t just staged for this.', '2002-11-30 17:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160578, 8767, 4648, '<td valign="top">Real cute composition, but needs a little better execution.  A little too dark.  Cropped a little closely on side.  I know the 1/3 rule but I think it would have been better to have been a little wider, or cropped a little tighter on the top and bottom.  Believe that would  draw your eyes more to Santa, even as dark as it is.  Good clean focus.  PTL6</td>', 'Real cute composition, but needs a little better execution.  A little too dark.  Cropped a little closely on side.  I know the 1/3 rule but I think it would have been better to have been a little wider, or cropped a little tighter on the top and bottom.  Believe that would  draw your eyes more to Santa, even as dark as it is.  Good clean focus.  PTL6', '2002-11-30 20:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160579, 8767, 656, '<td valign="top">Critique Club :  A funny and interesting subject.  You have the subject very centered in the frame, which leads to a fairly ''static'' look - as he is climbing up/ down it might look better to have framed it slightly off center, probably in the upper right, and leave some space to ''climb into''  this would have also let you remove the two decorations? that are blurred out on the left hand side and distracting.<br/><br/>Exposure seems quite dark wihch works to give the feeling of night time.  Mainly I think re-framing with an off-centered subject would make this have a much more dynamic feel to it and make it a stronger picture.  Hope that is useful.</td>', 'Critique Club :  A funny and interesting subject.  You have the subject very centered in the frame, which leads to a fairly ''static'' look - as he is climbing up/ down it might look better to have framed it slightly off center, probably in the upper right, and leave some space to ''climb into''  this would have also let you remove the two decorations? that are blurred out on the left hand side and distracting.Exposure seems quite dark wihch works to give the feeling of night time.  Mainly I think re-framing with an off-centered subject would make this have a much more dynamic feel to it and make it a stronger picture.  Hope that is useful.', '2002-12-03 15:49:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(160580, 8768, 4967, '<td valign="top">CUTE!</td>', 'CUTE!', '2002-11-25 01:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160581, 8768, 3032, '<td valign="top">LOL! :-)<br/>Nice colors, sharp.</td>', 'LOL! :-)Nice colors, sharp.', '2002-11-25 05:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160582, 8768, 4648, '<td valign="top">Great job.  Oh so cute.  I really like.  Great execution.  Good colors.  Perfect focus all the way around.  Nice crop.  PTL9</td>', 'Great job.  Oh so cute.  I really like.  Great execution.  Good colors.  Perfect focus all the way around.  Nice crop.  PTL9', '2002-11-25 09:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160583, 8768, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background6,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing6,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 6,<br/>Total Averaged Rating6.   Autool<br/>IMO the relationship between the title and picture are key elements in this challenge.  A stretch of the imagination for the challenge but cute.<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background6,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing6,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 6,Total Averaged Rating6.   AutoolIMO the relationship between the title and picture are key elements in this challenge.  A stretch of the imagination for the challenge but cute.', '2002-11-25 10:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
