(160605, 8769, 4411, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t really give me the impression of devastation I would expect from a bush fire - I think it''s because of the greens in the background. Having said that I have never seen the aftermath of a bush fire.<br/></td>', 'This doesn''t really give me the impression of devastation I would expect from a bush fire - I think it''s because of the greens in the background. Having said that I have never seen the aftermath of a bush fire.', '2002-11-25 13:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160606, 8769, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice find and right on topic. I think the levels could of used a bit of adjustment and the perspective. Still I like your thinking. Justine</td>', 'Nice find and right on topic. I think the levels could of used a bit of adjustment and the perspective. Still I like your thinking. Justine', '2002-11-25 14:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160607, 8769, 4648, '<td valign="top">Real nice picture.  Still smoldering adds to it.  You must be the first reporter on the scene.  Any houses destroyed or anyone hurt in the fire?  I''ll read the story to find out.  Great picture.  Good composition and real good execution.  Nice focus, good contrast in colors.  May a little more sky, if possible.  Good shot.  PTL7</td>', 'Real nice picture.  Still smoldering adds to it.  You must be the first reporter on the scene.  Any houses destroyed or anyone hurt in the fire?  I''ll read the story to find out.  Great picture.  Good composition and real good execution.  Nice focus, good contrast in colors.  May a little more sky, if possible.  Good shot.  PTL7', '2002-11-27 00:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160608, 8769, 5364, '<td valign="top">it might have had a little more impact as a journalism subject with a bit less of the surviving greenery visible</td>', 'it might have had a little more impact as a journalism subject with a bit less of the surviving greenery visible', '2002-11-27 12:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160609, 8769, 2490, '<td valign="top">Seems overexposed slightly.  I understand you wanted to use the light well, but the highlights are just too strong, and the greens need a bit more saturation.  5 nards656</td>', 'Seems overexposed slightly.  I understand you wanted to use the light well, but the highlights are just too strong, and the greens need a bit more saturation.  5 nards656', '2002-11-27 12:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
