(160645, 8771, 1792, '<td valign="top">A little closer crop might help this.</td>', 'A little closer crop might help this.', '2002-11-26 11:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160646, 8771, 811, '<td valign="top">The focus being off makes this picture a little less effective than it could be, I think.  It looks like it is a bright day there, plenty of light, so could you ahve used a faster shutter speed at all? karmat</td>', 'The focus being off makes this picture a little less effective than it could be, I think.  It looks like it is a bright day there, plenty of light, so could you ahve used a faster shutter speed at all? karmat', '2002-11-26 14:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
