(160652, 8771, 2, '<td valign="top">The action in this shot is great, but I''m having a tough time figuring out what''s going on.  There''s a lot of stuff in focus, and it''s tough to isolate the action.  Obviously, a slightly faster shutter speed would have been ideal.</td>', 'The action in this shot is great, but I''m having a tough time figuring out what''s going on.  There''s a lot of stuff in focus, and it''s tough to isolate the action.  Obviously, a slightly faster shutter speed would have been ideal.', '2002-12-01 23:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
