(160655, 8772, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background6,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing6,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 6,<br/>Total Averaged Rating6.   Autool<br/>IMO the relationship between the title and picture are key elements in this challenge.   Even the girl in foreground seems to be out of focus or not fully exposed.   Could be low light of winter but I think better light would have helped you out here.<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background6,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing6,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 6,Total Averaged Rating6.   AutoolIMO the relationship between the title and picture are key elements in this challenge.   Even the girl in foreground seems to be out of focus or not fully exposed.   Could be low light of winter but I think better light would have helped you out here.', '2002-11-25 10:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
