(160658, 8772, 327, '<td valign="top">Okay I could see a title of....''Scoccer Mom on the bench''....or "Girls don''t play" ..I get it and the shot is nice. I would only of suggested some levels adjustment. It''s a bit too dark, but it''s a nice action shot. Justine</td>', 'Okay I could see a title of....''Scoccer Mom on the bench''....or "Girls don''t play" ..I get it and the shot is nice. I would only of suggested some levels adjustment. It''s a bit too dark, but it''s a nice action shot. Justine', '2002-11-25 14:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
