(160663, 8772, 4648, '<td valign="top">I realize your title makes her the subject but it also talks of the game.  I believe the game needs to be in better focus, with the building out of focus.  She is in sharp focus.  The composition is good, but needs better execution.  Good subject and nice crop job.  Clear up the game and you got a good one.  PTL5</td>', 'I realize your title makes her the subject but it also talks of the game.  I believe the game needs to be in better focus, with the building out of focus.  She is in sharp focus.  The composition is good, but needs better execution.  Good subject and nice crop job.  Clear up the game and you got a good one.  PTL5', '2002-11-26 20:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160664, 8772, 3023, '<td valign="top">I have the feeling this is the playground of my old school... :)   Nevertheless a nice shot. Although the girl in the foreground blends a bit in with the rest!</td>', 'I have the feeling this is the playground of my old school... :)   Nevertheless a nice shot. Although the girl in the foreground blends a bit in with the rest!', '2002-11-27 11:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
