(160669, 8772, 806, '<td valign="top">This is really quite nice. I wonder if it should be a bit brighter... dunno... maybe not.. I think it is framed nicely, and the focus on the watching chile tells the story from her perspective. Nice candid/photojournalism.</td>', 'This is really quite nice. I wonder if it should be a bit brighter... dunno... maybe not.. I think it is framed nicely, and the focus on the watching chile tells the story from her perspective. Nice candid/photojournalism.', '2002-12-01 22:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
