(160671, 8772, 1019, '<td valign="top">I rated this quite high when I first saw it because I felt you captured the separation between the spectator and the game.<br/><br/>Your picture is well composed with the main subject off to one side leaving plenty of room for the game. You show quite clearly that the girl is the focus of the picture by having her in focus and the game out of focusthis is a clear indication of the great divide and alienation between the girl and the game. The grey atmosphere and subdued colouring emphasise the loneliness of the girl sitting alone on the wall slumped.<br/><br/>The camera work is good and your digital processing is good.<br/><br/>You have taken a difficult subject that is very hard to express and you have captured it. <br/><br/>Andrewm<br/>Critique Club</td>', 'I rated this quite high when I first saw it because I felt you captured the separation between the spectator and the game.Your picture is well composed with the main subject off to one side leaving plenty of room for the game. You show quite clearly that the girl is the focus of the picture by having her in focus and the game out of focusthis is a clear indication of the great divide and alienation between the girl and the game. The grey atmosphere and subdued colouring emphasise the loneliness of the girl sitting alone on the wall slumped.The camera work is good and your digital processing is good.You have taken a difficult subject that is very hard to express and you have captured it. AndrewmCritique Club', '2002-12-02 14:01:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(160672, 8773, 3936, '<td valign="top">Very nice pic.  Tells a great story.  I could see this as a pic in a investigative pice.</td>', 'Very nice pic.  Tells a great story.  I could see this as a pic in a investigative pice.', '2002-11-25 01:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
