(160678, 8773, 3447, '<td valign="top">As a 17 year old I worked in a damn sight worse conditions, for lower wages, and longer hours.  This is honest work and I doubt that this young man is whining about his lot in life.  He is looking forward to even better things, and is happy to have gainful employment.  A 6 for the photograph.<br/>Zero for the title.     6      JEM</td>', 'As a 17 year old I worked in a damn sight worse conditions, for lower wages, and longer hours.  This is honest work and I doubt that this young man is whining about his lot in life.  He is looking forward to even better things, and is happy to have gainful employment.  A 6 for the photograph.Zero for the title.     6      JEM', '2002-11-25 21:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160679, 8773, 3540, '<td valign="top">Low wages, long hours, bad conditions?  I think I work here!!  Newsworthy? Nope, not this time - Inspzil</td>', 'Low wages, long hours, bad conditions?  I think I work here!!  Newsworthy? Nope, not this time - Inspzil', '2002-11-25 23:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
