(160685, 8773, 4648, '<td valign="top">Great subject matter, and composition with good execution.  Wonderful colors, good focus.  I want to read to see how much he gets paid and what he makes.  Looks like an interesting story.  It''s a great photo.  Good techs.  PTL9</td>', 'Great subject matter, and composition with good execution.  Wonderful colors, good focus.  I want to read to see how much he gets paid and what he makes.  Looks like an interesting story.  It''s a great photo.  Good techs.  PTL9', '2002-11-27 23:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160686, 8773, 543, '<td valign="top">Conditions don''t look so bad, but I bet you''re right about the other two.  Very nice environmental portrait with good colors and just enough background to set the scene (Bangkok?).</td>', 'Conditions don''t look so bad, but I bet you''re right about the other two.  Very nice environmental portrait with good colors and just enough background to set the scene (Bangkok?).', '2002-11-28 13:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
