(160739, 8777, 2490, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if you are PJing dog shelters, pit bulls, or junky old trucks :-).  There is a point, I''m sure.  I would have turned down the highlights some and tried to park the truck facing shadows to eliminate the confusing stuff I see through the windshield.  5 nards656</td>', 'I''m not sure if you are PJing dog shelters, pit bulls, or junky old trucks :-).  There is a point, I''m sure.  I would have turned down the highlights some and tried to park the truck facing shadows to eliminate the confusing stuff I see through the windshield.  5 nards656', '2002-11-27 12:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
