(160752, 8778, 3018, '<td valign="top">Ha! Funny! Nice illusion.</td>', 'Ha! Funny! Nice illusion.', '2002-11-28 11:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160753, 8778, 4648, '<td valign="top">So much in the news lately.  All over the front pages.  I love the shadows in the photo.  I personally think they add to it.  Shot just a little dark, but otherwise good and news worthy.  PTL8</td>', 'So much in the news lately.  All over the front pages.  I love the shadows in the photo.  I personally think they add to it.  Shot just a little dark, but otherwise good and news worthy.  PTL8', '2002-11-28 20:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160754, 8778, 2, '<td valign="top">This image didn''t really strike me at first, but right before I clicked my vote it really hit me.  The contrast of space and color here is really outstanding, and even with such a narrow window of composition, it tells the entire story.  Great job getting into the shoes of a photojournalist.</td>', 'This image didn''t really strike me at first, but right before I clicked my vote it really hit me.  The contrast of space and color here is really outstanding, and even with such a narrow window of composition, it tells the entire story.  Great job getting into the shoes of a photojournalist.', '2002-12-01 23:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
