(160763, 8779, 4162, '<td valign="top">Thats a great shot, I think that the focus isnt quite sharp enough though.  The picture draws you in and the line of planes leads you to the edge of the shot, a plane just taking off would be good to give the sky a bit more interest.  Natasha</td>', 'Thats a great shot, I think that the focus isnt quite sharp enough though.  The picture draws you in and the line of planes leads you to the edge of the shot, a plane just taking off would be good to give the sky a bit more interest.  Natasha', '2002-11-25 21:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
