(160767, 8779, 3459, '<td valign="top">Great compositiion, very well aligned, and some of us (frequent flyers) can relate.  Hope it did not take too much time to explain to the authorities why you were taking pictures.<br/>Good luck.</td>', 'Great compositiion, very well aligned, and some of us (frequent flyers) can relate.  Hope it did not take too much time to explain to the authorities why you were taking pictures.Good luck.', '2002-11-27 13:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
