(160819, 8784, 1280, '<td valign="top">Great coverage, a real live event, and even got a plug in for the website.  It really is too bad a head got partially cut off.  If you''d have tilted slightly upward it would have been avoided.   Definetly a newsworthy event. Good luck in the challenge.  Grayce aka Gracious</td>', 'Great coverage, a real live event, and even got a plug in for the website.  It really is too bad a head got partially cut off.  If you''d have tilted slightly upward it would have been avoided.   Definetly a newsworthy event. Good luck in the challenge.  Grayce aka Gracious', '2002-11-29 00:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160820, 8784, 4596, '<td valign="top">OK, but nothing special here.</td>', 'OK, but nothing special here.', '2002-11-30 16:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
