(160882, 8786, 3279, '<td valign="top">I do like this, but to me it''s a touch underexposed. The visor on the hat throws a shadow over his eyes that''s just too deep, so we''re left with half an eye. I either want to see his eye properly, or not at all. Hard to explain...</td>', 'I do like this, but to me it''s a touch underexposed. The visor on the hat throws a shadow over his eyes that''s just too deep, so we''re left with half an eye. I either want to see his eye properly, or not at all. Hard to explain...', '2002-12-01 16:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160883, 8786, 3380, '<td valign="top">Having been a Marine myself, this is a very familiar look. Good comosition. Having one eye out of frame and the other slightly concealed was a good touch.</td>', 'Having been a Marine myself, this is a very familiar look. Good comosition. Having one eye out of frame and the other slightly concealed was a good touch.', '2002-12-01 18:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
