(160885, 8786, 4514, '<td valign="top">Well everyone.  Thank you for the votes.  I really appreciated them.  I guess since the model in the picture was me,  I did a darn good job of getting tenth.  Hard to take a picture when you are in front of the Camera and there is no one to press the shutter.  That is why the eye came out so dark.    I was satisfied with the picture.  :-)<br/>TurboTech</td>', 'Well everyone.  Thank you for the votes.  I really appreciated them.  I guess since the model in the picture was me,  I did a darn good job of getting tenth.  Hard to take a picture when you are in front of the Camera and there is no one to press the shutter.  That is why the eye came out so dark.    I was satisfied with the picture.  :-)TurboTech', '2002-12-02 00:19:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(160886, 8786, 2344, '<td valign="top">That is a very nice example of low key photography.  The only thing that would improve it is a little more detail over on the left. Very nice job! Congrats!</td>', 'That is a very nice example of low key photography.  The only thing that would improve it is a little more detail over on the left. Very nice job! Congrats!', '2002-12-02 07:20:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(160887, 8787, 3936, '<td valign="top">A bit grainy, and possibly over sharpened.  (The smoke looks like a sharpening routine has been run.  Legal but blotchy results.)  Are these guys on strike?  Seeking donations?  You are on the right track to a really good pic.  Just needs a little more.  6.</td>', 'A bit grainy, and possibly over sharpened.  (The smoke looks like a sharpening routine has been run.  Legal but blotchy results.)  Are these guys on strike?  Seeking donations?  You are on the right track to a really good pic.  Just needs a little more.  6.', '2002-11-25 01:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160888, 8787, 4967, '<td valign="top">Good idea... I would have tried zooming in.  Good try!</td>', 'Good idea... I would have tried zooming in.  Good try!', '2002-11-25 01:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160889, 8787, 3540, '<td valign="top">Nice picture.  I like the framing on this shot.  The focus is a little soft but I don''t think it hurts the shot much, if any.  It''s a very nice candid shot of these brave fellows who deserve a little face time. - Inspzil</td>', 'Nice picture.  I like the framing on this shot.  The focus is a little soft but I don''t think it hurts the shot much, if any.  It''s a very nice candid shot of these brave fellows who deserve a little face time. - Inspzil', '2002-11-25 04:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
