(160908, 8787, 4648, '<td valign="top">Maybe closer up with a wide angle lens we could see more of their expressions and the fire better.  Also could have used an angle shot from on the side of the men and gotten a better composition, or more enticing one.  But still not that bad of a photo, especially technically.  As is there''s no "wow'' or real attention grabber.  Sorry, just my opinion.  PTL5</td>', 'Maybe closer up with a wide angle lens we could see more of their expressions and the fire better.  Also could have used an angle shot from on the side of the men and gotten a better composition, or more enticing one.  But still not that bad of a photo, especially technically.  As is there''s no "wow'' or real attention grabber.  Sorry, just my opinion.  PTL5', '2002-12-01 14:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
