(160921, 8789, 2490, '<td valign="top">Good PJ, and good job of making the guy unrecognizable.  I suspect this was taken with a lower end cam, just because of the way the pixels look.  I hate to be cruel, but I have to be fair, because I am voting largely on quality this week.  I''m seeing good photographer skill, but you either have a low end camera or your technique needs a little encouragement.  4 nards656</td>', 'Good PJ, and good job of making the guy unrecognizable.  I suspect this was taken with a lower end cam, just because of the way the pixels look.  I hate to be cruel, but I have to be fair, because I am voting largely on quality this week.  I''m seeing good photographer skill, but you either have a low end camera or your technique needs a little encouragement.  4 nards656', '2002-11-27 21:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
