(160941, 8791, 3900, '<td valign="top">WOW,  this is just incredibly BAD!  There are enough jokers...don''t need any more here.  Please try to be at least a little bit serious.  At least you complete my 1-10 curve for the week, and you got my only 1.  Congrats!!</td>', 'WOW,  this is just incredibly BAD!  There are enough jokers...don''t need any more here.  Please try to be at least a little bit serious.  At least you complete my 1-10 curve for the week, and you got my only 1.  Congrats!!', '2002-11-27 05:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
