(160943, 8791, 2302, '<td valign="top">I like the positioning of what I can see in this photo but the rest of the shot is much too dark for my taste.</td>', 'I like the positioning of what I can see in this photo but the rest of the shot is much too dark for my taste.', '2002-11-27 14:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160944, 8791, 2490, '<td valign="top">I must confess I have a hard time getting the message of the picture.  Even though I am primarily voting only quality, the fact that I can''t get the message entirely skews my voting a little.  I can''t attach any significance to the date.  Is that where I''m missing it?  Not trying to be harsh.  Sorry. 5 nards656</td>', 'I must confess I have a hard time getting the message of the picture.  Even though I am primarily voting only quality, the fact that I can''t get the message entirely skews my voting a little.  I can''t attach any significance to the date.  Is that where I''m missing it?  Not trying to be harsh.  Sorry. 5 nards656', '2002-11-27 21:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160945, 8791, 3273, '<td valign="top">I''m not quite sure how this fits in the challenge.  The clock is also far too small in the centre of the frame, it should be much larger if it''s the only thing in the photo.</td>', 'I''m not quite sure how this fits in the challenge.  The clock is also far too small in the centre of the frame, it should be much larger if it''s the only thing in the photo.', '2002-11-28 04:01:00.000000', NULL, 1);
