(160950, 8791, 5455, '<td valign="top">huh?</td>', 'huh?', '2002-12-01 18:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160951, 8791, 3380, '<td valign="top">Very challenging capture. However the image as a whole is blured. I really don''t see how this meets the challenge of photojournalism. I couldn''t see this image printed on the front cover or on any other pages.</td>', 'Very challenging capture. However the image as a whole is blured. I really don''t see how this meets the challenge of photojournalism. I couldn''t see this image printed on the front cover or on any other pages.', '2002-12-01 18:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160952, 8792, 221, '<td valign="top">Very intertesting lighting that shows a good mood</td>', 'Very intertesting lighting that shows a good mood', '2002-11-25 01:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160953, 8792, 4821, '<td valign="top">creepy and crooked</td>', 'creepy and crooked', '2002-11-25 13:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160954, 8792, 327, '<td valign="top">In my next life I''m going to get long legs!! Is that real hair? Interesting shot......I do like it, maybe a bit over exposed ....but this works. Neat. Justine</td>', 'In my next life I''m going to get long legs!! Is that real hair? Interesting shot......I do like it, maybe a bit over exposed ....but this works. Neat. Justine', '2002-11-25 16:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160955, 8792, 4494, '<td valign="top">Should have titled it.  Headline pics need titles. :)</td>', 'Should have titled it.  Headline pics need titles. :)', '2002-11-25 17:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160956, 8792, 472, '<td valign="top">was this at a party ? it is interesting .. : )</td>', 'was this at a party ? it is interesting .. : )', '2002-11-25 17:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160957, 8792, 3102, '<td valign="top">A title may have helped explain the journalism behind this one.</td>', 'A title may have helped explain the journalism behind this one.', '2002-11-26 12:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160958, 8792, 4615, '<td valign="top">Why untitled?  I can think of so many.  How about "attack of the fake hair women!!"</td>', 'Why untitled?  I can think of so many.  How about "attack of the fake hair women!!"', '2002-11-26 18:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160959, 8792, 2337, '<td valign="top">Powerful... ~ MyQyl ~</td>', 'Powerful... ~ MyQyl ~', '2002-11-26 22:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160960, 8792, 640, '<td valign="top">What''s that white spot to the right of her hair? This photo tells a story.</td>', 'What''s that white spot to the right of her hair? This photo tells a story.', '2002-11-27 01:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160961, 8792, 4514, '<td valign="top">Untitled and not a cover story.</td>', 'Untitled and not a cover story.', '2002-11-27 02:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160962, 8792, 2170, '<td valign="top">Crisp and clear and definitely tells a story.  The lighting is pretty brilliant -- makes her hair (please tell me that''s a wig) and her pants look like they are glowing in the dark.  There''s also a slight bounce off of the lens, unfortunately.  Great idea...good setup.  muckpond</td>', 'Crisp and clear and definitely tells a story.  The lighting is pretty brilliant -- makes her hair (please tell me that''s a wig) and her pants look like they are glowing in the dark.  There''s also a slight bounce off of the lens, unfortunately.  Great idea...good setup.  muckpond', '2002-11-27 09:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160963, 8792, 2490, '<td valign="top">I suspect this lady has a special job description, but I don''t want to accidentally be insulting, especially if this is staged.  This looks like a cheap hotel.  I think a good title would have made a world of difference.  6 nards656</td>', 'I suspect this lady has a special job description, but I don''t want to accidentally be insulting, especially if this is staged.  This looks like a cheap hotel.  I think a good title would have made a world of difference.  6 nards656', '2002-11-27 12:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160964, 8792, 3459, '<td valign="top">In my opinion this is more a fine art photograph, rather than PJ.  On that note, it is a beautifully composed image, where the choice of B&amp;W was perfect.</td>', 'In my opinion this is more a fine art photograph, rather than PJ.  On that note, it is a beautifully composed image, where the choice of B&W was perfect.', '2002-11-27 13:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160965, 8792, 2158, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure "Untitled" works for this category.  What makes this photo fit into a journalistic context?</td>', 'I''m not sure "Untitled" works for this category.  What makes this photo fit into a journalistic context?', '2002-11-27 18:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160966, 8792, 3447, '<td valign="top">Hope you have a tough bodyguard for picture taking in this area.     JEM</td>', 'Hope you have a tough bodyguard for picture taking in this area.     JEM', '2002-11-28 13:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160967, 8792, 5158, '<td valign="top">Have no idea in what magazine under what title to put it (maybe that''s why it''s untitled) but it is awesome, extreme and well done. Like the overexposed parts of the girl as well as the man in the shadow. 10</td>', 'Have no idea in what magazine under what title to put it (maybe that''s why it''s untitled) but it is awesome, extreme and well done. Like the overexposed parts of the girl as well as the man in the shadow. 10', '2002-11-28 17:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160968, 8792, 2752, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t need a title</td>', 'Doesn''t need a title', '2002-11-30 16:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160969, 8792, 4596, '<td valign="top">Is there a statement here? Bit of tension needed?</td>', 'Is there a statement here? Bit of tension needed?', '2002-11-30 16:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160970, 8793, 3280, '<td valign="top">Good idea, I would love to see more people and less cars though.  DPz</td>', 'Good idea, I would love to see more people and less cars though.  DPz', '2002-11-25 00:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160971, 8793, 221, '<td valign="top">Robert Capa once said "If you photos arent good enough, your not close enough"</td>', 'Robert Capa once said "If you photos arent good enough, your not close enough"', '2002-11-25 02:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160972, 8793, 51167, '<td valign="top">good movie.  Wish you could have gotten more of the long lines of the sold out shows.</td>', 'good movie.  Wish you could have gotten more of the long lines of the sold out shows.', '2002-11-25 02:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160973, 8793, 3746, '<td valign="top">the car is far too distracting, as is the person looking at the camera (these things probably couldn''t of been helped), but the picture would of had a lot more impact had there been a big queue of people outside the theatre.. doesnt really work that well.. sorry   4  marksimms</td>', 'the car is far too distracting, as is the person looking at the camera (these things probably couldn''t of been helped), but the picture would of had a lot more impact had there been a big queue of people outside the theatre.. doesnt really work that well.. sorry   4  marksimms', '2002-11-25 08:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160974, 8793, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background6,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing6,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 7,<br/>Total Averaged Rating6.   Autool<br/>IMO the relationship between the title and picture are key elements in this challenge.<br/><br/>IMO the relationship between the title and picture are key elements in this challenge.   Sure would have been nice to have a line of moviegoers stretched around the corner.<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background6,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing6,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 7,Total Averaged Rating6.   AutoolIMO the relationship between the title and picture are key elements in this challenge.IMO the relationship between the title and picture are key elements in this challenge.   Sure would have been nice to have a line of moviegoers stretched around the corner.', '2002-11-25 09:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160975, 8793, 640, '<td valign="top">Good concept but the photo is too busy with no main focus point.</td>', 'Good concept but the photo is too busy with no main focus point.', '2002-11-25 09:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160976, 8793, 3127, '<td valign="top">The photo is a little too busy. It''s hard to focus on the real subject.</td>', 'The photo is a little too busy. It''s hard to focus on the real subject.', '2002-11-25 11:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160977, 8793, 3859, '<td valign="top">With headlines that say Movie of the Year, I think there is too much car in the photo.</td>', 'With headlines that say Movie of the Year, I think there is too much car in the photo.', '2002-11-25 11:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160978, 8793, 327, '<td valign="top">Hey fun idea. Good shooting, good thinking!! Justine</td>', 'Hey fun idea. Good shooting, good thinking!! Justine', '2002-11-25 16:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160979, 8793, 5378, '<td valign="top">Notice the cars more than the movie name.  Not much of a line for the movie of the year.</td>', 'Notice the cars more than the movie name.  Not much of a line for the movie of the year.', '2002-11-25 17:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160980, 8793, 3102, '<td valign="top">A few too many distractions (cars, for example) to be effective.  I may have tried getting almost underneath the sign and included it and the people in line.</td>', 'A few too many distractions (cars, for example) to be effective.  I may have tried getting almost underneath the sign and included it and the people in line.', '2002-11-26 13:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160981, 8793, 2792, '<td valign="top">Too bad there wasn''t a bigger line!  =D  Good photo.</td>', 'Too bad there wasn''t a bigger line!  =D  Good photo.', '2002-11-26 13:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160982, 8793, 811, '<td valign="top">In my opinion, there is simply too much "stuff" in this picture for it to convey what I think you wanted it to.  If your town is like mine, it may have been the only movie marquee available, but if not, I think it would have been worth it to find another one, that didn''t have so much "busy" stuff around it.  karmat</td>', 'In my opinion, there is simply too much "stuff" in this picture for it to convey what I think you wanted it to.  If your town is like mine, it may have been the only movie marquee available, but if not, I think it would have been worth it to find another one, that didn''t have so much "busy" stuff around it.  karmat', '2002-11-26 14:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160983, 8793, 2337, '<td valign="top">The top half of this shot doesn''t really add much.  Maybe a closer shot with excited moviegoers in line would have worked better.  A trick I learned is that a few people can look like a large crowd if you stand close to them... The empty part of the sidewalk doesn''t tell your story, so why have it?  Move up to the folks on line and shoot them gathered around the counter getting tickets :)  ~ MyQyl ~</td>', 'The top half of this shot doesn''t really add much.  Maybe a closer shot with excited moviegoers in line would have worked better.  A trick I learned is that a few people can look like a large crowd if you stand close to them... The empty part of the sidewalk doesn''t tell your story, so why have it?  Move up to the folks on line and shoot them gathered around the counter getting tickets :)  ~ MyQyl ~', '2002-11-26 21:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160984, 8793, 4514, '<td valign="top">Oh Cute.  Movie of the year.  A little closer would be nice.</td>', 'Oh Cute.  Movie of the year.  A little closer would be nice.', '2002-11-27 05:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160985, 8793, 4776, '<td valign="top">Good concept, but the cars are distracting and the crowd is small for the movie of the year.</td>', 'Good concept, but the cars are distracting and the crowd is small for the movie of the year.', '2002-11-27 14:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160986, 8793, 3317, '<td valign="top">i hate it when i shuffle around for my keys and put my head on the top of the car then get in the car without thinking about it and drive off only my head''s still up there riding around and i look like idiot until finally somebody waves at me in traffic and points and i remember and feel like a dope. lost a cup of coffee like that the other day, spilled all down the roof and kinda ruined the paint.</td>', 'i hate it when i shuffle around for my keys and put my head on the top of the car then get in the car without thinking about it and drive off only my head''s still up there riding around and i look like idiot until finally somebody waves at me in traffic and points and i remember and feel like a dope. lost a cup of coffee like that the other day, spilled all down the roof and kinda ruined the paint.', '2002-11-27 21:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160987, 8793, 4610, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but it is going to be The Two Towers.... :)  morterin</td>', 'Sorry, but it is going to be The Two Towers.... :)  morterin', '2002-11-28 02:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160988, 8793, 4764, '<td valign="top">Enh...could have worked a LOT better if there were a lot more people in line</td>', 'Enh...could have worked a LOT better if there were a lot more people in line', '2002-11-28 15:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160989, 8793, 5070, '<td valign="top">Needs more ''intense'' showing of large audience gathered.</td>', 'Needs more ''intense'' showing of large audience gathered.', '2002-11-30 19:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160990, 8793, 3380, '<td valign="top">Too much negative space. Perhaps a little bit more cropping and contrast adjustments.</td>', 'Too much negative space. Perhaps a little bit more cropping and contrast adjustments.', '2002-12-01 18:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160991, 8793, 714, '<td valign="top">Great idea, but would have been better if there were a big line of people.  Sonifo Vote 5</td>', 'Great idea, but would have been better if there were a big line of people.  Sonifo Vote 5', '2002-12-01 22:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160992, 8794, 5376, '<td valign="top">catching the moment</td>', 'catching the moment', '2002-11-25 18:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160993, 8794, 4648, '<td valign="top">What are they rescuing.  Would have done better to just zoomed in more on the helicopter and it''s load with just the tops of the buildings.  But, just my opinion.  PTL6</td>', 'What are they rescuing.  Would have done better to just zoomed in more on the helicopter and it''s load with just the tops of the buildings.  But, just my opinion.  PTL6', '2002-11-25 22:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160994, 8794, 1143, '<td valign="top">This is kind of cool. I''ve never actually seen this, and we have two pics of it in this challenge? I''m not sure if it''s the camera or what, but the buildings aren''t very clear. Maybe it was exposure due to the lighting situation. I really don''t know enough to say. ANYWAY, fits the challenge and has a good composition. Not much emotional pull, but I know that isn''t always necessary in PJ.  ~indigo997</td>', 'This is kind of cool. I''ve never actually seen this, and we have two pics of it in this challenge? I''m not sure if it''s the camera or what, but the buildings aren''t very clear. Maybe it was exposure due to the lighting situation. I really don''t know enough to say. ANYWAY, fits the challenge and has a good composition. Not much emotional pull, but I know that isn''t always necessary in PJ.  ~indigo997', '2002-11-25 23:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160995, 8794, 5120, '<td valign="top">I wish I could see a little more detail in the helicopter.  Maybe if you could have cropped it a little tighter this would have helped.<br/><br/>Greg<br/></td>', 'I wish I could see a little more detail in the helicopter.  Maybe if you could have cropped it a little tighter this would have helped.Greg', '2002-11-26 12:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160996, 8794, 2829, '<td valign="top">Composition is ok but the buildings overpower the main subject in this photo. I''m more focused on the detail of the buildings. Exposure is not bad you didn''t blow out the sky and there''s some detail in the helicopter and the load it''s carrying. Also, when you resized this photo you must have overcompressed or oversharpened this photo because there are jaggies in the chopper blades.</td>', 'Composition is ok but the buildings overpower the main subject in this photo. I''m more focused on the detail of the buildings. Exposure is not bad you didn''t blow out the sky and there''s some detail in the helicopter and the load it''s carrying. Also, when you resized this photo you must have overcompressed or oversharpened this photo because there are jaggies in the chopper blades.', '2002-11-26 14:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160997, 8794, 4514, '<td valign="top">Nothing convinces me that this picture deserves such a dramatic tittle.</td>', 'Nothing convinces me that this picture deserves such a dramatic tittle.', '2002-11-27 05:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160998, 8794, 2490, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Musta used a fast shutter for this one! 6 nards656</td>', 'Wow!  Musta used a fast shutter for this one! 6 nards656', '2002-11-27 12:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(160999, 8794, 3317, '<td valign="top">lucky it was that well lit you get a shutter speed fast enough to keep the blades still. was that really a rescue? first you send them this picture, then you schooze with them a little, then they take you up for a ride in the sling, that''s when you really start getting winning shots. i say six.</td>', 'lucky it was that well lit you get a shutter speed fast enough to keep the blades still. was that really a rescue? first you send them this picture, then you schooze with them a little, then they take you up for a ride in the sling, that''s when you really start getting winning shots. i say six.', '2002-11-27 21:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(161000, 8794, 1280, '<td valign="top">Good capture!  Grayce</td>', 'Good capture!  Grayce', '2002-11-29 00:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(161001, 8794, 5455, '<td valign="top">rescue? what?</td>', 'rescue? what?', '2002-12-01 18:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
