(161003, 8795, 4967, '<td valign="top">Very cute!  I like your idea... would have been nice to have a human in the photo, maybe looking in the window or something.</td>', 'Very cute!  I like your idea... would have been nice to have a human in the photo, maybe looking in the window or something.', '2002-11-25 00:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
