(161015, 8795, 4648, '<td valign="top">Cute idea - window dressing.  Nice composition with good execution.  The real people in the chorus line add to it nicely.  Nice soft focus works well here.  Good job.  PTL7</td>', 'Cute idea - window dressing.  Nice composition with good execution.  The real people in the chorus line add to it nicely.  Nice soft focus works well here.  Good job.  PTL7', '2002-11-30 00:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(161016, 8795, 2170, '<td valign="top">I think a picture of the full window would have been more effective.  If it weren''t for the title, no one would know what this is.  By showing the entire scene, it would make a lot more sense to this challenge -- like it was supporting a story about Xmas shopping or something.  muckpond.</td>', 'I think a picture of the full window would have been more effective.  If it weren''t for the title, no one would know what this is.  By showing the entire scene, it would make a lot more sense to this challenge -- like it was supporting a story about Xmas shopping or something.  muckpond.', '2002-11-30 16:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(161017, 8795, 4049, '<td valign="top">lol</td>', 'lol', '2002-12-01 12:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(161018, 8795, 674, '<td valign="top">Critique Club Comment.<br/>Technical: I assume that this was shot through glass as you say it is a window display although I dont see any reflections! The focus is slightly soft and fuzzy, the colourand lighting good. <br/>Composition: As Miss Piggy is the focal point I would have done away with the puppet audience as they are distracting!<br/>I feel this would be better cropped in portrait mode, as it is slightly flattened in the landscape format.<br/>Although this would be good as part of a Christmas article it is not really photo journalism as it would not stand alone with out it''s title!<br/>For me although this is a nice shot it does not say Wow!<br/></td>', 'Critique Club Comment.Technical: I assume that this was shot through glass as you say it is a window display although I dont see any reflections! The focus is slightly soft and fuzzy, the colourand lighting good. Composition: As Miss Piggy is the focal point I would have done away with the puppet audience as they are distracting!I feel this would be better cropped in portrait mode, as it is slightly flattened in the landscape format.Although this would be good as part of a Christmas article it is not really photo journalism as it would not stand alone with out it''s title!For me although this is a nice shot it does not say Wow!', '2002-12-02 01:09:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(161019, 8796, 4267, '<td valign="top">nice camera placement<br/>~anachronite</td>', 'nice camera placement~anachronite', '2002-11-25 01:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(161020, 8796, 1908, '<td valign="top">need a slower shutter speed to blur the water slighty</td>', 'need a slower shutter speed to blur the water slighty', '2002-11-25 05:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(161021, 8796, 3032, '<td valign="top">It could very well be a troublesome rising of water, but the picture does not express that well enough.</td>', 'It could very well be a troublesome rising of water, but the picture does not express that well enough.', '2002-11-25 05:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
