(161051, 8797, 2170, '<td valign="top">I think this is too distant to be a photojournalism photo.  It doesn''t pop out from the page the way you would want a newspaper/magazine photo to.  muckpond</td>', 'I think this is too distant to be a photojournalism photo.  It doesn''t pop out from the page the way you would want a newspaper/magazine photo to.  muckpond', '2002-11-30 15:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
