(161056, 8799, 327, '<td valign="top">Too much going on here to really see anything but the flag. Okay that''s the idea...not bad really. All in all not bad, just chaos in the background. Justine</td>', 'Too much going on here to really see anything but the flag. Okay that''s the idea...not bad really. All in all not bad, just chaos in the background. Justine', '2002-11-25 16:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(161057, 8799, 4648, '<td valign="top">As it''s cropped it''s too busy.  You should have zoomed back and let us see the whole tree.  That would have been beautiful.  Subject good.  Lighting a little dark.  Crop too tight.  Focus good.  Good shot, just not enough of it.  PTL5</td>', 'As it''s cropped it''s too busy.  You should have zoomed back and let us see the whole tree.  That would have been beautiful.  Subject good.  Lighting a little dark.  Crop too tight.  Focus good.  Good shot, just not enough of it.  PTL5', '2002-11-25 21:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
