(161063, 8799, 3317, '<td valign="top">so i take pictures of the flag all the time, right? and i totally love how you can get a million different american flags in a million different ways in this country. only this one time somebody submitted a flag picture on this site, and then somebody else came along and commented that it was a "cheap shot". and ever since then i can''t help thinking that that commenter was right, that a picture that''s got a large percentage of flag is just too easy. still trying to get it figured out though so you still get a six. God bless america.</td>', 'so i take pictures of the flag all the time, right? and i totally love how you can get a million different american flags in a million different ways in this country. only this one time somebody submitted a flag picture on this site, and then somebody else came along and commented that it was a "cheap shot". and ever since then i can''t help thinking that that commenter was right, that a picture that''s got a large percentage of flag is just too easy. still trying to get it figured out though so you still get a six. God bless america.', '2002-11-27 21:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
