(161091, 8800, 2221, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful photo. It''s one of my favourites this week. I love the backlighting and the compositon is awesome. The boy is positioned excatly with the white spot of the sun/clouds in the background which immediatly leads your eyes to the head and from there via the arm to the thing he holds (a piece of wood?). I just didn''t get what his dream could be, but that doesn''t matter so much because the photo in itself is so good ;-) Great job! -stephan</td>', 'This is a wonderful photo. It''s one of my favourites this week. I love the backlighting and the compositon is awesome. The boy is positioned excatly with the white spot of the sun/clouds in the background which immediatly leads your eyes to the head and from there via the arm to the thing he holds (a piece of wood?). I just didn''t get what his dream could be, but that doesn''t matter so much because the photo in itself is so good ;-) Great job! -stephan', '2002-12-01 18:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
