(161197, 8810, 2490, '<td valign="top">That''s hilarious.  Mall, airport???? composition is okay but not great, colors are okay but obviously not planned.  That''s okay, but working to use what you are given is a thing to work on.  5 nards656</td>', 'That''s hilarious.  Mall, airport???? composition is okay but not great, colors are okay but obviously not planned.  That''s okay, but working to use what you are given is a thing to work on.  5 nards656', '2002-11-27 12:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
