(161213, 8811, 2553, '<td valign="top">This is a case where I would have no idea what the shot was about unless I saw the title, but with it, I can see the photojournalism angle.  I think I would have cropped out the area in the upper right corner - I find that a little distracting.  lhall</td>', 'This is a case where I would have no idea what the shot was about unless I saw the title, but with it, I can see the photojournalism angle.  I think I would have cropped out the area in the upper right corner - I find that a little distracting.  lhall', '2002-11-25 19:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(161214, 8811, 4162, '<td valign="top">Yes, the picture telles a story, but I think that the lack of colour  doesnt add interest or invite further inspection.  I think that you could have cropped off the top and have more of the car s and bicycles in the shot, to make it more even.</td>', 'Yes, the picture telles a story, but I think that the lack of colour  doesnt add interest or invite further inspection.  I think that you could have cropped off the top and have more of the car s and bicycles in the shot, to make it more even.', '2002-11-25 21:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(161215, 8811, 4648, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome shot.  Showing it from above really adds so much to the shot.  I''m not sure what you did with the coloring but I would have liked it in full color so the oil spill would have shown up better for what it is.  I like the subject matter, the focus, the execution, the centering.  It''s got soft focus.  The coloring draws my eyes to the cars which are not the subject.  The oil spill is the main focus of the shot.  In color you would have been drawn to it.  Still a good shot.  PTL7</td>', 'This is an awesome shot.  Showing it from above really adds so much to the shot.  I''m not sure what you did with the coloring but I would have liked it in full color so the oil spill would have shown up better for what it is.  I like the subject matter, the focus, the execution, the centering.  It''s got soft focus.  The coloring draws my eyes to the cars which are not the subject.  The oil spill is the main focus of the shot.  In color you would have been drawn to it.  Still a good shot.  PTL7', '2002-11-26 14:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
