(161226, 8811, 1280, '<td valign="top">This would grab my attention and make me want to read the story.   It raises questions about what, exactly is causing the pollution and what can we do to improve it.  <br/>One of the things I find interesting is that the way you composed this, the shape and angle is suggestive of  the planet earth.<br/>It''s not what I''d consider a visually pleasing image but it is strong expose'' impact.  <br/></td>', 'This would grab my attention and make me want to read the story.   It raises questions about what, exactly is causing the pollution and what can we do to improve it.  One of the things I find interesting is that the way you composed this, the shape and angle is suggestive of  the planet earth.It''s not what I''d consider a visually pleasing image but it is strong expose'' impact.  ', '2002-12-03 23:45:00.000000', NULL, 0),
