(161266, 8814, 4811, '<td valign="top">Wish the top part of the photograph was exposed a little better - seems washed out. A graduated ND filter or light that was less harsh may have solved this.</td>', 'Wish the top part of the photograph was exposed a little better - seems washed out. A graduated ND filter or light that was less harsh may have solved this.', '2002-11-26 20:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
