(161284, 8815, 4811, '<td valign="top">Though I rarely ever see a newspaper picture with an element that''s out of focus, this is something that could definately make it on a magazine. I think the composition is great and the blurred colors of the flag create a paintery effect. Highlights are slightly blown on the poles, but I have no idea how to avoid such a problem. Well done.</td>', 'Though I rarely ever see a newspaper picture with an element that''s out of focus, this is something that could definately make it on a magazine. I think the composition is great and the blurred colors of the flag create a paintery effect. Highlights are slightly blown on the poles, but I have no idea how to avoid such a problem. Well done.', '2002-11-26 15:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
