(161293, 8815, 3273, '<td valign="top">I''m sure this breaks more rules of photography than it sticks to, but I like it.  Strong vivid colours and a nice use of motion blur.  It''s a shame that the top of the building isn''t a little more in focus.</td>', 'I''m sure this breaks more rules of photography than it sticks to, but I like it.  Strong vivid colours and a nice use of motion blur.  It''s a shame that the top of the building isn''t a little more in focus.', '2002-11-28 03:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
