(161302, 8815, 4411, '<td valign="top">Too much blur on the flags for me, and I think the whole of the NYC 2012 banner should have been in shot as that would appear to be the point of the photo. <br/>Otherwise a good shot, the lines of the building and flagpoles are very strong.</td>', 'Too much blur on the flags for me, and I think the whole of the NYC 2012 banner should have been in shot as that would appear to be the point of the photo. Otherwise a good shot, the lines of the building and flagpoles are very strong.', '2002-12-01 06:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
