(161317, 8816, 1143, '<td valign="top">*whistle* you shoulda got her number and offered to take her picture some time.  The guy looks like he''s trying to be SO cool  :o)  Very nice composition. Focus might be a tad soft, but exposure is good. Fits the challenge. Nice use of B&amp;W. Ranks up in my top 10 ... maybe 5 after bumping  ~indi</td>', '*whistle* you shoulda got her number and offered to take her picture some time.  The guy looks like he''s trying to be SO cool  :o)  Very nice composition. Focus might be a tad soft, but exposure is good. Fits the challenge. Nice use of B&W. Ranks up in my top 10 ... maybe 5 after bumping  ~indi', '2002-11-25 22:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
