(161360, 8817, 4514, '<td valign="top">Isn''t this just the Cutest one I have seen so far.  On the other end of the spectrum form mine.  I guess that gives balance.  Great shot.</td>', 'Isn''t this just the Cutest one I have seen so far.  On the other end of the spectrum form mine.  I guess that gives balance.  Great shot.', '2002-11-26 03:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
