(161438, 8822, 3540, '<td valign="top">I''ve haven''t critiqued a photo all night, so you get to be the lucky one (which is good).  The 2 things I like about this photo is the angle from which it was taken and the incredible DOF.  This is a remarkably well taken photo.  The lighting is great as far as these conditions go.  I like the way the bucket on the aerial looks detached from the boom. I can see the faint skeleton of the boom, but humor me here.  I wish the fire engine were a little better lit on the near side.  This photo isn''t blowing me away, but was interesting enough for me to take a closer look.  Good luck! - Inspzil</td>', 'I''ve haven''t critiqued a photo all night, so you get to be the lucky one (which is good).  The 2 things I like about this photo is the angle from which it was taken and the incredible DOF.  This is a remarkably well taken photo.  The lighting is great as far as these conditions go.  I like the way the bucket on the aerial looks detached from the boom. I can see the faint skeleton of the boom, but humor me here.  I wish the fire engine were a little better lit on the near side.  This photo isn''t blowing me away, but was interesting enough for me to take a closer look.  Good luck! - Inspzil', '2002-11-25 23:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(161439, 8822, 3102, '<td valign="top">Good job capturing a story in the making!  I like the way you included the rescue vehicle on the right.</td>', 'Good job capturing a story in the making!  I like the way you included the rescue vehicle on the right.', '2002-11-26 13:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(161440, 8822, 4514, '<td valign="top">Too bad the ladder is not in focus.  Good Idea though.</td>', 'Too bad the ladder is not in focus.  Good Idea though.', '2002-11-27 01:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
