(161458, 8823, 4811, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if this meets a photojournalism challenge, but photo wise its a very interesting shot. I''d zoom out a little though so that you get the right edge of the sculpture, and tilt it upwards to remove the background trees/lines... probably would make a very cool abstract...</td>', 'I''m not sure if this meets a photojournalism challenge, but photo wise its a very interesting shot. I''d zoom out a little though so that you get the right edge of the sculpture, and tilt it upwards to remove the background trees/lines... probably would make a very cool abstract...', '2002-11-26 20:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(161459, 8823, 2337, '<td valign="top">For this to have nailed the challenge, you needed to show the new corner... Possibly even workers moving it if you were lucky enough to be there during the move... The crop seems a bit too close for me to get a good idea what this sculpture looks like.  ~ MyQyl ~</td>', 'For this to have nailed the challenge, you needed to show the new corner... Possibly even workers moving it if you were lucky enough to be there during the move... The crop seems a bit too close for me to get a good idea what this sculpture looks like.  ~ MyQyl ~', '2002-11-26 21:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
