(161462, 8823, 811, '<td valign="top">The blue sky is nice, and that is definitely an interesting sculpture.  I think cropping it horizontally so that the stuff in the bottom wasn''t showing would make it more effective. karmat</td>', 'The blue sky is nice, and that is definitely an interesting sculpture.  I think cropping it horizontally so that the stuff in the bottom wasn''t showing would make it more effective. karmat', '2002-11-27 13:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
