(161476, 8826, 4615, '<td valign="top">El generalisimo.  Wow, military dictatorships still going strong it seems.   Would be better to have the officer standing in the truck as the subject rather than the soldier on the ground.  But not always possible.</td>', 'El generalisimo.  Wow, military dictatorships still going strong it seems.   Would be better to have the officer standing in the truck as the subject rather than the soldier on the ground.  But not always possible.', '2002-11-26 18:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
