(161482, 8826, 806, '<td valign="top">I have to wonder how this would look in a horizontal format. If it had been taken in horizontal, or cropped that way (assuming this is a crop of the original due to the quality) it may have shown more of the scene giving a National Pride feeling.</td>', 'I have to wonder how this would look in a horizontal format. If it had been taken in horizontal, or cropped that way (assuming this is a crop of the original due to the quality) it may have shown more of the scene giving a National Pride feeling.', '2002-12-01 22:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(161483, 8826, 674, '<td valign="top">critique club<br/>COMPOSITION -CONTENT -  This is a good shot but the vertical cropping has detracted from the impact. I would like tosee something of what the soldier is looking back at. My screen is showing a bit of compression artefacts but this may not be obvious on another pc.<br/> CAMERA WORK -TECHNICAL -  Colur and lighting are good.<br/> DIGITAL PROCESSING - TECHNICAL -  Cropping could be improved upon and resizing <br/>YOUR OPINION ON THE PHOTO -  I am left wondering what the soldier is looking back so worriedly at also the general looks rather grim faced and not really displaying national pride!<br/></td>', 'critique clubCOMPOSITION -CONTENT -  This is a good shot but the vertical cropping has detracted from the impact. I would like tosee something of what the soldier is looking back at. My screen is showing a bit of compression artefacts but this may not be obvious on another pc. CAMERA WORK -TECHNICAL -  Colur and lighting are good. DIGITAL PROCESSING - TECHNICAL -  Cropping could be improved upon and resizing YOUR OPINION ON THE PHOTO -  I am left wondering what the soldier is looking back so worriedly at also the general looks rather grim faced and not really displaying national pride!', '2002-12-04 01:17:00.000000', NULL, 0),
