(161487, 8827, 327, '<td valign="top">This is very nice, it''s also sad. Uno-One, alone. Is this Mexico, South America? I like seeing  his clothes. The woven hat. Interesting shot with great texture, great feeling. Good eye. Justine</td>', 'This is very nice, it''s also sad. Uno-One, alone. Is this Mexico, South America? I like seeing  his clothes. The woven hat. Interesting shot with great texture, great feeling. Good eye. Justine', '2002-11-25 15:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
