(161494, 8827, 3317, '<td valign="top">please be sure and tell us more about who this is, where they are, picture makes me curious, which sure as heck is photojournalistic. i want to see his eyes. why did you go black and white. a lot of people did that this week, maybe i''m not getting something.</td>', 'please be sure and tell us more about who this is, where they are, picture makes me curious, which sure as heck is photojournalistic. i want to see his eyes. why did you go black and white. a lot of people did that this week, maybe i''m not getting something.', '2002-11-28 22:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
