(161505, 8828, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background6,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing6,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 6,<br/>Total Averaged Rating6.   Autool<br/>IMO the relationship between the title and picture are key elements in this challenge.   The harsh lights of the stage command sharp focus of the subjects'' face.   You may have needed to go to manual with such a crazy design on his shirt.   These things seem to confuse our auto focus cameras.<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background6,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing6,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 6,Total Averaged Rating6.   AutoolIMO the relationship between the title and picture are key elements in this challenge.   The harsh lights of the stage command sharp focus of the subjects'' face.   You may have needed to go to manual with such a crazy design on his shirt.   These things seem to confuse our auto focus cameras.', '2002-11-25 10:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(161506, 8828, 4494, '<td valign="top">LOL.</td>', 'LOL.', '2002-11-25 17:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(161507, 8828, 5376, '<td valign="top">Good pic...wish you could have gotten more of the guitar and more shutter on the hand but still it seems very LIVE.</td>', 'Good pic...wish you could have gotten more of the guitar and more shutter on the hand but still it seems very LIVE.', '2002-11-25 17:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(161508, 8828, 4388, '<td valign="top">good picture and lighting.  is this a real player? if so, why didn''t you title it with his name? good composition.</td>', 'good picture and lighting.  is this a real player? if so, why didn''t you title it with his name? good composition.', '2002-11-25 21:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(161509, 8828, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice clear concert shot. DPz</td>', 'Nice clear concert shot. DPz', '2002-11-25 22:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(161510, 8828, 5120, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot and think it is very well done.  The hand movement shows action but the face is in sharp focus.  The only thing I would change about this one and it is probably not possible is that shadow from the microphone.  This is one of my favorite shots from this week.<br/><br/>Greg<br/></td>', 'I really like this shot and think it is very well done.  The hand movement shows action but the face is in sharp focus.  The only thing I would change about this one and it is probably not possible is that shadow from the microphone.  This is one of my favorite shots from this week.Greg', '2002-11-26 12:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(161511, 8828, 2361, '<td valign="top">Captured almost perfectly.  Well done!  Jak 8</td>', 'Captured almost perfectly.  Well done!  Jak 8', '2002-11-26 15:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
