(161513, 8828, 4514, '<td valign="top">This is real but the shadow form the Mic is not that great.  YOu got very close.  Impressive for a concert.</td>', 'This is real but the shadow form the Mic is not that great.  YOu got very close.  Impressive for a concert.', '2002-11-27 01:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
