(161516, 8828, 2716, '<td valign="top">I like the feel of this shot.  Good job.  Jacko 8</td>', 'I like the feel of this shot.  Good job.  Jacko 8', '2002-11-28 21:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(161517, 8828, 4055, '<td valign="top">Great composition. I know this kind of shots are hard to take but this is really good. The lighting is good and the focus is OK for this kind of photo. High score from me. /carsten</td>', 'Great composition. I know this kind of shots are hard to take but this is really good. The lighting is good and the focus is OK for this kind of photo. High score from me. /carsten', '2002-11-30 12:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(161518, 8828, 3730, '<td valign="top">Perfect timing...like how you ''blurred'' out the bg...lighting iis very nice, comp wise you could have gotten a bit more of the guitar....9 zadore</td>', 'Perfect timing...like how you ''blurred'' out the bg...lighting iis very nice, comp wise you could have gotten a bit more of the guitar....9 zadore', '2002-12-01 09:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(161519, 8828, 51167, '<td valign="top">"Critique Club"<br/><br/>This is a gerat concert shot. <br/>COMPOSITION- I think the composition for a concert shot like this is right on.  You''ve captured him clearly in focus and the lighting on him is great.  I just wish that the white lights in the shot were some funky color but you didn''t have much control about that.  I think it would have looked a little neater too with less of a crop to get his whole guitar in the shot, well just the long part of it, I don''t know what that''s called.  I like where your cut off the bottom.  <br/><br/>BACKGROUND-  There isn''t anything distracting in it.  I like the faint outline of those bars in it.  It fits with this shot.  I just wish again that the lights weren''t white.<br/><br/>CAMERA WORK- You''ve used a great aperature with this shot.  There is a slight blur to his hand and that could have been fixed with a little faster shutter speed.  (See my opinion down below)  Everything is steady and straight.  <br/><br/>DIGITAL PROCESSING-  You''ve done a great job in compressing this.  I don''t see any of the "jaggies" or anything like that.  The only thing I''m not sure about is his shirt.  It looks kinda flashy wavy or something.  I don''t know if it''s natural or the digital did that.  <br/><br/>MY OPINION-  I think this shot is an awesome concert shot.  I took some for a band and it was hard to get them right.  I think I only had one that turned out half way decent.  I like the motion blur on his hand.  Some might not but I think that it shows part of the show.  Congradulations on this hard kind of shot to get.  You''ve done it great.</td>', '"Critique Club"This is a gerat concert shot. COMPOSITION- I think the composition for a concert shot like this is right on.  You''ve captured him clearly in focus and the lighting on him is great.  I just wish that the white lights in the shot were some funky color but you didn''t have much control about that.  I think it would have looked a little neater too with less of a crop to get his whole guitar in the shot, well just the long part of it, I don''t know what that''s called.  I like where your cut off the bottom.  BACKGROUND-  There isn''t anything distracting in it.  I like the faint outline of those bars in it.  It fits with this shot.  I just wish again that the lights weren''t white.CAMERA WORK- You''ve used a great aperature with this shot.  There is a slight blur to his hand and that could have been fixed with a little faster shutter speed.  (See my opinion down below)  Everything is steady and straight.  DIGITAL PROCESSING-  You''ve done a great job in compressing this.  I don''t see any of the "jaggies" or anything like that.  The only thing I''m not sure about is his shirt.  It looks kinda flashy wavy or something.  I don''t know if it''s natural or the digital did that.  MY OPINION-  I think this shot is an awesome concert shot.  I took some for a band and it was hard to get them right.  I think I only had one that turned out half way decent.  I like the motion blur on his hand.  Some might not but I think that it shows part of the show.  Congradulations on this hard kind of shot to get.  You''ve done it great.', '2002-12-04 03:54:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(161520, 8829, 5212, '<td valign="top">Nice photo</td>', 'Nice photo', '2002-11-25 00:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
