(161530, 8829, 4267, '<td valign="top">a super cool photo and sure to score high.. I may raise my score before weeks end... but for now I am just not sure how well it meets the "impact of the moment" stated in the challenge..... I need the way cool effect to wear off before I can deside.. lol (7)<br/>~anachronite</td>', 'a super cool photo and sure to score high.. I may raise my score before weeks end... but for now I am just not sure how well it meets the "impact of the moment" stated in the challenge..... I need the way cool effect to wear off before I can deside.. lol (7)~anachronite', '2002-11-25 22:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
