(161536, 8829, 2490, '<td valign="top">Not sure what the "story" is in this pic, but it''s definitely a high quality pic, and that''s what I''m voting this week, basically.  8 nards656</td>', 'Not sure what the "story" is in this pic, but it''s definitely a high quality pic, and that''s what I''m voting this week, basically.  8 nards656', '2002-11-27 12:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(161537, 8829, 4648, '<td valign="top">Can''t tell if this is taken from the window of an airplane above the clouds or somewhere in Alaska, or someplace like that.  It''s a beautiful photo, with really great depth of field.  I''d hve to read the article to find out which location is right.  Good job, beautiful pic.  Well done.  PTL8</td>', 'Can''t tell if this is taken from the window of an airplane above the clouds or somewhere in Alaska, or someplace like that.  It''s a beautiful photo, with really great depth of field.  I''d hve to read the article to find out which location is right.  Good job, beautiful pic.  Well done.  PTL8', '2002-11-30 19:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(161538, 8829, 4536, '<td valign="top">cool, are those clouds or snow? Good shot for the blue challenge too!</td>', 'cool, are those clouds or snow? Good shot for the blue challenge too!', '2002-11-30 23:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(161539, 8829, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very interesting.  Convincingly frigid.  The only thing I find distracting is the shadow up front.  I''d love to have seen a person bundled up in the distance. Good job.  Grayce</td>', 'Very interesting.  Convincingly frigid.  The only thing I find distracting is the shadow up front.  I''d love to have seen a person bundled up in the distance. Good job.  Grayce', '2002-12-01 00:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(161540, 8829, 5121, '<td valign="top">+ 1 photographer!</td>', '+ 1 photographer!', '2002-12-01 07:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(161541, 8829, 4162, '<td valign="top">COMPOSITION-CONTENT<br/>I loved the simple composition and content of this, the picture has instant impact. There is no clear focal point of the picture, but the eyes are drawn to the horizon and its lovely that there are no man made objects in the whole picture.  I think cropping off the bottom couple of cms might hav been good, to get rid of the darker clouds at the bottom and would bring the more interesting clouds closer to the viewer. Colour is beautiful, the simplicity of the colours and softness of them are beautiful.<br/><br/>BACKGROUND<br/>DOF is great here, and the horizon is nicely in focus. Basically the background is the photo here and the background is gorgeous!<br/><br/>DIGITAL PROCESSING-TECHNICAL<br/> No problems here, could have been possible to add a bit more contrast to bring out the blues of the sky a little more, would have also have to decrease the light though to stop the whites from being blown out. However, I think it is great as it is! <br/><br/>CAMERA WORK-TECHNICAL<br/>The whites in the picture are lovely and clean, they probably couldnt take much more contrast as they would get blown out.  <br/><br/>MY OPINION<br/>I really liked this picture, it has the WOW factor! Lovely crisp, clean colours and the simplicity of it is great. Think it would have benefitted from having the bottom darker clouds cropped, to lead the eye more smoothly into the distance.  It doesnt relate strongly to the photojournalism theme and so probably lost a few points because of that and not because of the picture itself, I think people were expecting shots with more human impact in them! However, its a great picture and Good Luck with the Blue challenge!  Hope that this helps!</td>', 'COMPOSITION-CONTENTI loved the simple composition and content of this, the picture has instant impact. There is no clear focal point of the picture, but the eyes are drawn to the horizon and its lovely that there are no man made objects in the whole picture.  I think cropping off the bottom couple of cms might hav been good, to get rid of the darker clouds at the bottom and would bring the more interesting clouds closer to the viewer. Colour is beautiful, the simplicity of the colours and softness of them are beautiful.BACKGROUNDDOF is great here, and the horizon is nicely in focus. Basically the background is the photo here and the background is gorgeous!DIGITAL PROCESSING-TECHNICAL No problems here, could have been possible to add a bit more contrast to bring out the blues of the sky a little more, would have also have to decrease the light though to stop the whites from being blown out. However, I think it is great as it is! CAMERA WORK-TECHNICALThe whites in the picture are lovely and clean, they probably couldnt take much more contrast as they would get blown out.  MY OPINIONI really liked this picture, it has the WOW factor! Lovely crisp, clean colours and the simplicity of it is great. Think it would have benefitted from having the bottom darker clouds cropped, to lead the eye more smoothly into the distance.  It doesnt relate strongly to the photojournalism theme and so probably lost a few points because of that and not because of the picture itself, I think people were expecting shots with more human impact in them! However, its a great picture and Good Luck with the Blue challenge!  Hope that this helps!', '2002-12-03 20:31:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(161542, 8830, 4967, '<td valign="top">Very interesting!  Nice job... if the color was better, it would be a 10 but I''m giving it an 8, it fits very well into the photojournalism category.  Good job.</td>', 'Very interesting!  Nice job... if the color was better, it would be a 10 but I''m giving it an 8, it fits very well into the photojournalism category.  Good job.', '2002-11-25 00:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(161543, 8830, 5212, '<td valign="top">beautiful photograph, loved how you used the sunlight.</td>', 'beautiful photograph, loved how you used the sunlight.', '2002-11-25 01:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(161544, 8830, 2344, '<td valign="top">You would have gotten a fantastic silhouette when that copter passes over the brightness of the sun</td>', 'You would have gotten a fantastic silhouette when that copter passes over the brightness of the sun', '2002-11-25 09:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(161545, 8830, 4411, '<td valign="top">I do like the moody clouds at the bottom, and the tree up the side, but I don''t like the black line across the bottom. I think cropping this to 640x427 would have helped.</td>', 'I do like the moody clouds at the bottom, and the tree up the side, but I don''t like the black line across the bottom. I think cropping this to 640x427 would have helped.', '2002-11-25 13:44:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(161546, 8830, 327, '<td valign="top">Bottom needs to be cropped out or lightened with levels so we could see what it is....? Building, ground, road? I love the shot over all, but the compression has hurt your shot. It''s a good capture and the composition is really neat. On topic. Justine</td>', 'Bottom needs to be cropped out or lightened with levels so we could see what it is....? Building, ground, road? I love the shot over all, but the compression has hurt your shot. It''s a good capture and the composition is really neat. On topic. Justine', '2002-11-25 15:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(161547, 8830, 4648, '<td valign="top">Awesome.  Don''t let anyone tell you to change anything.  Love the sun through the clouds.  Wouldn''t change a thing.  Great as it is.  PTL10</td>', 'Awesome.  Don''t let anyone tell you to change anything.  Love the sun through the clouds.  Wouldn''t change a thing.  Great as it is.  PTL10', '2002-11-25 22:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(161548, 8830, 4906, '<td valign="top">The main subject is washed out. Might have been better to wait and take the photo when the helicopter had moved.</td>', 'The main subject is washed out. Might have been better to wait and take the photo when the helicopter had moved.', '2002-11-26 11:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(161549, 8830, 737, '<td valign="top">Good idea, I waver on the position relative to the sun. The center just seems too bright for me. I like tree on left.<br/><br/>Jim msp</td>', 'Good idea, I waver on the position relative to the sun. The center just seems too bright for me. I like tree on left.Jim msp', '2002-11-26 22:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(161550, 8830, 3447, '<td valign="top">Good capture, and your composition is first rate.    6     JEM</td>', 'Good capture, and your composition is first rate.    6     JEM', '2002-11-27 11:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(161551, 8830, 2490, '<td valign="top">I think you used the sun well here.  I like this.  8 nards656</td>', 'I think you used the sun well here.  I like this.  8 nards656', '2002-11-27 12:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(161552, 8830, 3459, '<td valign="top">While technically it is not a fashion magazione cover quality photograph, it is exceptional nevertheless.  With your compositon, you were able to capture the sense of urgency, the real need implyied by the havy machinery, the connection to life (the tree on the left acomplishes that very well).  Especially impressive is the sun, almost dead in the centre, making the image striking; the siloet shapes of all the objects give the image the sence of urgency mentioned earlier.  Congratulations, on job very well done.</td>', 'While technically it is not a fashion magazione cover quality photograph, it is exceptional nevertheless.  With your compositon, you were able to capture the sense of urgency, the real need implyied by the havy machinery, the connection to life (the tree on the left acomplishes that very well).  Especially impressive is the sun, almost dead in the centre, making the image striking; the siloet shapes of all the objects give the image the sence of urgency mentioned earlier.  Congratulations, on job very well done.', '2002-11-27 13:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(161553, 8830, 4514, '<td valign="top">Intresting.  How about closing that shutter to get rid of the glare.<br/></td>', 'Intresting.  How about closing that shutter to get rid of the glare.', '2002-11-27 21:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(161554, 8830, 2488, '<td valign="top">image seems to be of poor quality(it chops off a few points) but nice idea bails it a bit</td>', 'image seems to be of poor quality(it chops off a few points) but nice idea bails it a bit', '2002-11-29 04:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(161555, 8830, 3540, '<td valign="top">This has potential, but I don''t think like this I would expect to see it in the paper.  Without the sun so bright and a little more focused on the helicopter, it might make it but with the bright sun like this, without a more dynamic backdrop, it would be on the cutting room floor. - Inspzil</td>', 'This has potential, but I don''t think like this I would expect to see it in the paper.  Without the sun so bright and a little more focused on the helicopter, it might make it but with the bright sun like this, without a more dynamic backdrop, it would be on the cutting room floor. - Inspzil', '2002-11-29 05:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(161556, 8830, 1379, '<td valign="top">Wow.... I love that glorious beaming sunlight!</td>', 'Wow.... I love that glorious beaming sunlight!', '2002-11-29 22:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(161557, 8830, 4596, '<td valign="top">Yes, but I don''t know as the photo is anything more than okay.</td>', 'Yes, but I don''t know as the photo is anything more than okay.', '2002-11-30 17:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(161558, 8831, 3719, '<td valign="top">Very well done.</td>', 'Very well done.', '2002-11-25 11:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(161559, 8831, 327, '<td valign="top">There is just too much going on in this shot..chaos to my eyes!! I can''t get the focus on the subject with this perspective view. Also it''s a bit dark. Justine</td>', 'There is just too much going on in this shot..chaos to my eyes!! I can''t get the focus on the subject with this perspective view. Also it''s a bit dark. Justine', '2002-11-25 15:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(161560, 8831, 4648, '<td valign="top">Don''t understand your title but love your picture.  It speaks volumns.  Love the overhead view.  That makes the photo.  Good focus.  Good composition with great execution.  Great human interest story.  PTL9</td>', 'Don''t understand your title but love your picture.  It speaks volumns.  Love the overhead view.  That makes the photo.  Good focus.  Good composition with great execution.  Great human interest story.  PTL9', '2002-11-25 22:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(161561, 8831, 1143, '<td valign="top">Great perspective. Catching someone in their own environment without them knowing is interesting. I really like the stairs along the top. I wonder how this would have looked as a vertical shot. The leaves along the right are distracting. ~indi</td>', 'Great perspective. Catching someone in their own environment without them knowing is interesting. I really like the stairs along the top. I wonder how this would have looked as a vertical shot. The leaves along the right are distracting. ~indi', '2002-11-25 22:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(161562, 8831, 4267, '<td valign="top">I don''t really like the camera angle, but maybe that''s just me... the setting does provide some impact though<br/>~anachronite</td>', 'I don''t really like the camera angle, but maybe that''s just me... the setting does provide some impact though~anachronite', '2002-11-25 23:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(161563, 8831, 4625, '<td valign="top">good shot, but I don''t care for the angle much.</td>', 'good shot, but I don''t care for the angle much.', '2002-11-26 01:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(161564, 8831, 4906, '<td valign="top">Would have preferred a different viewpoint.</td>', 'Would have preferred a different viewpoint.', '2002-11-26 09:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(161565, 8831, 4514, '<td valign="top">What does the title have to do with anything.  I do not understand.  Need to get in front of this guy closer to the ground.  Would have more impact<br/></td>', 'What does the title have to do with anything.  I do not understand.  Need to get in front of this guy closer to the ground.  Would have more impact', '2002-11-27 02:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(161566, 8831, 472, '<td valign="top">sad, fairly static portrait of an unfortunate person, rendered with extreme clarity from an interesting angle.  a better title might it give it more zip.  mag99</td>', 'sad, fairly static portrait of an unfortunate person, rendered with extreme clarity from an interesting angle.  a better title might it give it more zip.  mag99', '2002-11-28 11:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(161567, 8831, 4162, '<td valign="top">I find the angle@of this shot a bit strange, took me a while to realise that it was looking down.   I think I would prefer a different angle.</td>', 'I find the angle@of this shot a bit strange, took me a while to realise that it was looking down.   I think I would prefer a different angle.', '2002-11-28 22:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
