(161591, 8834, 2302, '<td valign="top">Timely, but the shot just doesn''t hold my interest - even the attempted humor. Two things distract from the picture - one, the womans head is slightly cut off on top, moving the camera down just a touch would have helped. Second, what I assume are lights in the upper right corner. The composition is nice - I like that the shot is not centered on the woman or turkey. The use of the dead space under the knife is also nice in that it helps lead the eye to the bottom.</td>', 'Timely, but the shot just doesn''t hold my interest - even the attempted humor. Two things distract from the picture - one, the womans head is slightly cut off on top, moving the camera down just a touch would have helped. Second, what I assume are lights in the upper right corner. The composition is nice - I like that the shot is not centered on the woman or turkey. The use of the dead space under the knife is also nice in that it helps lead the eye to the bottom.', '2002-11-27 14:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
