(161694, 8838, 1143, '<td valign="top">Good exposure in what looks like tough lighting. I''m not sure about the composition. Did you try other possibilities with more water? If you are going to do it this way, I would try a shallow dof because the back tires aren''t really necessary or attractive. It''s still better than most in this challenge. A strong image as is.  ~indigo997</td>', 'Good exposure in what looks like tough lighting. I''m not sure about the composition. Did you try other possibilities with more water? If you are going to do it this way, I would try a shallow dof because the back tires aren''t really necessary or attractive. It''s still better than most in this challenge. A strong image as is.  ~indigo997', '2002-11-25 22:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
