(161706, 8838, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is interesting! Great content and nice colours.<br/>I''d either like to see more of the "path" coming to the front - the two rows of tires with mostly water between - or crop close in on the lower part of the shot as a landscape orientation. Current composition keeps leading my eye out of the frame.<br/>8, Kavey (voting after all)</td>', 'This is interesting! Great content and nice colours.I''d either like to see more of the "path" coming to the front - the two rows of tires with mostly water between - or crop close in on the lower part of the shot as a landscape orientation. Current composition keeps leading my eye out of the frame.8, Kavey (voting after all)', '2002-11-30 13:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
