(161710, 8838, 327, '<td valign="top">#20 <br/>Critique Club Assignment<br/><br/>This shot is all about perspective, patterns, color and texture. It does all four very well.<br/>The tires lead your eye to the end and then back again.<br/><br/>Technically this shot scores an A+ from me. The focus and exposure are just as they should be.<br/>It''s hard to critique something that you like and that''s flawless. <br/>This shot is perfect for the photojournalism challenge.<br/></td>', '#20 Critique Club AssignmentThis shot is all about perspective, patterns, color and texture. It does all four very well.The tires lead your eye to the end and then back again.Technically this shot scores an A+ from me. The focus and exposure are just as they should be.It''s hard to critique something that you like and that''s flawless. This shot is perfect for the photojournalism challenge.', '2002-12-02 10:56:00.000000', NULL, 0),
