(161723, 8840, 4005, '<td valign="top">Nice and friendly! There ''s snow - my absolute sympathy for the woman sitting there! <br/>Technically ''just'' a snapshot, but with a message and therefore better than average!!! 7 - KAOS.<br/>...It''s a pity you cut her boots off!</td>', 'Nice and friendly! There ''s snow - my absolute sympathy for the woman sitting there! Technically ''just'' a snapshot, but with a message and therefore better than average!!! 7 - KAOS....It''s a pity you cut her boots off!', '2002-11-25 05:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
