(161779, 8842, 2361, '<td valign="top">A seriously good photograph. It has almost nothing to do with the photojournalism that I would so call.  However, I can genuinely believe that this could be an -- at least inside -- cover for something like Vogue.  So ...   My top pick this week. Jak 9</td>', 'A seriously good photograph. It has almost nothing to do with the photojournalism that I would so call.  However, I can genuinely believe that this could be an -- at least inside -- cover for something like Vogue.  So ...   My top pick this week. Jak 9', '2002-11-26 23:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
