(161783, 8842, 2170, '<td valign="top">I''m a big fan of DOF, and this is great.  The detail in the garland is wonderful and the lighting is right on.  I actually kind of like the flaw in the hook part of the front bulb...not really noticeable but it''s there if you look at it.  Great setup shot.  muckpond</td>', 'I''m a big fan of DOF, and this is great.  The detail in the garland is wonderful and the lighting is right on.  I actually kind of like the flaw in the hook part of the front bulb...not really noticeable but it''s there if you look at it.  Great setup shot.  muckpond', '2002-11-27 10:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
