(161785, 8842, 2490, '<td valign="top">High quality shot.  I like it.  Excellent color.  I can tell a high end camera shot when I see one.  I see quality lenses written all over this.  8 nards656</td>', 'High quality shot.  I like it.  Excellent color.  I can tell a high end camera shot when I see one.  I see quality lenses written all over this.  8 nards656', '2002-11-27 21:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
