(161791, 8842, 4648, '<td valign="top">Half out of focus - doesn''t add anything to this.  Would have been "pretty picture" otherwise.  Nice color choice.  Decent composition but not a very good execution.  Of course this is my personal  thought.  PTL4</td>', 'Half out of focus - doesn''t add anything to this.  Would have been "pretty picture" otherwise.  Nice color choice.  Decent composition but not a very good execution.  Of course this is my personal  thought.  PTL4', '2002-11-30 19:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(161792, 8842, 4411, '<td valign="top">Great DoF. The tinsel makes a very nice b/g. Lighting is spot on.<br/>Good idea to get an Xmas shot in before we all get sick of them ;)</td>', 'Great DoF. The tinsel makes a very nice b/g. Lighting is spot on.Good idea to get an Xmas shot in before we all get sick of them ;)', '2002-11-30 20:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
