(161820, 8844, 772, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.. it''s not even thanksgiving yet :) I think the exposure on this one is just a bit too long... the lights are a little blown out.  A larger aperture and a faster shutter speed should reduce this... Please help support this great site by commenting on some photos each week.  If you already comment, comment on a few more!  The photographers really appreciate it... - setzler</td>', 'Interesting shot.. it''s not even thanksgiving yet :) I think the exposure on this one is just a bit too long... the lights are a little blown out.  A larger aperture and a faster shutter speed should reduce this... Please help support this great site by commenting on some photos each week.  If you already comment, comment on a few more!  The photographers really appreciate it... - setzler', '2002-11-26 16:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
