(161844, 8845, 674, '<td valign="top">Critique Club<br/>COMPOSITION -CONTENT - I find this too centralised and I think taking it at an angle with the lens pointing upwards would have given a more dramatic effect  The overall image could have been slightly brighter and crisper<br/>- <br/>YOUR OPINION ON THE PHOTO - although I am not an american I can relate to this scene and the sense of desolation the figure and flowers portray definitely a good shot at photo journalism <br/></td>', 'Critique ClubCOMPOSITION -CONTENT - I find this too centralised and I think taking it at an angle with the lens pointing upwards would have given a more dramatic effect  The overall image could have been slightly brighter and crisper- YOUR OPINION ON THE PHOTO - although I am not an american I can relate to this scene and the sense of desolation the figure and flowers portray definitely a good shot at photo journalism ', '2002-12-04 01:10:00.000000', NULL, 0),
