(161851, 8846, 811, '<td valign="top">This shot seems to have a story to tell.  I find it almost ironic that he would wear a hard hat, and work boots and leave his legs exposed.  ouch.  The orange vest does well at pulling attention to him.  that said, I think it might work better if it were possible to crop it so that the man was up and to the right a little, placing him more in the picture and not so close to the edge.  Overall, the focus is a little fuzzy, which also makes it difficult to see well. karmat</td>', 'This shot seems to have a story to tell.  I find it almost ironic that he would wear a hard hat, and work boots and leave his legs exposed.  ouch.  The orange vest does well at pulling attention to him.  that said, I think it might work better if it were possible to crop it so that the man was up and to the right a little, placing him more in the picture and not so close to the edge.  Overall, the focus is a little fuzzy, which also makes it difficult to see well. karmat', '2002-11-26 14:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
