(161888, 8847, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture, and yes mysterious looking.   I love the stillness, and the color. Quality looks good too...no artifacts, etc, that I can see. It seems to me there is a structure to the right just above the pier.  I can''t make out what it is, which makes it more intriguing.   Good job!  Hope to see this on a magazine cover!  8 Grayce</td>', 'Very nice picture, and yes mysterious looking.   I love the stillness, and the color. Quality looks good too...no artifacts, etc, that I can see. It seems to me there is a structure to the right just above the pier.  I can''t make out what it is, which makes it more intriguing.   Good job!  Hope to see this on a magazine cover!  8 Grayce', '2002-12-01 00:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
