(161890, 8847, 4648, '<td valign="top">I''ve got to read the article to see what is so mysterious about this fog.  It''s a beautiful picture, with beautiful reflection in the water.  Great shot.  PTL9</td>', 'I''ve got to read the article to see what is so mysterious about this fog.  It''s a beautiful picture, with beautiful reflection in the water.  Great shot.  PTL9', '2002-12-01 14:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(161891, 8847, 2, '<td valign="top">This is a really great reflection, but the symmetry is just a little off.  The whole image seems like it needs to be shifted up slightly and tilted clockwise about 1 degree, though the latter part may just be an optical illusion.</td>', 'This is a really great reflection, but the symmetry is just a little off.  The whole image seems like it needs to be shifted up slightly and tilted clockwise about 1 degree, though the latter part may just be an optical illusion.', '2002-12-01 23:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
