(161893, 8847, 5044, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for the votes, and for the words of encouragement. <br/><br/>For those who mentioned that it was not on topic, please note that the challenge description stated that it was for a newpaper or MAGAZINE covers. So, that pretty much opened the topic up to just about anything. Mine was destined for National Geographic or something like Fog Monthly. <br/><br/>Thanks again.</td>', 'Thank you all for the votes, and for the words of encouragement. For those who mentioned that it was not on topic, please note that the challenge description stated that it was for a newpaper or MAGAZINE covers. So, that pretty much opened the topic up to just about anything. Mine was destined for National Geographic or something like Fog Monthly. Thanks again.', '2002-12-02 00:48:00.000000', NULL, 0),
