(161907, 8849, 3317, '<td valign="top">so this one time somebody''s digital challenge photo included a social security number, somebody''s tax forms... this one includes a name and phone number... if that was my number on the internet i''d be a little nervous. nice shot though.</td>', 'so this one time somebody''s digital challenge photo included a social security number, somebody''s tax forms... this one includes a name and phone number... if that was my number on the internet i''d be a little nervous. nice shot though.', '2002-11-27 21:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
