(161917, 8850, 4648, '<td valign="top">Beautiful llama and is that a sucker in the kids mouth.  I can''t see his face but I get the feeling he is such a cute kid from the side view.  I love animal stories.  This is a very good photo, also.  Good colors, Great cmposition with real good execution.  Nice crop with good depth.  Is is an umcoming animal show or a human interest story about the kid visiting the farm?  I''ll read it to find out.  Great job.  PTL8</td>', 'Beautiful llama and is that a sucker in the kids mouth.  I can''t see his face but I get the feeling he is such a cute kid from the side view.  I love animal stories.  This is a very good photo, also.  Good colors, Great cmposition with real good execution.  Nice crop with good depth.  Is is an umcoming animal show or a human interest story about the kid visiting the farm?  I''ll read it to find out.  Great job.  PTL8', '2002-11-26 20:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
