(162025, 8855, 3080, '<td valign="top">I wish you had been able  to get the entire head of the back goose into the shot.  Otherwise, it''s a very nice photo.  Clarity and focus are both nice.  Lighting might be just a tad harsh on the front gooses neck, and the back goose, near the water.  Nice shot. good luck in the challenge. ~Heather~</td>', 'I wish you had been able  to get the entire head of the back goose into the shot.  Otherwise, it''s a very nice photo.  Clarity and focus are both nice.  Lighting might be just a tad harsh on the front gooses neck, and the back goose, near the water.  Nice shot. good luck in the challenge. ~Heather~', '2002-11-30 12:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
