(162027, 8855, 554, '<td valign="top">Very nice, except for the goose in the background</td>', 'Very nice, except for the goose in the background', '2002-11-30 17:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162028, 8855, 4648, '<td valign="top">That is one of the most beautiful shots of this duck that I have ever seen, but bad execution of the picture.  You really should have taken it at another time or angle so you only had this one bird in the shot, with or without the lake behind him.  If you couldn''t get that you should have left the whole duck in the background.  You cut his head off.  If it was for size you could have cut some off in front of the big bird - anything to keep from cutting the head off.  Preferably, without the other one at all, unless it was the other sex and would have shown the differences in their heads.  Sorry that you ruined a really great top notch photo.  I''d like to copy it and cut the other bird out totally, with dpc unacceptable work.  Any objection, other than to my score of 6.  PTL</td>', 'That is one of the most beautiful shots of this duck that I have ever seen, but bad execution of the picture.  You really should have taken it at another time or angle so you only had this one bird in the shot, with or without the lake behind him.  If you couldn''t get that you should have left the whole duck in the background.  You cut his head off.  If it was for size you could have cut some off in front of the big bird - anything to keep from cutting the head off.  Preferably, without the other one at all, unless it was the other sex and would have shown the differences in their heads.  Sorry that you ruined a really great top notch photo.  I''d like to copy it and cut the other bird out totally, with dpc unacceptable work.  Any objection, other than to my score of 6.  PTL', '2002-12-01 14:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
