(162080, 8857, 5070, '<td valign="top">You have a great sense of humor.</td>', 'You have a great sense of humor.', '2002-11-30 19:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162081, 8857, 4648, '<td valign="top">B&amp;W worked against you here - it''s so grey it is almost faded into one solid rock.  Needed to be in color, and or darker to bring out the individual "pets".  PTL3</td>', 'B&W worked against you here - it''s so grey it is almost faded into one solid rock.  Needed to be in color, and or darker to bring out the individual "pets".  PTL3', '2002-12-01 18:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162082, 8857, 5455, '<td valign="top">not even funny</td>', 'not even funny', '2002-12-01 19:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162083, 8858, 4967, '<td valign="top">Good subject, however a photojournalist would try to focus on one - three subjects, and bring them more into the picture... It''s tough to take low-light football, nice try!</td>', 'Good subject, however a photojournalist would try to focus on one - three subjects, and bring them more into the picture... It''s tough to take low-light football, nice try!', '2002-11-25 00:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162084, 8858, 4615, '<td valign="top">Great action and lots of drama.  Shame about the exposure, but thats NOTthe big issue in this challenge.  Good job!</td>', 'Great action and lots of drama.  Shame about the exposure, but thats NOTthe big issue in this challenge.  Good job!', '2002-11-25 09:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162085, 8858, 327, '<td valign="top">Neat shooting. Justine</td>', 'Neat shooting. Justine', '2002-11-25 16:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162086, 8858, 5120, '<td valign="top">Those lights in the background are a bit distracting, you might try cropping them out and seeing how it looks.  Also there isnt any strong focal point for me in this one.  Maybe if you zoomed in on one or two players it might be better?<br/><br/>Greg<br/></td>', 'Those lights in the background are a bit distracting, you might try cropping them out and seeing how it looks.  Also there isnt any strong focal point for me in this one.  Maybe if you zoomed in on one or two players it might be better?Greg', '2002-11-25 19:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162087, 8858, 2716, '<td valign="top">I like the mix of still players and players in motion.  jacko  8</td>', 'I like the mix of still players and players in motion.  jacko  8', '2002-11-25 20:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162088, 8858, 4585, '<td valign="top">I would have cropped out the lights..</td>', 'I would have cropped out the lights..', '2002-11-25 21:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
