(162115, 8860, 4648, '<td valign="top">What an expression.  Nice subject and composition.  Good execution.  Beautiful background - in my opinion adds to the whole photo.  The girl by herself is a good portrait.  The girl with the background is a great photograph with depth to it.  This a a good work of art.  PTL9</td>', 'What an expression.  Nice subject and composition.  Good execution.  Beautiful background - in my opinion adds to the whole photo.  The girl by herself is a good portrait.  The girl with the background is a great photograph with depth to it.  This a a good work of art.  PTL9', '2002-11-25 22:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
