(162128, 8860, 3730, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favs this week....great story photo...wish there was a bit more light, and she was closer to the right of the frame....9 - zadore</td>', 'This is one of my favs this week....great story photo...wish there was a bit more light, and she was closer to the right of the frame....9 - zadore', '2002-12-01 09:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162129, 8860, 472, '<td valign="top">i thought this was excellent.</td>', 'i thought this was excellent.', '2002-12-02 21:17:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(162130, 8860, 5086, '<td valign="top">Thank you very much everyone.  This was a last minute Sunday shot...  the causeway, beneath the Empress where the buskers and craftpeople hang out.  The sun had just gone down and it was really chilly after a beautiful sunny day, so we decided to go grab a coffee.  Passed this little girl and had to stop for a picture.  Her mom and sister were standing beside her.  The sister had also played, and this little angel had been playing for about 10 minutes.  She was cold and just about to stop and go home... her little fingers were all pink.  I don''t believe the children were down on their luck, or having to play...  from talking to the mom, and seeing the 3 together I think it was simply an opportunity to play in public.  And yes Turbotec i defiinitely tipped her, actually stood and talked for a while as there were very few people on the causeway at that late time.</td>', 'Thank you very much everyone.  This was a last minute Sunday shot...  the causeway, beneath the Empress where the buskers and craftpeople hang out.  The sun had just gone down and it was really chilly after a beautiful sunny day, so we decided to go grab a coffee.  Passed this little girl and had to stop for a picture.  Her mom and sister were standing beside her.  The sister had also played, and this little angel had been playing for about 10 minutes.  She was cold and just about to stop and go home... her little fingers were all pink.  I don''t believe the children were down on their luck, or having to play...  from talking to the mom, and seeing the 3 together I think it was simply an opportunity to play in public.  And yes Turbotec i defiinitely tipped her, actually stood and talked for a while as there were very few people on the causeway at that late time.', '2002-12-03 01:11:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(162131, 8861, 4482, '<td valign="top">doesn''t look like much of a grand openning to me... where is every body. No journalisti impact here even though the pic is good. 4</td>', 'doesn''t look like much of a grand openning to me... where is every body. No journalisti impact here even though the pic is good. 4', '2002-11-25 11:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(162132, 8861, 3719, '<td valign="top">Cool shot</td>', 'Cool shot', '2002-11-25 11:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
