(162134, 8861, 327, '<td valign="top">Neat idea, and cute little mall. Might of been closer for my liking. Still your on topic. Good eye. Justine</td>', 'Neat idea, and cute little mall. Might of been closer for my liking. Still your on topic. Good eye. Justine', '2002-11-25 16:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
