(162141, 8861, 3540, '<td valign="top">This photo needs something, like a thousand people on the outside waiting to get in.  As far as grand openings go, this looks more like a regular day.  The people being there would make it a whole lot more newspaper worthy - Inspzil</td>', 'This photo needs something, like a thousand people on the outside waiting to get in.  As far as grand openings go, this looks more like a regular day.  The people being there would make it a whole lot more newspaper worthy - Inspzil', '2002-11-29 05:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
